<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">- Ngoni Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Utumbula</para>
  <para style="toc1">Utumbula</para>
  <para style="toc2">Utu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Utum</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chitabu cha utumbula</para>
  <para style="mt1">Utumbula</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Chenichi ndi chitabu cha kutumbula Mubibilia ndi chikemelewa “Utumbula” ndi chitabu cha kutumbula mulilaganu la kadeni mu Bibilia. Chitabu ichi chilangisa vindu vyoha vihumili kwoki na Chapanga cheavahengili vandu. Vasomi magono aga vana maholo gamahele ndalindali ndava ya mundu au vandu vevachiyandiki chitabu ich cha Utumbula, na ndi lukumbi lwoki chitabu ichi chayandikwi. Vavi veviholalela kuvya chitabu ichi chayandikwi kuhuma mumayandiku ga kadeni mulukumbi pagati ya kaline ya 5 mbaka ya 6 kwakona Kilisitu angavelekewa. Vangi viyidakila kwandava ya mambu gevagapokili na gegiyidakiliwa na vandu vamahele kuvya Musa ndi ayandiki chitabu cha Utumbula, mewa ayandiki vitabu vingi vya Kuhuma na Mambu ga Valawi na Uvalangu na Kumbukumbu ya malagizu pagati ya miyaka ya elufu yimonga na miya hidatu amala elufu yimonga na miya mcheche kwakona Kilisitu angavelekewa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Utumbula china mambu gabwina neju gegakuvatangatila Vakilisitu kumanya mambu gangi goha gegavi mu Bibilia, yivya Mulilaganu la Kadeni amalaa la Mupya. Chitabu cha Utumbula chikutilangisa namuna kumbudila Chapanga chekwayingili pamulima, na namuna vandu voha chevakumugana Msangula. Chitabu ichi mewa chikuuvika pawaka mupangu wa Chapanga wa kuvasangula vandu. Lenili lihotola kulolekana muulota wa kutumbula wewilongela kumvala Yesu Utumbula 3:15, na lilaganu la Chapanga kwa Abulahamu la kuvamotisa vandu voha va pamulima Utumbula 12:3</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegavii</para>
  <para style="io">Chapanga awumbili mulima, na mewa avawumbili Adamu na Eva ngati cheyikokoswa mu sula ya 1 na ya 2</para>
  <para style="io">Sula ya 3 mbaka ya 5 yikuvakokosa Adamu na Eva, kumubudila kwavi Chapanga, na viveleku vyavi.</para>
  <para style="io">Sura ya 6 mbaka ya 9 yikumukokosa Nuhu na mambu ga manji gakulu gamahele gegagubiki mulima</para>
  <para style="io">Pagenago chitabu cha Utumbula chikokosa chila chechahumalili pagati ya lusenje lwa Nuhu na lula lwa Abulahamu, yikokosa pamonga na munala wa Babeli musula ya 10 na ya 11</para>
  <para style="io">Sula ya 12 mbaka ya 50 zikumuvala Abulahamu na nyumba yaki na utumbukanu wa vandu vaku Isilaeli. Kutama kwa Abulahamu na Sala mdala waki gikokoswa kuhuma musula ya 12 mbaka ya 25. Kutama kwa Isaka na Lebeka mdala waki gikokoswa kuhuma musula ya 21 mbaka ya 28 na kufwa kwaki kukokoswa musula ya 35. Kutama kwa Yakobo na vana vaki gikokoswa kuhuma musula ya 25 mbaka 50. Sura ya 37 mbaka ya 50 yimemili mambu ga Yosefu, mwana wa chiganu wa Yakobo, na namuna cheabwelili kukitiwa kuvya mtalalila wa mulima wa Misili.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1" />
  <para style="s">Kuwumbwa kwa Mulima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1" />Penapo pakutumbula Chapanga awumbili kunani na mulima. <verse eid="GEN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2" />Lukumbi lwenulo mulima wavii lepi ngati hinu na yangapambika. Kwavii na chitita chivaha chaugubiki manji geganyoliki gegagubiki mulima na Mpungu wa Chapanga ukayuvata panani ya manji. <verse eid="GEN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3" />Penapo Chapanga akajova, “Luvya lumuli.” Ndi lumuli lukavya. <verse eid="GEN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4" />Chapanga akalola kuvya lumuli lwabwina. Ndi akabagula lumuli na chitita. <verse eid="GEN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5" />Mwene akakemela lumuli, “Muhi” na chitita “Kilu.” Yikavya kimihi yikavya lukela, ligono la kutumbula.<verse eid="GEN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6" />Chapanga akajova, “Pavyayi na fwasi pagati ya manji kunani na manji ga pahi, gabagula manji kunani na manji pahi.” <verse eid="GEN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7" />Kangi Chapanga akakita fwasi muni yibagula manji gegavili kunani ya fwasi yeniyo na pahi ya fwasi yeniyo. Yikavya chenicho. <verse eid="GEN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8" />Chapanga akayikemela fwasi yeniyo “Kunani kwa Chapanga.” Yikavya kimihi yikavya lukela, ligono la pili.<verse eid="GEN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9" />Chapanga akajova, “Manji gegavili pahi ya fwasi yeniyo gayolana pandu pamonga na pandu payumu pawonekana.” Yikavya chenicho. <verse eid="GEN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10" />Chapanga akakemela pandu payumu, “Ndima,” Na makonganu ga manji gala akakemela, “Nyanja yivaha.” Chapanga akalola kuvya chabwina. <verse eid="GEN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11" />Kangi akajova, “Ndima yimelesayi manyahi gegipambika mbeyu na mikongo yeyipambika matunda ndalindali gegana mbeyu,” Yikavya chenicho. <verse eid="GEN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12" />Ndima yikamelesa manyahi, gegipambika mbeyu ndalindali na mikongo yeyipambika matunda gegana mbeyu ndalindali. Chapanga akalola kuvya ndi chabwina. <verse eid="GEN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13" />Yikavya kimihi yikavya lukela, ligono la datu.<verse eid="GEN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14" />Chapanga akajova, “Kuvya na milumuli kunani lubagula muhi na kilu, wenuwu ndi uvyayi ulangisu wa kulangisa lukumbi na lusenje na magono na miyaka, <verse eid="GEN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15" />ndi viyaka kunani na vilangasa mulima.” Yikavya chenicho. <verse eid="GEN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16" />Chapanga, akakita milumuli yivaha yivili, lumuli luvaha ndi lilanga litalalilayi muhi na lumuli ludebe ndi mwehi lutalalilayi kilu, akawumba na ndondo. <verse eid="GEN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17" />Chapanga akahivika milumuli yeniyo kufwasi ya kunani kulihundi muni yilangasa mulima, <verse eid="GEN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18" />yitalalila muhi na kilu, na lubagula muhi na chitita. Chapanga akalola kuvya ndi chabwina. <verse eid="GEN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19" />Yikavya kimihi, yikavya lukela, ligono la mcheche.<verse eid="GEN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20" />Chapanga akajova, “Mumanji muvyayi na viumbi mumi vyamahele na videge vimbululuka kunani.” <verse eid="GEN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21" />Ndi Chapanga akawumba viumbi vivaha vya munyanja yivaha na viumbi vingi vyoha ndalindali vyevitama mumi mumanji, na videge ndalindali vyevimbululuka, Chapanga akalola kuvya ndi chabwina. <verse eid="GEN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22" />Chapanga akavimotisa, akajova, “Muveleka, muyonjosekayi mugamemesayi manji ga nyanja yivaha, na videge viyonjosekayi pamulima.” <verse eid="GEN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23" />Yikavya kimihi yikavya lukela, ligono la mhanu.<verse eid="GEN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24" />Chapanga akajova, “Ndima viumbi mumi ndalindali, hinyama ya kudimwa na hinyama ya kudahi na viumbi ndalindali vyevikwava.” Yikavya chenicho. <verse eid="GEN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25" />Ndi Chapanga, akawumba vinyama vyoha ndalindali vya kudahi, ya kudimwa ndalindali na viumbi vyoha ndalindali vyevikwava pandima. Chapanga akalola kuvya ndi chabwina.<verse eid="GEN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26" />Kangi akajova, “Timuwumba mundu kwa luhumu lwitu, ngati chetivili tete, vakatalalila somba za munyanja yivaha na videge vya kunani na hinyama yoha ya kudimwa na mulima woha na viumbi vyoha vyevivikwava.”<verse eid="GEN 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27" />Ndi Chapanga akamuwumba mundu, kwa luhumu lwaki, avawumbili ngati cheavi mwene, amuwumbili mgosi na mdala.<verse eid="GEN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28" />Chapanga akavamotisa na kuvajovela, “Mvelekayi vana muyonjosekayi, mukaumemesa mulima uvya winu, muzitalalila somba ya munyanja yivaha, hidege vya kunani, na kila chiumbi chechivii na wumi chechigenda pandima.”<verse eid="GEN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29" />Kangi Chapanga akajova, “Yuwanila, nivapeli kila chechimelili pamulima chechivi na mbeyu, na kila mkongo wewipambika matunda gegavi na mbeyu, ndi yati vivya vyakulya vinu. <verse eid="GEN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30" />Na hinyama yoha ya pamulima na videge vyoha na viumbi vyoha vyevikwava, kila chiumbi chechivi na wumi, vyakulya vyaki yati givya mahamba.” Yikavya chenicho. <verse eid="GEN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31" />Chapanga akalola kila chindu cheachikitili ndi chabwina neju. Yikavya kimihi yikavya lukela, ligono la sita.<verse eid="GEN 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1" />Ndi kunani kwa Chapanga na mlima zamalisiki kuwumbwa, pamonga na vindu vyaki vyoha vyevivili mugati yaki. <verse eid="GEN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2" />Pa ligono la saba Chapanga amalili mahengu geahengayi, ndi paligono la saba akapumulila ndava ya mahengu genago geahengili. <verse eid="GEN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3" />Chapanga akalimotisa ligono la saba livyaa la Msopi. Muni ligono lenil Chapanga apumulili ndava ya amalili mahengu goha ga uwumbaji. <verse eid="GEN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4" />Chenicho ndi cheyawumbiki kunani kwa Chapanga na mulima.<verse eid="GEN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lidimba la Edeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5" />Lukumbi lwenulo gavili lepi manyahi gegamelili pandima amala mikongo yeyamelili, ndava Bambu Chapanga atonyisi lepi fula pamulima, mewa avi lepi mundu wa kulima. <verse eid="GEN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6" />Nambu manji gahumalili pandima na kutepetesa ludaka.<verse eid="GEN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga akumuwumba mundu kwa muludaka, akampulila lukeka lwa wumi mumeng'elu, na mundu mwenuyo akavya mumi.<verse eid="GEN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8" />Penapo Bambu Chapanga akamelesa mikongo mulidimba upandi walihumila lilanga ku Edeni, na akamuvika mundu mweamuwumbili mulidimba lenilo. <verse eid="GEN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9" />Bambu Chapanga akamelesa pandima yeniyo mikongo yabwina yeyinogesa kuyilola ndalindali yeipambika matunda gegiganikiwa kwa chakulya. Pagati ya lidimba lenilo kwavili na mkongo wa wumi na mkongo wa kumanya gabwina na gahakau.<verse eid="GEN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10" />Kwavili na mfuleni wewaletili manji na kuyitalila kulidimba, kuhumila penapo mfuleni wenuo wagavaniki mifuleni mcheche. <verse eid="GEN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11" />Lihina la mfuleni wa kutumbula ndi Pishoni, ndi wewitindila mulima woha wa Havila na ndi kwekuvi na zahabu. <verse eid="GEN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12" />Zahabu ya mulima wula yavili yabwina neju. Kwenuko mewa kuna mahuta geginungalila neju maganga ga feza gamahele. <verse eid="GEN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13" />Lihina la mfuleni wa pili ndi Gihoni, ndi weutindila mulima woha wa Kushi. <verse eid="GEN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14" />Lihina la mfuleni wa datu ndi Tigilisi, ndi weupita upandi welihumila lilanga wa mulima wa Ashulu, na lihina la mfuleni wa mcheche ndi Fulati.<verse eid="GEN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15" />Ndi Bambu Chapanga akamtola mundu mgosi mwenuyo, akamuvika mulidimba la Edeni, aligaba na kuiyangalila. <verse eid="GEN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16" />Bambu Chapanga akamlagiza mundu mgosi mwenuyo, akamjovela “Uhotola kulya matunda ga mkongo wowoha mulidimba, <verse eid="GEN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17" />nambu matunda ga mkongo wa kumanya gabwina na gahakau, ukoto kulya, ndava muni ligono leulyayi matunda ga mkongo wenuwo, chakaka yati wifya.”<verse eid="GEN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18" />Bambu Chapanga akajova, “Chabwina lepi mundu uyu kutama mwene. Yati nimkitila mundu mweawanini nayu.” <verse eid="GEN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19" />Ndi Bambu Chapanga akakita kuhuma muludaka kila chinyama cha kudahi, na kila chidege cha kunani, akamletela Adamu nambu alola yati akuhikemela wuli, na mahina geahikemili Adamu ndi gavii mahina gavi. <verse eid="GEN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20" />Adamu akahipela mahina gavi kila chinyama cha kudimwa, na ya kudahi na hidege, nambu awonikini lepi mundu mweawanini nayu.<verse eid="GEN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21" />Bambu Chapanga akamletela Adamu lugono, ndi akagona tipitipi, peagonili akamuwusa luvafu lwaki lumonga na kupagubika kavili pandu pala kwa nyama. <verse eid="GEN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22" />Kuhuma muluvafu lwenulo lwealuwusili kwa Adamu, Bambu Chapanga akamuwumba mundu mdala, na akamuleta kwa Adamu. <verse eid="GEN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23" />Adamu akajova,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">“Hinu mwenuyu ndi lihupa mumahupa gangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">Na nyama munyama yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">Mwenuyo yati ikemelewa ‘mdala’ Muni ahumili muhiga ya mgosi.”<verse eid="GEN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24" />Ndava yeniyo mgosi yati akumleka dadi waki na nyina waki na yati iwungana na mdala waki, na vene yati vivya higa yimonga.<verse eid="GEN 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25" />Adamu na mdala waki voha vavii waka, nambu vawonili lepi soni.<verse eid="GEN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3" />
  <para style="s">Mundu ileka kumuyidakila Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1" />Nambu, pagati ya vinyama vyeawumbili Chapanga liyoka lavi lichenjelanu neju kuliku vinyama vingi vyoha vya kudahi. Ndi liyoka likamujovela mdala mwenuyo, “Wu, Bambu Chapanga ajovili, ‘Katu mukoto kulya matunda ga mkongo wowoha wa mulidimba?’ ”<verse eid="GEN 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2" />Mdala akaliyangula liyoka, “Tihotola kulya matunda ga mikongo yoha ya mulidimba, <verse eid="GEN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3" />nambu matunda ga mmkongo weuvili pagati ya lidimba Chapanga ajovili, ‘Mkoto kulya hati kugapamisa, yati mwifwa.’”<verse eid="GEN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4" />Liyoka likamyangula mdala, “Chakaka yati mwifa lepi. <verse eid="GEN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5" />Chapanga ajovili chenicho ndava amanyili kuvya ligono mukalyayi matunda ga mkongo wenuwo yati mudinduliwa mihu, na nyenye yati mwivya ngati Chapanga, yati mukugamanya gabwina na gahakau.”<verse eid="GEN 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6" />Mdala peauweni mkongo wula unamatunda gabwina kwa chakulya, na kwa kulolekana unyambili, na wabwina kwa kuleta umanya, ndi akayava litunda laki, akalya na akampela na mngwana waki mweavii naku, mewawa na mwene akalya. <verse eid="GEN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7" />Bahapo pevamalili kulya litunda, vakajimanya kuvya vavii waka, hinu vakajitotela mahamba ga mkongo weukemiwa mtini, vakawala.<verse eid="GEN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8" />Kimihi vakayuwana chigigi cha Bambu Chapanga igenda mulidimba, Adamu na mdala waki vakamuyuvalila Chapanga mumikongo ya mulidimba. <verse eid="GEN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9" />Nambu Bambu Chapanga akamkemela Adamu, “Uvi koki?”<verse eid="GEN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10" />Mwene akayangula, “Nikayuwini chigigi chaku mulidimba, ndi nikayogopa na nikayuvalila, muni nivi waka.”<verse eid="GEN 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11" />Bambu Chapanga akakota, “Yani mweakujovili kuvya veve uvi waka. Wu ulili matunda genikujovili ukoto kulya?”<verse eid="GEN 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12" />Mundu yula kajova, “Mdala mweunipelili avyayi pamonga na nene ndi mweanipelili litunda la mkongo wenuwo, na nene nikalya.”<verse eid="GEN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13" />Bambu Chapanga akamkota mdala, “Ndava kyani ukitili naha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 3:13">Mwene akayangula, “Liyoka linikongili na nene nikalya.”<verse eid="GEN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chapanga akuvaluhulila mbunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga akalijovela liyoka, “Ndava muni ukitili chenichi, unalikoto kuliku hinyama hingi yoha ya kudimwa na ya kudahi, yati ukwava kwa lutumbu, na chakulya chaku chivya lububu magono goha ga wumi waku. <verse eid="GEN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15" />Yati nivika ulikoko pagati yaku na mdala, na pagati ya chiveleku chaku na cha mdala, mwene yati akubonde mutu waku na veve yati ukumukong'onda chinjekenjeke.”<verse eid="GEN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16" />Kangi akamjovela mdala, “Yati nikuyonjokesela lipyanda laku la kuveleka, kwa mvinisu yati uveleka vana. Mewawa yati wigana kuvya na mngwana waku lukumbi lwoha na mwene yati akutalalila.”<verse eid="GEN 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17" />Kangi akamjovela Adamu, “Ndava muni umuyuwani mdala waku, ukalya matunda ga mkongo wenikubesili ukoto kulya, kwa kubuda kwaku ndima yipewi likoto ndava yaku. Yati wipata chakulya chaku kwa mwasi, magono goha ga wumi waku. <verse eid="GEN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18" />Ndima yati yipambika minga na masongolelu, na veve yati ulya makolo kuhuma kumgunda. <verse eid="GEN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19" />Kwa mwasi waku yati ukuyikita ndima yikupela chakulya, mbaka peukuyiwuyilayi ndima yeuhumalili, muni veve ndi ludaka na muludaka yati wiwuya.”<verse eid="GEN 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20" />Adamu akampela mdala waki lihina “Eva,” Ndava muni ndi mau wa vandu voha. <verse eid="GEN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21" />Bambu Chapanga akavakitila nyula ya chikumba Adamu na mdala waki, akavawalika.<verse eid="GEN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adamu na Eva vivingiwa mulidimba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga akajova, “Hinu mundu uyu avii ngati tete, agamanyili gabwina na gahakau. Yiganikiwa kumdivalila akoto kuyava litunda la mkongo wa wumi, muni akalyayi yati ivya mumi magono goha gangali mwishu.” <verse eid="GEN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23" />Ndi Bambu Chapanga akamuvinga patali na lidimba la Edeni, muni alimayi ndima yeyahengiki kumuwumba. <verse eid="GEN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24" />Peamalili kumvinga Adamu mulidimba, akavika chiumbi chechivi na magwaba chechikemelewa kelubi upandi welihumila lilanga wa lidimba la Edeni chechikamwili upanga wa motu weutindila pandi zoha, kuyiyangalila njila yeyihamba kumkongo wa wumi.<verse eid="GEN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4" />
  <para style="s">Kaini na Abeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1" />Adamu akagona na Eva mdala waki, Eva akapata ndumbu, akamveleka mwana mgosi mweamkemili Kaini, Eva akajova nipatili mwana kwa utangatila wa Bambu. <verse eid="GEN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2" />Kangi akamveleka mwana yungi wa chigosi akamkemela Abeli. Abeli avii mdima mambelele na Kaini avii mlimaji. <verse eid="GEN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3" />Ligono limonga, Kaini akaleta luteta kwa Chapanga lwa mabenu ga mumgunda. <verse eid="GEN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4" />Abeli na mwene akaleta hiveleku ya kutumbula ya hinyama yaki yehikulupalili akawusa luteta. Chapanga akaganiswa na Abeli na luluteta zaki, <verse eid="GEN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5" />nambu Chapanga aganiswi lepi na Kaini hati teta zaki. Kaini akayoma neju, kumihu kwaki kukakwinyana cha ligoga. <verse eid="GEN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6" />Bambu akamjovela Kaini, “Ndava kyani uvii na ligoga naha? Ndava kyani kumihu kwaku kukwinyini cha ligoga? <verse eid="GEN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7" />Wu, ukakitayi bwina yati uyidakiliwa lepi? Ngati wangakita bwina kumbudila Chapanga kukulindila pamlyangu, kugana kukukamula, nambu uganikiwa ukuhotola.”<verse eid="GEN 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8" />Kaini akamjovela Abeli mlongo waki, “Tihamba kumgunda.” Ndi, pevavii kumgunda, Kaini akamzangila mlongo waki, akamkoma.<verse eid="GEN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9" />Bambu akamkota Kaini, “Avii koki mlongo waku Abeli?” Kaini akayangula, “Nene nimanyi lepi! Wu, nene namulonda wa mlongo wangu?”<verse eid="GEN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10" />Bambu akajova, “Ukitili kyani? Lwami lwa ngasi ya mlongo waku lukinivembela kuhuma pandima. <verse eid="GEN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11" />Hinu, upewili likoto! Na kuvingiwa kuhuma mundima yeyinywili ngasi ya mlongo wako ndi yeyidindwili mulomo kuyipokela ngasi yeniyo ya molongo waku mweumkomili. <verse eid="GEN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12" />Ukayilimayi ndima, yati yikupela lepi mabenu gaki. Yati uvya wamundu wa kulyunga lyunga, wangali pandu pa kutama pamulima.”<verse eid="GEN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13" />Kaini akamjovela Bambu, “Mbunu wenuwu weunipelili livaha neju, nene nikulihotola lepi. <verse eid="GEN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14" />Lola, lelu univingili niwukayi pandima uwu na nivya patali na veve, na nene yati nivya na mundu wa kulyunga lyunga, mweangali pandu pa kutama pamulima, na mundu yoyoha mweakunilola yati akunikoma.”<verse eid="GEN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15" />Bambu akamyangula, “Lepi. Ngati mundu yoyoha akakukomayi veve, yati ing'aiswa mala saba neju.” Ndi Bambu akamuvika Kaini ulangisu ndava kila mundu mweakumlola Kaini akoto kumukoma. <verse eid="GEN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16" />Ndi Kaini akawuka palongolo ya Bambu, akatama pamulima weukemelewa Nodi, weuvii upandi welihumila lilanga wa Edeni.<verse eid="GEN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Viveleku vya Kaini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17" />Kaini akagona na mdala waki ndi akapata ndumbu vakaveleka mwana lihina laki Enoki. Kaini akajenga mulima na akaukemela Enoki lihina la mwana waki. <verse eid="GEN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18" />Enoki akaveleka mwana mgosi akamkemela Iladi, na Iladi akamuveleka Mehuyaeli, Mehuyaeli akamuveleka Mesushaeli, Mesushaeli akamuveleka Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19" />Lameki agegili vadala vavii, mmonga lihina laki Ada na yungi ndi Sila. <verse eid="GEN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20" />Ada akamveleka Yabali, mwenuyo ndi dadi wa vadimaji vevitama mumandanda. <verse eid="GEN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21" />Mhaja waki ikemelewa Yubali, mwenuyo ndi avili dadi wa voha vevitova kanjeke na chitolilo. <verse eid="GEN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22" />Mewa Sila akamveleka Tubal Kaini, mweana lufumbu lwa vindu vya shaba na chuma. Naama avii mlumbu wa Tubal Kaini.<verse eid="GEN 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23" />Lameki akavajovela vadala vaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">“Nyenye mwavadala vangu Ada na Sila muniyuwanila genikuvajovela. Namkomili mundu ndava anilemisi, ena namkomili msongolo mwenuyu muni anivinisi.<verse eid="GEN 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24" />Ngati Kaini yati ing'aiswa mala saba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:24">Chakaka Lameki yati ing'aiswa mala sabini na saba.”<verse eid="GEN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sesi na Enoki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25" />Adamu akagona kangi na mdala waki, akaveleka mwana, akamkemela Sesi, “Chapanga anipelili mwana pahala pa Abeli mweakomiwi na Kaini.” <verse eid="GEN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26" />Sesi mewa akaveleka mwana mgosi akamkemela Enoki. Penapo ndi vandu pevatumbwili kumuyupa Bambu.<verse eid="GEN 4:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5" />
  <para style="s">Viveleku vya Adamu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:1-4">1 Lus 1:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1" />Genago ndi mahina ga viveleku vya Adamu ngati chegayandikwi. Ligono lila Chapanga peamuwumbili mundu kwa luhumu lwaki. <verse eid="GEN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2" />avawumbili ngati cheavi mwene, amuwumbili mgosi na mdala, kangi akavamotisa na kavapela lihina “Vandu.” <verse eid="GEN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3" />Adamu peavii na miyaka miya yimonga na selasini, akaveleka mwana mweawanini naku mweavili ngati mwene, akamkemela Sesi. <verse eid="GEN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4" />Peamalili kumveleka Sesi, Adamu akatama miyaka miya nane, ndi akaveleka vana vagosi na vadala. <verse eid="GEN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5" />Miyaka yoha yeatamili Adamu yavi miya tisa na selasini ndi afwili.<verse eid="GEN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6" />Sesi peavili na miyaka miya yimonga na mhanu, akamveleka mwana mgosi akamkemela Enoki. <verse eid="GEN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7" />Sesi akatama miyaka miya nane na saba, akaveleka vana, vagosi na vadala. <verse eid="GEN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8" />Miyaka yoha yeatamili Sesi yavili miya tisa na kumi na yivili ndi afwili.<verse eid="GEN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9" />Enoki peavili na miyaka tisini, akamveleka Kenani. <verse eid="GEN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10" />Peamalili kumveleka Kenani, Enoki akatama miyaka miya nane na kumi na mhanu, ndi akavya na vana vagosi na vadala. <verse eid="GEN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11" />Miyaka yoha yeatamili Enoki yavili miyaka miya tisa na mhanu ndi afwili.<verse eid="GEN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12" />Na Kenani peavili na miyaka sabini, ndi akamveleka Mahalaleli. <verse eid="GEN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13" />Peamalili kumveleka Mahalaleli, Kenani akatama miyaka miya nane na alubaini, akaveleka vana vagosi na vadala. <verse eid="GEN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14" />Miyaka yoha yeatamili Kenani yavili miyaka miya tisa na kumi ndi afwili.<verse eid="GEN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15" />Mahalaleli peavili miyaka sitini na mhanu, ndi akamveleka Yaledi. <verse eid="GEN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16" />Peamalili kumveleka Yaledi, Mahalaleli akatama miyaka miya nane na selasini, akaveleka vana vagosi na vadala. <verse eid="GEN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17" />Miyaka yoha yeatamili Mahalaleli yavili miya nane tisini na mhanu, ndi afwili.<verse eid="GEN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18" />Yaledi peavili na miyaka miya yimonga sitini na yivili, ndi akamveleka Enoki. <verse eid="GEN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19" />Peamali kumveleka Enoki, Yaledi akatama miyaka miya nane, na mwene akavya na vana vagosi na vadala. <verse eid="GEN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20" />Miyaka yoha yeatamili Yeledi yavili miya tisa sitini na yivili ndi afwili.<verse eid="GEN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21" />Enoki peavili na miyaka sitini na mhanu, ndi akamveleka Metusela. <verse eid="GEN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22" />Enoki atamili kwa kumganisa Chapanga. Peamalili kumveleka Metusela, akatama miyaka miya yidatu na akaveleka vana vagosi na vadala. <verse eid="GEN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23" />Miyaka yoha yeatamili Enoki yavili miya yidatu sitini na mhanu. <verse eid="GEN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24" />Enoki atamili kwa kumganisa Chapanga, ndi awonikini lepi kavili, ndava Chapanga amtolili.<verse eid="GEN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25" />Lukumbi Metusela peavili na miyaka miya yimonga semanini na saba, ndi akamveleka Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26" />Peamalili kumveleka Lameki, Metusela atamili miyaka miya saba semanini na yivili ndi akaveleka vana vagosi na vadala. <verse eid="GEN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27" />Miyaka yoha yeatamili Metusela yavili miyaka miya tisa na sitini na tisa ndi afwili.<verse eid="GEN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28" />Lukumbi Lameki peavili na miyaka miya yimonga semanini na yivili, akaveleka mwana mgosi. <verse eid="GEN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29" />Mwana mwenuyu ndi akamkemela Nuhu, akajova, “Mwenuyu ndi mweakutipolesa mtima kwa lihengu litu na kwa mang'aiso ga mawoko gitu mu ndima yeyipewili likoto na Bambu Chapanga.” <verse eid="GEN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30" />Lameki peamalii kumveleka Nuhu, akatama miyaka miya mhanu tisini na mhanu ndi akaveleka vana vangi vagosi na vadala. <verse eid="GEN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31" />Miyaka yoha yeatamili Lameki yavili miya saba sabini na saba ndi afwili.<verse eid="GEN 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32" />Nuhu peavili na miyaka miya mhanu, akaveleka vana vadatu, Shemu na Hamu na Yafeti.<verse eid="GEN 5:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6" />
  <para style="s">Uhakau wa vandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1" />Vandu pevayonjosiki pamulima, na vasikana kuvelekewa, <verse eid="GEN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2" />vangi va vana vagosi va Chapanga vavaweni vasikana va vandu avo kuvya vabwina, vakavagega vala vevavaganili na kuvya vadala vavi. <verse eid="GEN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3" />Kangi Bambu akajova, “Mpungu wangu yati witama lepi na vandu magono goha, muni mundu ndi wa kufwa ndu. Hinu, yati itama lepi neju ya miyaka miya na ishilini.” <verse eid="GEN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4" />Magono genago na hati magono ga palongolo, kwavili na mivandu jivaha pamulima vevakemiwi Vanefili. Mivandu jivaha, vavelekiwi na vasikana va vandu vevatoliwi na vana va Chapanga. Vanefili vamanyikini neju ndava vavii vakekesi na vandu va ngondo lukumbi lwenulo.<verse eid="GEN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5" />Bambu akalola kuvya uhakau wa vandu wayonjosiki neju pamulima, na lukumbi lwoha mitima yavi yiholalela gahakau ndu. <verse eid="GEN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6" />Chapanga akaviniswa neju mtima ndava amuwumbili mundu pamulima, Chapanga akaviniswa neju mumtima. <verse eid="GEN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7" />Ndava yeniyo Bambu akajova, “Yati nikumuwusa mundu mwenimuwumbili akoto kuvya pamulima, yati niwusa hinyama pamonga na vyevikwava na videge vyevimbuluka. Muni niviniswa ndava kyani naviwumbili.” <verse eid="GEN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8" />Nambu Chapanga aganiswi na Nuhu.<verse eid="GEN 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9" />Vyenivi ndi viveleku vya Nuhu. Nuhu avii mundu mweakumganisa Chapanga, mwene ndu na angahoka pagati ya vandu. Atamili cha kumsadika Chapanga. <verse eid="GEN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10" />Nuhu avili na vana vagosi vadatu. Shemu na Hamu pamonga na Yafeti. <verse eid="GEN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11" />Chapanga alolili mulima uhalabiki na umemili chitututu. <verse eid="GEN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12" />Penapo, Chapanga akaulola mulima, akauwona uhalabiki njwee, muni kila mundu alandili njila yaki yihakau.<verse eid="GEN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13" />Ndava yeniyo Chapanga akamjovela Nuhu, “Yati nikomekesa vandu voha, ndava muni vandu venavo vakohokisi chitututu pamulima. Yati nikomakesa vandu voha pamonga na mulima. <verse eid="GEN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14" />Ujitendelekelayi watu uvaha kwa mbawu zezinonopa na uukemela Safina. Mugati gavanisa vyumba na uyipakayi lami mugati na kuvala. <verse eid="GEN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15" />Chenichi ndi cheukuyitendelekela, utali mita miya yimonga na selasini na muhanu, upana waki mita ishilini na yivili, na utali kuhamba kunani mita kumi na mcheche. <verse eid="GEN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16" />Safina yeniyo yivyai na golofa yidatu na mlyangu uvya kumuhana. Timayi, kangi leka fwasi mita yapinga pagati ya dali na chituvilu. <verse eid="GEN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17" />Yati nimemesa manji gamahele pamulima ndava ya kukoma vyoha vyevii mumi. Kila chechivi mumi pamulima yati chifwa. <verse eid="GEN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18" />Nambu yati nikita lilaganu na veve. Yati uyingila musafina, veve pamonga na mdala waku na vana vaku na vadala vavi. <verse eid="GEN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19" />Yingisayi musafina kila chiumbi chechivi mumi, vivili vivili chigosi na chidala, muni vivya mumi pamonga na veve. <verse eid="GEN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20" />Yati uyingisa videge ndalindali vigosi na vidala na hinyama ndalindali yigosi na yidala na kila chechikwava pandima chigosi na chidala, ndava ya kuvivika mumi. <verse eid="GEN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21" />Mewa utola na vyakulya ndalindali vyeviliwa, uvivika ndava ya chakulya chinu na viumbi vyenivyo.” <verse eid="GEN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22" />Nuhu akakita kila chindu ngati chealagiswi na Chapanga.<verse eid="GEN 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7" />
  <para style="s">Mulima ugubikwa na manji gamahele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1" />Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Nuhu, “Yingilayi musafina veve pamonga na chiveleku chaku choha, muni pagati ya vandu voha vevitama mumi hinu, nikuweni veve ndu ndi mweukuniganisa. <verse eid="GEN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2" />Utola vinyama vyevivili vyabwina palongolo yangu, chigosi na chidala, saba saba. Mewawa tola hinyama yangavya yabwina palongolo yangu, chigosi na chidala chimonga chimonga. <verse eid="GEN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3" />Mewa utola videge saba saba ndalindali vyevivii vyabwina, chigosi na chidala, ndava ya kuvivika mumi pamulima. <verse eid="GEN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4" />Pegimalika magono saba yati nitonyesa fula pamulima magono alubaini muhi na kilu, na kila cheniwumbili chechivii mumi yati nikuchikomakesa.” <verse eid="GEN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5" />Nuhu akakita goha ngati chealagaziwi na Bambu.<verse eid="GEN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6" />Lukumbi manji pegamemili pamulima. Nuhu avii na miyaka miya sita. <verse eid="GEN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7" />Vakayingila musafina Nuhu na mdala waki na vana vaki pamonga na vadala vavi ndava vajisangula na manji gamahele. <verse eid="GEN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8" />Na hinyama yabwina palongolo ya Chapanga na yangavya yabwina na videge na vyoha vyevikwava pandima, <verse eid="GEN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9" />vivili vivili chigosi na chidala, vikayingila musafina pamonga na Nuhu, ngati chealagaziwi na Chapanga. <verse eid="GEN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10" />Pegamaliki magono saba, manji gakamema pamulima.<verse eid="GEN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11" />Nuhu peavii na miyaka miya sita, muligono la kumi na saba la mwehi wa mbili, ligono lenilo vinyepa vyoha mbaka vyehivii pahi neju hikahumisa manji, na kunani kwa Chapanga kukadinduka ngati madilisa na fula yivaha yikatonya. <verse eid="GEN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12" />Fula yikatonya pamulima lukumbi lwa magono alubaini muhi na kilu. <verse eid="GEN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13" />Ligono lilolo fula peyatumbwili kutonya, Nuhu na mdala waki, vana vaki Shemu na Hamu na Yafeti pamonga na vadala vavi vakayingila musafina. <verse eid="GEN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14" />Vene vayingili pamonga na vinyama ndalindali vya kudasi na vinyama vyevidimwa na vyoha vyevyikwava na videge ndalindali. <verse eid="GEN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15" />Viumbi vivili vivili vyoha vyevivi mumi vikabwela kwa Nuhu vikayingili mugati ya safina pamonga na Nuhu. <verse eid="GEN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16" />Vikayingila ngati Chapanga cheamlagizi Nuhu. Kangi Bambu akamdindalila mugati.<verse eid="GEN 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17" />Manji gamahele gakayonjoseka kumema pamulima lukumbi lwa magono alubaini. Manji gakayonjoseka mbaka kuyinyakula safina. <verse eid="GEN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18" />Manji gakayonjoseka neju pamulima na safina yikayevela panani ya manji. <verse eid="GEN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19" />Manji genago gakavya gamahele neju pamulima hati gakagubika vitumbi vitali vyoha vya pamulima. <verse eid="GEN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20" />Manji gakayonjoseka kumema gakagubika hitumbi, utali wa mita saba. <verse eid="GEN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21" />Viumbi vyoha vyevyavili mumi pamulima vikafwa. Videge na hinyama ya kudimwa na hinyama ya mdasi na misambi ya viumbi vyoha vya pandumba na vandu voha vakafwa. <verse eid="GEN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22" />Kila chiumbi chechavili pandumba chechikeka chafwili. <verse eid="GEN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23" />Chapanga avikomili vyoha vyevivili mumi pamulima, vandu na hinyama na viumbi vyevikwava na videge. Vyoha vyakomakiswi pamulima. Asigalili Nuhu ndu pamonga na vala vevavili nayu mugati ya safina. <verse eid="GEN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24" />Manji genago gasigalili gaugubiki mulima lukumbi lwa magono miya na hamsini.<verse eid="GEN 7:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8" />
  <para style="s">Mwishu wa kumema manji gamahele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1" />Kangi Chapanga akamkumbuka Nuhu na vinyama vyoha kudasi na vya kudimwa yveyvavii pamonga nayu musafina. Hinu Chapanga akabulumisa mpungu pamulima, manji gakatumbula kupungula. <verse eid="GEN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2" />Vinyepa vila vyevyavili pahi neju ya ndima pamonga na milyangu ya yeyayita manji kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga yikadindwa na fula yaketwiki, <verse eid="GEN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3" />manji gakayendelela kupungula mboli mboli pamulima. Pegapitili magono miya yimonga na hamsini, manji gakavya gapungwiki neju. <verse eid="GEN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4" />Mumwehi wa saba ligono la kumi na saba, safina yikatula panani ya chitumbi Alalati. <verse eid="GEN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5" />Manji gakayendelela kupunguka mbolimboli, na ligono la kutumbula la mwehi wa kumi vikawonekana vituvilu vya vitumbi.<verse eid="GEN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6" />Pegapitili magono alubaini Nuhu akadindula lidilisha leatenganizi musafina yila, <verse eid="GEN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7" />akalihumisa likungulu kuvala, nambu lawuyi lepi lambuluwiki kuni na kula mbaka manji gakayuma pamulima. <verse eid="GEN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8" />Kangi Nuhu akayihumisa ngunda muni alolayi ngati manji gayumili panani ya mulima. <verse eid="GEN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9" />Nambu ndava manji gavi gakona gagubiki mulima woha, ngunda yapaweni lepi pandu pa kutula, ndi yikamuwuyila Nuhu musafina. Nuhu akahumisa chiwoko na kuyiyingisa mugati ya safina. <verse eid="GEN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10" />Nuhu akalindila magono gangi saba, akayituma kavili ngunda kuvala. <verse eid="GEN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11" />Peyahikili chimihi ngunda yikamuwuyila Nuhu kuni mumulomo yigegii lihamba livisi la mzeituni, ndava yeniyo Nuhu akamanya kuvya manji gapungwili pamulima. <verse eid="GEN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12" />Akalindila kangi magono saba na akayituma kavili ngunda kuvala, penapo ngunda yamuwuyalili lepi kwaki.<verse eid="GEN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13" />Nuhu peavii na miyaka miya sita na yimonga, mwehi wa utumbukanu na ligono la utumbukanu, manji gavii gamali kuyuma panani ya ndima. Nuhu akagubukula chituvilu cha safina ndi akalola kuvya ndima yimali kuvya yiyumu. <verse eid="GEN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14" />Ligono la ishilini na saba mwehi wa pili, ndima yavii yiyumu jwee.<verse eid="GEN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15" />Ndi Chapanga akamjovela Nuhu, <verse eid="GEN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16" />“Humayi musafina veve pamonga na mdala waku na vana vaku pamonga na vadala vavi. <verse eid="GEN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17" />Mewa humisa kuvala viumbi vyoha ndalindali vyevivii mumi pamonga na veve, videge na hinyama na kila chiumbi chechikwava, muni vihotola kuveleka neju pamulima, viyonjosekayi na kudandasika kila pandu.” <verse eid="GEN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18" />Hinu Nuhu akahuma mwene na mdala waki na vana vaki, pamonga na vadala vavi. <verse eid="GEN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19" />Vakahuma musafina kulandana na misambi yavi, hinyama yoha na viumbi vyoha vyevikwava na videge vyoha.<verse eid="GEN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhu akumuwusila Chapanga luluteta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20" />Nuhu akamujengela Bambu pandu ndava ya kuwusila luluteta. Akatola chinyama chimonga na chidege chimonga kuhuma mukila msambi vyeviyidakiliwa palongolo ya Chapanga, akaviwusa kuvya luluteta lwa kutiniswa kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="GEN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21" />Bambu akanuha mnungalilu wabwina wa teta yeniyo na kuganiswa nayu, Bambu akajova mumtima waki, “Katu yati nikuyipela lepi ndima kavili likoto ndava ya vandu, pamonga vandu maholo gavi gahakau kuhumila uwana wavi, amala yati nikomakesa lepi kavili viumbi vyoha ngati chenakitili. <verse eid="GEN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22" />Chenichi ndi mulima cheuyendelela kuvya lusenje lwa kumija na kubena na lwa mbepu na lupyupyu na chihuku na chilangasi na muhi na kilu, yati vimalika lepi.”<verse eid="GEN 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9" />
  <para style="s">Chapanga ivika lilaganu na Nuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1" />Chapanga akammotisa Nuhu na vana vaki akavajovela, “Mvelekayi vana, mukaumemesa mulima. <verse eid="GEN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2" />Vinyama vyoha, videge vyoha na viumbi vyoha vyevikwava pandima na somba zoha za munyanja vigotoliwi mumawoko ginu, na vyene yati vikuvayogopa na kuvagaya. <verse eid="GEN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3" />Vinyama vyoha yati vivya chakulya chinu ngati chenivapeli makolo kuvya chakulya chinu. <verse eid="GEN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4" />Nambu katu mkoto kulya nyama yeyina ngasi, muni ngasi ndi wumi. <verse eid="GEN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5" />Ngati mundu yeyoha akamkomayi mundu yungi yati nikumbuna kwa kumkoma na ngati chinyama chikamkomayi mundu na chene yati nikuchikoma. <verse eid="GEN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6" />Mundu mweakumukoma muyaki, na mwene yati ikomiwa na vandu, muni mundu awumbiwi kwa kuwanangana na Chapanga.<verse eid="GEN 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7" />Nyeye mveleka myonjoseka, mukaumemesa mulima.”<verse eid="GEN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8" />Kangi Chapanga akamjovela Nuhu pamonga na vana vaki, <verse eid="GEN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9" />“Nivika lilaganu langu na nyenye, pamonga na viveleku vinu, <verse eid="GEN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10" />na viumbi vyoha vyevivii na wumi. Videge na hinyama ya kudimwa na hinyama ya kudasi, vyoha vyevyahumili musafina pamonga na nyenye. <verse eid="GEN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11" />Nivika lilaganu na nyenye, kuvya katu viumbi mumi yati vikomiwa lepi kwa manji gamahele gegagubiki mulima, amala yati yihumila lepi manji gamahele ga kuyigubika mulima kuvakoma vandu.” <verse eid="GEN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12" />Chapanga akajova, “Wenuwu ndi ulangisu wa lilaganu lenikitili pagati yinu na nene na kwa kila chechivii na wumi na kwa viveleku vyoha vyevibwela. <verse eid="GEN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13" />Nivikili chipinga fula kulihundi, nawene yati uvya ulangisu wa lilaganu langu na mulima. <verse eid="GEN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14" />Yati yivya lukumbi lwoha penigubika mulima kwa mahundi, ndi chipinga fula yati chilolekane kumahundi, <verse eid="GEN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15" />yati nikumbuka lilaganu langu na nyenye na viumbi vyoha mumi. Katu manji yati gimema lepi kavili na kuugubika mulima muni kukomakesa mulima. <verse eid="GEN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16" />Lukumbi lwolwoha chipinga fula chepiwonekana kumahundi, yati nikuchilola na kukumbuka lilaganu langu na viumbi vyoha ndalindali vyevivi mumi pamulima.” <verse eid="GEN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17" />Ndi Chapanga akamjovela Nuhu, “Wenuwo ndi ulangisu wa lilaganu lenivikili pagati yangu na viumbi vyoha vyevivi mumi pamulima.”<verse eid="GEN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhu na vana vaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18" />Vana va Nuhu vevahumili musafina ndi Shemu na Hamu na Yafeti. Hamu ndi avii dadi wa Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19" />Venava ndi vevavii vana vadatu va Nuhu, ndava ya vene vandu vakamema pamulima.<verse eid="GEN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20" />Nuhu akatumbula kulima na akamija mizabibu. <verse eid="GEN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21" />Akanywa divayi, akagala, kangi akagona waka mulindanda laki. <verse eid="GEN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22" />Hamu dadi waki Kanaani ndi akamuwona dadi waki avii waka, akahuma kuvala na kuvajovela valongo vaki vavili. <verse eid="GEN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23" />Nambu Shemu na Yafeti vakatola nyula, na kujikoveka mumavega gavi, vakamhambila dadi wavi chimumbele na kumugubika dadi wavi kuni vilola kumuhana. Changali kulingulila waka wa dadi wavi. <verse eid="GEN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24" />Nuhu kugala pekwawukili kumutu, ndi akamanya cheamukitili mwana waki mdebe. <verse eid="GEN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25" />Akajova,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">“Kanaani apewa likoto!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">Yati ivya mvanda mdebe neju wa vavanda va valongo vaki.”<verse eid="GEN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26" />Kavili akajova, “Amotisiwa Bambu Chapanga wa Shemu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:26">Kanaani avyayi mvanda waki.<verse eid="GEN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27" />Chapanga na amkwiha Yafeti!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">Atama mumakuta ga Shemu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">Ndi Kanaani avya mvanda waki.”<verse eid="GEN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28" />Pegamaliki manji gamahele kugubika mulima, Nuhu akatama miyaka miya yidatu na hamsini. <verse eid="GEN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29" />Miyaka yoha yeatamili Nuhu yavili miya tisa na hamsini, ndi afwili.<verse eid="GEN 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10" />
  <para style="s">Viveleku vya vana va Nuhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:5-23">1 Lus 1:5-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1" />Venava ndi vana va Nuhu. Shemu na Hamu na Yafeti, ndi vevavaveliki vana pegamaliki manji gamahele gegagubiki mulima.<verse eid="GEN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2" />Vana va Yafeti ndi Gomeli, Magogu na Madai na Yavani na Tubali na Meshaki na Tilasi. <verse eid="GEN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3" />Vana vagosi va Gomeli ndi Ashikenazi na Lifati na Togama. <verse eid="GEN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4" />Vana vagosi va Yavani ndi Elisha na Tashishi na Kitimu na Lodanimu. <verse eid="GEN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5" />Vandu voha vevitama kumbwani vahumili ndava ya vandu ava, kila vandu na kujova kwavi, kwa likabila lavi na kulandana na milima yavi.<verse eid="GEN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6" />Vana vagosi va Hamu ndi Kushi na Misili na Putu na Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7" />Vana vagosi va Kushi ndi Seba na Havila na Sabita, Laama na Sabiteka. Vana vagosi va Laama ndi Sheba na Dedani. <verse eid="GEN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8" />Kushi dadi wa Nimlodi, mweavili mtovanaji mtumbulanu mweanamakakala pamulima. <verse eid="GEN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9" />Avii mlumba mkekesi palongolo ya Bambu, “ngati vandu chevijova kuvya Nimlodi ndi mlumba mkekesi palongolo ya Bambu!” <verse eid="GEN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10" />Miji ya kutumbula kulongosa kwaki ndi Babeloni na Eleki na Akadi na Kaline kumulima wa Shinali. <verse eid="GEN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11" />Kuhuma ku mulima wenuwo akahamba ku Ashulu ajengili Ninawi na Lehoboh Ili na Kala, <verse eid="GEN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12" />na Leseni, weuvii pagati ya Ninawi na Kala, wenuwo ndi wavii mulima uvaha.<verse eid="GEN 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13" />Misili avii gogo wa Valudi na Vaanamu na Valehabi na Vanafutuhi. <verse eid="GEN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14" />Vapatulusi na Vakasiluhi, kwenuko ndi kwevahumili Vafilisiti na Vakafutoli.<verse eid="GEN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15" />Kanaani akamveleka Sidoni, mvelekanu waki wa utumbula na Heti, <verse eid="GEN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16" />na mewa gogo wavi Vayebusi na Vaamoli na Vagiligashi, <verse eid="GEN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17" />Vahivi na Vaaliki na Vasini, <verse eid="GEN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18" />Vaalivadi na Vasemali na Vahamati. Mwanakandayi lukolo lwa Vakanaani lukapechengana, <verse eid="GEN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19" />na mibaka ya Kanaani yatandasiki kuhuma Sidoni kuhamba ku Gelali mbaka ku Gaza, kangi kuhamba ku Sodoma na Gomola na Adima na Seboimu mbaka ku Lasha. <verse eid="GEN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20" />Venavo ndi vachiveleku va Hamu, kulandana na makabila gavi na luga zavi na milima yavi.<verse eid="GEN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21" />Shemu, mlongo mvaha wa Yafeti, ndi avii dadi wa Vaebulania voha. <verse eid="GEN 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22" />Vana vagosi va Shemu ndi Elamu na Ashulu, Alifakisadi na Ludi na Alamu. <verse eid="GEN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23" />Vana vagosi va Alamu ndi Usi na Huli na Geseli na Mashi. <verse eid="GEN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24" />Alifakisadi akamveleka Sela na Sela akamveleka Ebeli. <verse eid="GEN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25" />Abeli akaveleka vana vagosi vavili, mtumbulanu lihina laki Pelegi, muni palukumbi lwenulo vandu mulima vapechenganiki, na mweigekela ndi Yokitani. <verse eid="GEN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26" />Yokitani akavaveleka Alumodadi na Shelefu na Hasalumawesi na Yela, <verse eid="GEN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27" />Hadolamu na Uzali na Dikila, <verse eid="GEN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28" />Obali na Abimaeli na Sheba, <verse eid="GEN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29" />Ofili na Havila na Yobabu. Venavo voha ndi vana va Yokitani. <verse eid="GEN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30" />Mulima wevatamili wavi kuhuma Mesha mbaka Sefali mulima weuna hitumbi yehivili kwelihumila lilanga. <verse eid="GEN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31" />Venavo ndi viveleku vya Shemu, kulandana na makabila gavi, luga zavi, milima yavi na vandu vavi.<verse eid="GEN 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32" />Venavo ndi viveleku vya vana va Nuhu, kulandana na viveleku vyavi na milima yavi. Ndava ya venavo, vandu vakadandasika pamulima woha manji gamahele pegamaliki.<verse eid="GEN 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11" />
  <para style="s">Mnala wa ku Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1" />Lukumbi lwenulo vandu voha va mulima valongelayi luga yimonga na valongelayi malovi galagala. <verse eid="GEN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2" />Hinu, yikavya vandu pevagendagendayi upandi welihumila lilanga, vahikili pamulima wa selede kwenuko ku Shinali, ndi vakatama. <verse eid="GEN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3" />Vakajovesana, “Mubwela, tifyatulayi matofali na kugayocha bwina.” Vakahengela matofali pahali pa maganga, na lami pahali pa chokaa. <verse eid="GEN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4" />Ndi vakajova, “Na tijengayi muji na mnala utali wewihika kunani kumahundi muni timanyikana mulima woha muni tikotoka kupechengana pamulima.”<verse eid="GEN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5" />Nambu Bambu akahelela muni alolayi muji na mnala wewajengewayi na vandu. <verse eid="GEN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6" />Bambu akajova, “Lola, vandu ava ndi mulima umonga wewilongela luga yimonga vatumbwili kukita naha, hinu kawaka lijambu loloha leviyidakilana kuhenga, langahotoleka kwavi. <verse eid="GEN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7" />Mubwela, tihelela na titumbuganayi kujova kwavi muni vakoto kuyuwanilana vene kwa vene.” <verse eid="GEN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8" />Ndi Bambu akavapechengana kuhuma pandu pala na kuhamba pamulima woha, vene vakaleka kujenga muji wula. <verse eid="GEN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9" />Muji wenuwo vakaukemela Babeli, ndava muni kwenuko ndi Bambu kweatimbugini luga ya pamulima woha, na kuhuma kwenuko Bambu akavapechengana vandu pamilima yoha.<verse eid="GEN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Viveleku vya Shemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:24-27">1 Lus 1:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10" />Vyenivi ndi viveleku vya Shemu. Miyaka yivili manji gamahele gegagubiki mulima pegamaliki, Shemu peavi na miyaka miya yimonga, ndi akamveleka Alifakisadi. <verse eid="GEN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11" />Peamali kumveleka Alifakisadi, Shemu atamili miyaka miya mhanu, ndi akaveleka vana vangi vagosi na vadala.<verse eid="GEN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12" />Lukumbi Alifakisadi peavi na miyaka selesini na mhanu, akamveleka Sela. <verse eid="GEN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13" />Alifakisadi peamali kumveleka Sela, Alifakisadi akatama miyaka miya mcheche na yidatu ndi akavya na vana vagosi na vadala.<verse eid="GEN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14" />Sela peavii na miyaka selasini, akamveleka Ebeli. <verse eid="GEN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15" />Sela peamalili kumveleka Ebeli akatama miyaka miya mcheche na yidatu, ndi akaveleka vana vangi vagosi na vadala.<verse eid="GEN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16" />Ebeli peavii na miyaka selasini na mcheche, akamveleka Pelegi. <verse eid="GEN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17" />Ebeli peamali kumveleka Pelegi, Ebeli akatama miyaka miya mcheche na selasini, ndi akaveleka vana vangi vagosi na vadala.<verse eid="GEN 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18" />Pelegi peavili na miyaka selasini, akamveleka Leu. <verse eid="GEN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19" />Pelegi peamalili kumveleka Leu, Pelegi akatama miyaka miya yivili na tisa na akaveleka vana vangi vagosi na vadala.<verse eid="GEN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20" />Leu peavii na miyaka selasini na yivili, akamveleka Selugi. <verse eid="GEN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21" />Leu peamalii kumveleka Selugi, Leu akatama miyaka miya yivili na saba, akaveleka vana vangi vagosi na vadala.<verse eid="GEN 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22" />Selugi peavii na miyaka selasini, ndi akamveleka Naholi. <verse eid="GEN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23" />Selugi peamali kumveleka Naholi, Selugi akatama miyaka miya yivili, akaveleka vana vagosi na vadala.<verse eid="GEN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24" />Naholi peavii na miyaka ishilini na tisa, akamveleka Tela. <verse eid="GEN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25" />Naholi peamali kumveleka Tela, Naholi akatama miyaka miya yimonga na kumi na tisa, akaveleka vana vagosi na vadala.<verse eid="GEN 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26" />Tela peavi na miyaka sabini, akavaveleka Iblamu na Naholi na Halani.<verse eid="GEN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Viveleku vya Tela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27" />Vyenivi ndi viveleku vya Tela. Tela amveliki Iblamu na Naholi na Halani. Halani amveliki Lutu. <verse eid="GEN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28" />Tela peavi akona mumi peavii itama ku Uli mulima wa Vakalidayo, Halani afwili kweavelikwi. <verse eid="GEN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29" />Iblamu na Naholi vakagega. Mdala wa Iblamu lihina laki Salai. Mdala wa Naholi lihina laki Milika. Milika na Isika vavii vana va Halani. <verse eid="GEN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30" />Salai avii lepi na mwana ndava avii ngaveleka.<verse eid="GEN 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31" />Tela akavatola vana vaki Iblamu na Salai mkamwana wa waki na mjukulu vaki Lutu mweavi mwana wa Halani. Akawuka navu voha kuhuma ku Uli, mulima wa Vakalidayo, muni vahamba kumulima wa Kanaani. Nambu pevahikili ku Halani, vakatama. <verse eid="GEN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32" />Tela afwili ku Halani lukumbi peavii na miyaka miya yivili na mhanu.<verse eid="GEN 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12" />
  <para style="s">Chapanga akumkemela Abulahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1" />Bambu akamjovela Abulahamu, “Wuka pamulima waku, leka valongo vaku na nyumba ya dadi wako, hamba ku mulima yenikukulangisa. <verse eid="GEN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2" />Yati nikukita veve kuvya mulima uvaha, yati nikumotisa na yati nikukita umanyikana neju, na veve yati uvya mota.<verse eid="GEN 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3" />Yati nikuvamotisa vala vevakumotisa, na mundu yeyoha mweakupela likoto yati nikumpela likoto, na kupitila kwaku vandu voha va milima yoha yati vimotisiwa.”<verse eid="GEN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4" />Ndi Abulahamu akawuka ngati cheajoviwi na Bambu, namwene Lutu akahamba pamonga nayu. Lukumbi Abulahamu peawukili ku Halani, avili na miyaka sabini na mhanu. <verse eid="GEN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5" />Abulahamu akamtola Salai mdala waki pamonga na Lutu mwana wa mlongo waki, vakagega vindu vyavi vyoha pamonga na vandu voha vevavapatili ku Halani, vakagenda mbaka mulima wa Kanaani, ndi vakahika kwenuko.<verse eid="GEN 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6" />Abulahamu akagenda pagati ya mulima wenuwo akahika ku Shekemu, pepavi na mkongo uvaha wa Mole. Lukumbi lwenulo Vakanaani vavi vakolonjinji va mumulima wenuwo. <verse eid="GEN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7" />Bambu amuhumalili Abulahamu akamjovela, “Yati nikuvapela viveleku vyaku mulima uwu.” Ndi penapo Abulahamu akamjengela pandu pa kuwusila teta Bambu mweamuhumalili. <verse eid="GEN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8" />Mwanakandahi Abulahamu akawuka penapo, akahamba kuchitumbi chechivili upandi wa kwelihumila lilanga wa Beseli akajenga lindanda pagati ya muji wa Beseli na Ai yeyivii ku kwelitipama lilanga. Mewa penapo akamjengela Bambu pandu pa kuwusila teta kutiyisa na akamuyupa Bambu. <verse eid="GEN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9" />Kangi Abulahamu akayendelela na lugendu kuhamba upandi wa kusini.<verse eid="GEN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abulahamu ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10" />Lukumbi lwenulo yikahumila njala pamulima. Njala yeniyo yavi yivaha, ndi Abulahamu akahamba ku Misili kutama kwenuko kwa lukumbi. <verse eid="GEN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11" />Peahegalili kuyingila ku Misili, Abulahamu amjovili Salai mdala waki, “Nimanyili kuvya veve wamdala mweunyambili. <verse eid="GEN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12" />Vamisili pevakulola, ‘Ndi yati vijova mwenuyu mdala waki.’ Ndi yati vakunikoma nene nambu veve yati vakukuleka mumi. <verse eid="GEN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13" />Hinu vajovelayi veve ndi mlumbu wangu muni vanikitila gabwina, ndava yaku vanilekayi nitama mumi.” <verse eid="GEN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14" />Hinu, Abulahamu peahikili kumulima wa Misili, kwenuko vakolonjinji vamuwene Salai kuvya mdala mweanyambili neju. <verse eid="GEN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15" />Vatumisi va Falao pevamuwene Salai, vakamulumbalila palongolo ya Falao. Hinu, Salai vakampeleka kunyumba ya Falao. <verse eid="GEN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16" />Ndava ya Salai, Falao akamkitila Abulahamu gabwina, akampela mambelele na ng'ombi, lipunda, ngamiya na vatumisi vachigosi na vachidala.<verse eid="GEN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17" />Nambu Bambu akamng'aisa Falao na vandu voha va munyumba yaki kwa matamu gavaha ndava ya Salai mdala wa Abulahamu. <verse eid="GEN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18" />Falao akamkemela Abulahamu, akamkota, “Ndava kyani unikitili naha? Ndava kyani wanijovili lepi kuvya Salai mdala waku? <verse eid="GEN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19" />Ndava kyani wanijovili kuvya mlumbu waku hati nikamtola kuvya mdala wangu? Hinu mdala waku ndi uyu, umtola uhamba nayu!” <verse eid="GEN 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20" />Kangi Falao akavalagiza vandu vaki vamuhindikila Abulahamu na mdala waki pamonga na vindu vyaki vyoha vawukayi pamulima wa Misili.<verse eid="GEN 12:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13" />
  <para style="s">Abulahamu ilekana na Lutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1" />Abulahamu akawuya kuhuma ku Misili na kuhamba upandi wa kusini wa Kanaani, mwene na mdala waki, pamonga na Lutu na vindu vyaki vyoha. <verse eid="GEN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2" />Lukumbi lwenulo Abulahamu avii na vindu vyamahele neju, avii na mifuya yamahele na maganga ga feza pamonga na zahabu. <verse eid="GEN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3" />Akayendelela kugenda kuhuma ku kusini mbaka ku Beseli. Akahika pandu peajengili lindanda kadeni, pagati ya Beseli na Ai, <verse eid="GEN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4" />penapo ndi peajengili pandu pa kuwusila teta. Penapo Abulahamu akamyupa Bambu.<verse eid="GEN 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5" />Mewawa, Lutu mwealandini na Abulahamu avii na mifuya na lindanda. <verse eid="GEN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6" />Nambu mulima wavii udebe kwa vene kutama pamonga ndava ya umahele wa mifuya vyavi. <verse eid="GEN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7" />Hinu ngondo yikahumila pagati ya vadimaji va Abulahamu na vadimaji va Lutu. Lukumbi lwenulo, Vakanaani na Vapelizi ndi vavii vakolonjinji va mulima wenuwo.<verse eid="GEN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8" />Hinu Abulahamu akamjovela Lutu, “Tete tikotoka kukomana, mewawa na vadimaji vitu vakotoka kukomana, muni tete tavalongo. <verse eid="GEN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9" />Wu! Mulima wenuwu woha uvii lepi palongolo yaku? Manya tigavanayi. Ngati wihamba upandi wa kulyela nene yati nihamba upandi wa kumangiya, Ngati ukahamba upandi wa kumangiya nene yati nihamba upandi wa kulyela.”<verse eid="GEN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10" />Lutu akalola aliwene liwasi loha la Yoludani kuvya lavii na manji gamahele, ngati lidimba la Bambu, na ngati mulima wa Misili, upandi wa Soali. Yeniyi yavili kwakona Bambu angahalabisa miji ya Sodoma na Gomola. <verse eid="GEN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11" />Ndava yeniyo Lutu akahagula liwasi loha la Yoludani, akahamba upandi welihumila lilanga, chenichi ndi chevagavini. <verse eid="GEN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12" />Abulahamu akatama pamulima wa Kanaani, na Lutu atama pagati ya miji yeyavili muliwasi, na akahamila papipi na Sodoma. <verse eid="GEN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13" />Hinu vandu va ku Sodoma vavii vahakau neju, vambudili neju Bambu.<verse eid="GEN 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abulahamu ilangiswa mulima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14" />Lutu peamali kulekana na Abulahamu Bambu akamjovela Abulahamu, “Penapo lola, yinula mihu gaku ulola kasikazini na kusini na kwelihumila lilanga na kwelitipama lilanga. <verse eid="GEN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15" />Mulima woha weukuuwona, yati nikupela veve na viveleku vyaku mbaka magono goha gangali na mwishu. <verse eid="GEN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16" />Viveleku vyaku yati nikuvikita kuvya vyamahele vyangavalangika, ngati mundu chaangahotola kuvalanga lububu mewawa cheihotola lepi kuvalanga viveleku vyaku! <verse eid="GEN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17" />Hinu uyimayi uwugendelela mulima wenuwu uvaha waki na utali waki, muni yati nikupela veve.” <verse eid="GEN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18" />Ndava yeniyo Abulahamu akawusa mandanda gaki, akahamba kutama papipi na mikongo yamsopi ya mkongo uvaha wa Mamule ku Hebuloni. Kwenuko akamjengela Bambu pandu pa maganga pa kuwusila luteta za kutinyisa.<verse eid="GEN 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14" />
  <para style="s">Abulahamu akumsangula Lutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1" />Lukumbi lwenulo, Amlafeli avili nkosi wa ku Shinali na Alioko avili nkosi wa ku Elasali na Kedolaoma avili nkosi wa ku Elamu na Tidali avili nkosi wa ku Goiimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2" />vakahamba kukomana ngondo na Bela nkosi wa ku Sodoma na Bilisha nkosi wa ku Gomola na Shinabu nkosi wa ku Adima na Shemebeli nkosi wa ku Seboimu, pamonga na nkosi wa ku Bela mewawa pakemiwi Soali. <verse eid="GEN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3" />Vankosi mhanu venavo ndi vakawunganisa manjolinjoli gavi kulibondi la Sidimu, ndi hinu pekemiwa Nyanja ya mwinyu. <verse eid="GEN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4" />Vamuhengili nkosi Kedolaoma mulukumbi lwa miyaka kumi na yivili, na mwaka wa kumi na yidatu ndi vakambela. <verse eid="GEN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5" />Mumwaka wa kumi na mcheche, nkosi Kedolaoma na vankosi vayaki veawungini nawu vahambili kutovana na kuvahotola Valefai ku Ashitaloti Kanaimu na Vazuzi va ku Hamu, na Vaemi va ku Shawe Kiliataimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6" />na Vaholi ku mulima weuvi na hitumbi ya Seili, vakavavinga mbaka Elipalani mumbaka wa lugangatu. <verse eid="GEN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7" />Kangi vakawuya mumbele vakahamba ku Enimishipati mewa yikemiwa Kadeshi, vakatova vandu va mulima woha wa Vaamaleki, na kuvahotola Vaamoli vevatamili ku Hasasoni Tamali.<verse eid="GEN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8" />Ndi nkosi wa ku Sodoma na nkosi wa ku Gomola na nkosi wa ku Adima na nkosi wa ku Seboimu na nkosi wa ku Bela mewa yakemiwi Soali, vakakonganesa manjolinjoli gavi kuhamba kungondo kulikemba la Sidimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9" />ndava ya kukomana na Kedolaoma nkosi wa ku Elamu na Tidali nkosi wa ku Goimu na Amlafeli nkosi wa ku Shinali, na Alioko nkosi wa ku Elasali, ndi vankosi mcheche vatovini na vankosi mhanu. <verse eid="GEN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10" />Likemba la Sidimu lamemili malindi ga lami. Hinu vankosi va ku Sodoma na ku Gomola pevatilayi ngondo, ndi vakadumbukila mwenumo, nambu vangi vakajumbalila kuhitumbi. <verse eid="GEN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11" />Vankosi mcheche vala, ndi vakatola vindu vya ku Sodoma, na vya ku Gomola, pamonga na vyakulya vyavi vyoha kangi vakawuya navyu. <verse eid="GEN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12" />Vakamutola na Lutu, mwana wa mulongo waki Abulahamu mweatamayi ku Sodoma pamonga na vindu vyaki vyoha vyeavili navyu.<verse eid="GEN 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13" />Mundu mmonga mweavalemili, akahamba kumjovela Abulahamu mweavii Muebulania mweatamayi papipi na mikongo yivaha ya Mamle. Mamle avii mlongo waki Eshikoli na Aneli. Voha venavo vavikii lilaganu na Abulahamu. <verse eid="GEN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14" />Abulahamu peayuwini kuvya Lutu atoliwi kungondo, akawuka pamonga na vandu vaki vevimanya kutovana ngondo miya yidatu na kumi na nane vevavelikwi munyumba yaki, akavalanda vamakoko venavo mbaka ku Dani. <verse eid="GEN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15" />Lukumbi lwa kilu Abulahamu akagava manjolinjoli vaki mu misambi, kilu akavazangila vamakoko vaki na kuvavinga mbaka ku Hoba, upandi wa kasikazini wa Damesiko. <verse eid="GEN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16" />Hinu Abulahamu akasangula vindu vyoha vyevyatoliwi na vamakoko akamusangula na Lutu pamonga na vindu vyaki na vadala na vandu vangi.<verse eid="GEN 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Melikisedeki akummotisa Abulahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17" />Abulahamu peamalili kumuhotola nkosi Kedolaoma na vayaki, ndi nkosi wa ku Sodoma akahamba kumpokela chisangaluka kuligemba la Shawe, mewa lakemiwi likemba la nkosi. <verse eid="GEN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18" />Mewa Melikisedeki nkosi waku Salemu, mweavii mteta wa Chapanga mkulu, akaleta libumunda na divayi. <verse eid="GEN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19" />Akammotisa Abulahamu kuni ijova, “Abulahamu umotisiwa na Chapanga Mkulu, mweawumbi kunani na mulima! <verse eid="GEN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20" />Alumbiwayi Chapanga Mkulu, mweakukitili uvahotola vamakoko vaku!” Ndi Abulahamu akampela Melikisedeki lilundu la kumi la vindu vyoha vyeavili navyu.<verse eid="GEN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21" />Nkosi wa ku Sodoma akamjovela Abulahamu, “Nipela vandu vangu avo, nambu vindu vyoha utola wamwene.”<verse eid="GEN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22" />Nambu Abulahamu akamyangula nkosi wa ku Sodoma, “Nilapa kwa Bambu, Chapanga Mkulu, mweawumbili kunani na mulima, <verse eid="GEN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23" />kuvya yati nitola lepi wuzi amala nyosi ya vilatu, hati chochoha chechivii chaku, ndava yati ukujilumba kuvya unikitili nivya na vindu vyamahele. <verse eid="GEN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24" />Nitola lepi vindu nambu vila ndu vyevalili vasongolo vangu na vila vya vandu vevavii pamonga na nene, ndi Aneli na Eshikoli na Mamle venavo vapewayi lilundu lavi.”<verse eid="GEN 14:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15" />
  <para style="s">Lilaganu la Chapanga na Abulahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1" />Pegamaliki mambu ago, linenu la Bambu likamubwelela Abulahamu mumaono, “Abulahamu! Kotoka kuyogopa! Nene ndi chingwamba chaku. Na njombi yaku yati yivya yivaha neju.”<verse eid="GEN 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2" />Nambu Abulahamu akajova, “Bambu Chapanga veve yati ukunipela kyani lukumbi nakona nitama changali mwana, na muhali wangu ndi Eliezeli mundu wa ku Damesiko? <verse eid="GEN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3" />Lola! Unipeli lepi mwana, mvanda mweavelekiwi munyumba yangu ndi muhali wa vindu vyangu.”<verse eid="GEN 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4" />Ndi Bambu Chapanga akamjovela, “Mwenuyu Elieza mvanda ivya lepi muhali waku nambu mwana waku ndi ivya muhali waku.” <verse eid="GEN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5" />Penapo Bambu akamuhumisa Abulahamu kuvala na kumjovela, “Lola kunani! Uvalangai ndondo, ngati uhotwili kuzivalanga! Chenicho ndi viveleku vyaku chevivya vyamahele.”<verse eid="GEN 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6" />Abulahamu akamsadika Bambu Chapanga, na Abulahamu awonikini ayidakiliwi palongolo ya Bambu.<verse eid="GEN 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7" />Mewa akamjovela, “Nene ndi Bambu mwenakuletili kuhuma ku Uli, mulima wa Vakalidayo, kukupela mulima uwu uvya waku.”<verse eid="GEN 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8" />Nambu Abulahamu akamjovela, “Bambu Chapanga veve, yati nimanya wuli kuvya mulima uwu kuvya wangu?”<verse eid="GEN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9" />Bambu Chapanga akamjovela, “Niletelayi mpapakasi wa ng'ombi yeyivi na miyaka yidatu, mene yidala yeyina miyaka yidatu, limbelele ligosi lelivi na miyaka yidatu, ngunda pamonga na liwela la ngunda.” <verse eid="GEN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10" />Abulahamu akaleta hinyama yoha, akahidumula kila chinyama pagati, akavika musafu zivili kila chipandi kulolana na chiyaki, nambu videge avidumwili lepi. <verse eid="GEN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11" />Mambanga gegilya nyama gakatula panani ya nyama, ndi Abulahamu akagavinga.<verse eid="GEN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12" />Pelatipimi lilanga, Abulahamu akagona tipitipi, wogoyu na chitita ng'ong'ololo vikamugubika. <verse eid="GEN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13" />Penapo Bambu akamjovela Abulahamu, “Umaya chakaka kuvya chiveleku chaku yati chitama ngati vayehe pamulima wewangavya wavi, yati vivya vavanda na kung'aiswa lukumbi lwa miyaka miya mcheche. <verse eid="GEN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14" />Pamonga na ago yati nikuvabuna vandu vevakuvakita vene kuvya vavanda, pamwishu yati vihuma kwenuko na vindu vyamahele. <verse eid="GEN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15" />Nambu veve yati utama magono gamahele na kufwa kwa uteke na kuzikwa kwa utopesa. <verse eid="GEN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16" />Chiveleku chaku cha mcheche ndi yati chiwuya penapa, ndava mabudilu ga Vaamoli gakona gangakamilika.”<verse eid="GEN 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17" />Pelatipimi lilanga chiviga cha motu chechihuka lyohi na lumuli lweluyaka motu vikapita pagati ya vinyama vila. <verse eid="GEN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18" />Ligono lila Bambu akakita lilaganu na Abulahamu, akajova, “Chiveleku chaku nivapelili mulima uwu, kuhumila mfuleni wa Misili mbaka mfuleni wula uvaha wa Fulati, <verse eid="GEN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19" />pamonga na milima ya Vakeni na Vakenizi na Vakadimoni, <verse eid="GEN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20" />Vahiti na Vapelizi na Valefai, <verse eid="GEN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21" />Vaamoli na Vakanaani na Vagiligashi na Vayebusi.”<verse eid="GEN 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16" />
  <para style="s">Hajili na Ishimaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1" />Hinu, Salai, mdala wa Abulahamu amvelekili lepi vana. Nambu avii na mvanda mdala wa ku Misili mweikemiwa Hajili. <verse eid="GEN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2" />Hinu Salai akamjovela Abulahamu, “Bambu anipeli lepi vana. Gona na Hajili mvanda wangu, pangi yati nipata vana kwa mwenuyo.” Abulahamu akayidakila malovi ga Salai. <verse eid="GEN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3" />Ndi Salai akampela Abulahamu Hajili, mvanda waki mweavii Mmisili, hawala. Genago gahumalili lukumbi Abulahamu atamili ku Kanaani miyaka kumi. <verse eid="GEN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4" />Abulahamu akagona na Hajili, na Hajili akavya na ndumbu. Nambu penapo ndu peajiwene avii na ndumbu, Hajili akatumbula kumuvevesa Salai.<verse eid="GEN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5" />Ndi Salai akamjovela Abulahamu, “Gahakau gangu gavya ga kwaku. Nene nakupelili mvanda wangu, nambu hinu apatili ndumbu, ndi akunivevesa nene. Chapanga na ahamulayi pagati yaku na nene!”<verse eid="GEN 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6" />Abulahamu akamjovela Salai, “Mvanda waku avii mumawoko gaku, umukitayi chewigana.” Hinu, Salai akamung'aisa Hajili mbaka akatila.<verse eid="GEN 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7" />Mtumu wa kunani kwa Bambu akamukolela Hajili pepavi na chinyepa cha manji kulugangatu, chinyepa chechivii munjila yeyihamba ku Shuli. <verse eid="GEN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8" />Mtumu wa kunani kwa Bambu akamkota, “Hajili, mvanda wa Salai! Wihuma kwoki na wihamba kwoki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:8">Ndi akamyangula, “Nikumutila mkulu wangu Salai.”<verse eid="GEN 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9" />Penapo mtumu wa kunani kwa Bambu akamjovela, “Wuya kwa mkulu waku na ukamtopesa.” <verse eid="GEN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10" />Mtumu wa kunani kwa Bambu akamjovela Hajili, “Yati nikupela viveleku vyamahele hati vangavalangika.” <verse eid="GEN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11" />Mewa mtumu wa kunani kwa Bambu akayongesa kujova, “Veve uvi na ndumbu ndi yati wiveleka mwana, mgosi, ndi yati ukumkemela Ishimaeli, muni Bambu ayuwini mang'aiso gaku. <verse eid="GEN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12" />Nambu mwana waku yati itama changali kuyuwanila mundu yoyoha, yati ikomana na kila mundu, na kila mundu yati ikomana naku. Yati itama ngati likoko na valongo vaki nambu yati akuvahotola.”<verse eid="GEN 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13" />Hinu, Hajili akampela lihina Bambu mwealongili nayu kula, “Veve ndi Chapanga mweukuniwona nene,” Ndava aholalili, “Chakaka penapa nimuweni mwene mweaniweni.” <verse eid="GEN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14" />Ndava yeniyo chiliva chila chakemiliwi Belai Loi, mana yaki chiliva cha mwene mweavi mumi mweakuniwona. Chiliva ichi chivii pagati ya Kadeshi na Beledi.<verse eid="GEN 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15" />Hajili akamvelekela Abulahamu mwana mgosi. Abulahamu akamkemela mwana yula Ishimaeli. <verse eid="GEN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16" />Lukumbi Hajili akumveleka Ishimaeli, Abulahamu avii na miyaka semanini na sita.<verse eid="GEN 16:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17" />
  <para style="s">Jandu ndi ulangisu wa Lilaganu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1" />Abulahamu peavii na miyaka tisini na tisa, Bambu akamuhumalila na kumjovela, “Nene ndi Chapanga mwenivi na Makakala. Landayi genijova na ukitayi gegiganikiwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2" />Nene yati nikita lilaganu na veve na kuvayonjokesa chiveleku chaku.” <verse eid="GEN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3" />Abulahamu akagundama mbaka pahi, ndi Chapanga akamjovela, <verse eid="GEN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4" />“Nivika lilaganu lenili na veve, yati uvya dadi wa vandu va milima yamahele. <verse eid="GEN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5" />Yati ukemiwa lepi kavili lihina laku Abulahamu, nambu yati ukemelewa lihina laku Ibulahimu, muni nikukitili kuvya wa dadi wa vandu va milima yamahele. <verse eid="GEN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6" />Yati nikukita uvya na chiveleku chamahele neju, kwa veve yati nikita vandu va milima yamahele na pagati yavi vangi vivya vankosi.”<verse eid="GEN 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7" />Yati nitimilisa lilaganu langu na veve, viveleku vyaku na viveveleku vyavi vyoha magono goha gangali mwishu, kavili yati nivya Chapanga waku na Chapanga wa viveleku vyaku. <verse eid="GEN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8" />Yati nikuvapela mulima uwu wemwitama ngati vayehe uvya waku magono goha, ndi mulima woha wa Kanaani uvya waku magono goha gangali mwishu, na nene yati nivya Chapanga winu.<verse eid="GEN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9" />Kangi Chapanga akamjovela Ibulahimu, “Veve yikugana ulikamula lilaganu langu, veve wamwene, na viveleku vyaku, pamonga ndava ya viveleku vyevibwela. <verse eid="GEN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10" />Lenili ndi lilaganu leukulikamula pagati yangu na veve pamonga na viveleku vyaku. Kila mgosi pagati yinu yikumgana adumuliwa jandu. <verse eid="GEN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11" />Yati mwidumuliwa jandu na yeniyo ndi yati yivya ulangisu wa lilaganu langu na nyenye. <verse eid="GEN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12" />Kila mwana mgosi mweahikisi magono nane pagati yinu ndi yikumgana adumuliwa jandu. Kila mgosi pagati ya viveleku vinu, avya mvanda pamonga na mwevelekiwi panyumba yinu, pamonga na mweaguliwi kwa mashonga ginu kuhuma kwa myehe mweangavya chiveleku chaku. <verse eid="GEN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13" />Ena, kila mmonga wavi mweavelekiwi munyumba yaku amala aguliwi kwa mashonga gaku, ndi yikumgana adumuliwa jandu. Lilaganu langu muhiga yaku, yati livya lilaganu la magono goha gangali na mwishu. <verse eid="GEN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14" />Kila mgosi mweangadumuliwa jandu, yati iwusiwa muvandu, muni adenyili lilaganu langu.”<verse eid="GEN 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15" />Kangi Chapanga akamjovela Ibulahimu, “Kumvala mdala waki, yati ukumkemela lepi kavili Salai, nambu lihina laki yati livya Sala. <verse eid="GEN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16" />Yati nikummotisa, namwene yati akuvelekela mwana mgosi. Yati nikummotisa Sala, namwene yati ivya nyina wa vandu va milima yamahele na vankosi va milima yati vihumila kwaki.”<verse eid="GEN 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17" />Penapo Ibulahimu akagundama mbaka pahi, akaheka na mutima waki kuhololela, “Wu, chakaka yihotoleka mwana kuvelekewa kwa mgogolo mweavi na miyaka miya yimonga? Wu, Sala mweavi na miyaka tisini, yati ihotola kuveleka mwana?” <verse eid="GEN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18" />Hinu, Ibulahimu akamkota Chapanga, “Ngayivi chabwina lilaganu lenilo ngalivii kwa Ishimaeli!”<verse eid="GEN 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19" />Chapanga akamyangula, “Lepi! Mdala waku Sala yati akuvelekela mwana mgosi, na veve yati ukumkemela lihina laki Isaka. Yati nikamula lilaganu langu kwaki na viveleku vyaki, livya lilaganu la magono goha gangali na mwishu. <verse eid="GEN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20" />Niyuwini luyupu lwaku kumvala Ishimaeli. Yati nikummotisa, yati nikumpela vana vamahele na kuvayonjokesa neju. Ishimaeli yati ivya dadi wa vatalalila kumi na vavii, na nene yati nikumukita avyayi dadi wa mulima uvaha. <verse eid="GEN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21" />Nambu lilaganu langu yati nitimilisa kwa Isaka, ndi Sala yati akuvelekela mwaka mweibwela lusenje ngati lwenulu.” <verse eid="GEN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22" />Hinu Chapanga peamalili kulongela na Abulahamu, akamleka akahamba kunani.<verse eid="GEN 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23" />Kangi, ligono lilalila Ibulahimu amyidakili Chapanga na akamutola Ishimaeli pamonga na voha vevavelekiwi munyumba yaki na voha vevaguliwi kwa mashonga gaki, vagosi voha va munyumba yaki akavadumula jandu ngati chealagaziwi na Chapanga. <verse eid="GEN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24" />Ibulahimu avii na miyaka tisini na tisa peadumuliwi jandu, <verse eid="GEN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25" />mewa Ishimaeli mwana waki peadumuliwi jandu avii na miyaka kumi na yidatu. <verse eid="GEN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26" />Ibulahimu na pamonga na Ishimaeli mwana waki vadumuliwi jandu ligono lilalila, <verse eid="GEN 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27" />pamonga na vagosi voha va nyumba yaki na vavanda voha vevavelekiwi munyumba yaki na vevaguliwi kwa mashonga gaki, vadumuliwi jandu ligono lilolo.<verse eid="GEN 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18" />
  <para style="s">Vayehe vadatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1" />Bambu amuhumalili Ibulahimu papipi na mikongo mivaha ya Mamle, lukumbi peatamili pamlyangu wa kuyingalila mulindanda laki lukumbi lwa lupyupu lwa muhi, <verse eid="GEN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2" />na peayinwili mihu gaki akavawona vandu vadatu vayimili patali chidogo na mwene. Ndi peavawene, akayumbatika kuhamba kuvapokela. Akavagundamila cha kukupama. <verse eid="GEN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3" />Akajova, “Bambu wangu, ngati uyidakila chondi ukoto kunipita nene namtangatila winu, ubwela uwela kwa nene kwa lukumbi. <verse eid="GEN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4" />Yati mletewa manji chidogo muni musanja magendelu na mpumulilayi pamkongo uwu. <verse eid="GEN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5" />Lukumbi pempumulila, yati nikuvatendelekela chakulya chidogo mlyai ndi mpata makakala na kuyendelela na lugendu lwinu, muni muyidakili kubwela kwa nene mtangatila winu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:5">Vakamyangula, “Ena! Kitayi ngati cheujovi.”<verse eid="GEN 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6" />Ibulahimu akayumbatika mulindanda na kumjovela Sala, “Tendelekela kanyata uhembe weuyagiwi bwina hipimu yidatu na uteleka mabumunda.” <verse eid="GEN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7" />Kangi akawuka kanyata akahamba kumsambi wa ng'ombi, akahagula mpapakasi mmonga wabwina neju na mweakulupili, akampela mtumu waki na akatendekela nyama kanyata. <verse eid="GEN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8" />Mewa Ibulahimu akaleta siyagi na mavele na nyama yeyatendekiliwi, akavatendelekela vayehe vala chakulya, na mwene akayima papipi nawu kuvalindila pevalyai pahi ya mkongo.<verse eid="GEN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9" />Vayehe vala vakamkota, “Avii kwoki mdala waku Sala?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:9">Ibulahimu akayangula, “Avii mulindanda.”<verse eid="GEN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10" />Mmonga wavi akajova, “Chakaka yati nikukuwuyila kavili kumwaka lukumbi ngati ulu, na mdala waku sala yati ivya na mwana mgosi.” Sala avii kuyetu ya mlyangu wa lindanda iyuwanila.<verse eid="GEN 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11" />Ibulahimu na Sala vavii vagogolo, ni mwene Sala lukumbi lwaki lwa kuveleka lwamaliki. <verse eid="GEN 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12" />Hinu, Sala akaheka chakumtima na kujova, “Nene namgogolo, na mngana wangu mewa mgogolo. Wu, yati nihotola kuhekelela kugona na mngwana wangu na kupata vana?”<verse eid="GEN 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13" />Penapo Bambu akamkota Ibulahimu, “Ndava kyani Sala ahekili na kujikota, chakaka ‘Yati nihotola kuveleka mwana na hinu nene namugogolo?’ <verse eid="GEN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14" />Wu, livili lijambu loloha langahotoleka kwa Bambu? Yati nikuwuyila lukumbi lwelupangiwi, lukumbi ngati ulu mwaka weubwela, ndi Sala yati ivya na mwana mgosi.”<verse eid="GEN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15" />Nambu Sala ayogwipi, akabela na kujova, “Nahekili lepi,” Nambu Bambu akamjovela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:15">“Ena ukahekili!”<verse eid="GEN 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibulahimu akuvayupila vandu va ku Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16" />Kangi vandu vala vakawuka, vakahika pandu pevahotwili kuuwona mulima wa Sodoma kuni Ibulahimu avii pamonga navu kuvahindikila. <verse eid="GEN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17" />Ndi Bambu akajova, “Wu, nimufihayi Ibulahimu lijambu lenihamba kukita. <verse eid="GEN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18" />Ibulahimu yati ivya dadi wa mulima uvaha weuvi na makakala kupitila mwene na vandu va milima yoha yati vimotisiwa! <verse eid="GEN 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19" />Muni nimuhagwili mwene na viveleku vyaki. Mwene yati akuvawula viveleku vyaki kuniyidakila na kukita gegiganikiwa. Ngati vakakitayi chenicho na nene yati nikumkitila kila chenamujovili.”<verse eid="GEN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20" />Ndi Bambu akajova, “Kuvii na malovi gahakahu neju kuvavala vandu va Sodoma na Gomola, na kumbudila kwavi Chapanga ndi kuvaha neju. <verse eid="GEN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21" />Hinu yati nihelela kuhamba kwenuko nikalola namwene ngati chakaka vakitili kulandana na malovi gahakahu geganihikili. Nigana kumanya.”<verse eid="GEN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22" />Kuhuma penapo, vandu vala vakakamula njila kuhamba ku Sodoma, nambu Ibulahimu asigalili, ayimili palongolo ya Bambu. <verse eid="GEN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23" />Hinu, Ibulahimu akamuhegelela Bambu, akamkota, “Wu, yati ukuvakomakesa vandu vangahoka na pamonga vevahokili? <verse eid="GEN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24" />Wu, yikavyai vavii vandu hamsini vangahoka pamuji wenuwo, wu, yati ukuukomakesa mulima wenuowo na yati uleka lepi ndava ya vandu avo hamsini vevahokili vevavii mwenumo? <verse eid="GEN 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25" />Niholalela yati ukita lepi chenicho! Kuvakoma vandu vangahoka pamonga na vevahokili, vangahoka kuvakitila ngati vevahokili! Lepi! Muhamula wa mulima woha ileka lepi kukita gegiganikiwa?”<verse eid="GEN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26" />Bambu akajova, “Nikakolelayi vandu vangahoka hamsini kumuji wa Sodoma, yati nikuulekekesa mulima woha ndava ya venavo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27" />Ibulahimu akajova kangi, “Nene nilingili kulongela na Bambu, kuni nene chindu lepi, mwenivi lububu na malyenge ndu. <verse eid="GEN 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28" />Pangi yati vivya vandu vangahoka alubaini na mhanu pahala hamsini. Wu, yati ukomakesa muji woha muni vapungwili vandu mhanu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:28">Bambu akamjovela, “Ngati nivakolili vandu venavo alubaini na mhanu yati nikomakesa lepi.”<verse eid="GEN 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29" />Ibulahimu akajova kavili, “Wu, kwenuko ngati vapatikini vandu alubaini ndu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:29">Akamyangula, “Yati nikomakesa lepi ndava ya vandu alubaini venavo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30" />Ibulahimu akayonjokesa kujova, “Bambu kotokayi kuniyomela, ni nene yati nijova kavili. Pangi yati vivya selasini ndu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:30">Bambu akamyangula, “Yati nikita lepi chenicho nikavakolela selasini venavo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31" />Ibulahimu akajova, “Chondi Bambu nilekekesa muni niyendelili kulongela na veve. Pangi vipatikana vandu ishilini?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:31">Bambu akamyangula, “Ndava ya ishilini venavo yati nikomakesa lepi muji wenuo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32" />Ibulahimu akajova, “Kotoka kuyoma Bambu, nambu yati nijova kangi mala yimonga ndu. Wu vakavyai vandu vangahoka kumi ndu, yati yivya wuli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:32">Bambu akamyangula, “Ndava ya vandu vangahoka kumi yati nikomakesa lepi muji wenuwo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33" />Bambu peamalili kulongela na Ibulahimu, akawuka, ndi Ibulahimu akawuya kunyumba yaki.<verse eid="GEN 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19" />
  <para style="s">Uhakau wa vandu va ku Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1" />Hinu vamitumi va kunani kwa Chapanga vavili vala vakahika ku Sodoma chimihi, Lutu atamili pa limlyangu likulu la muji la kuyingilila ku Sodoma. Ndi Lutu peavawene akavahambila kanyata na kuvagundamila mbaka pahi. <verse eid="GEN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2" />Akajova, “Vabambu vangu, chondi muyingilayi munyumba yangu nene namvanda winu. Mwihotola kusanja magendelu ginu na kugona kwa nene namvanda winu ndi chilau lukela pehe muyendelela na lugendu lwinu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:2">Vakamyangula, “Lepi, nambu tete yati tigona paluvanja.”<verse eid="GEN 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3" />Lutu akavayupa neju, vayingila munyumba yaki ndi vakayingila. Akavatendekelela chakulya, akavatelekela libumunda langasopiwa ngemeku, ndi vakalya.<verse eid="GEN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4" />Nambu kwakona vangagona, vandu voha va pamulima wa Sodoma vasongolo na vagogo, changali kusigalila hati mmonga, vakayitindila nyumba ya Lutu. <verse eid="GEN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5" />Vakamkemela Lutu na kumkota, “Vavii kwoki vandu vala vevabwelili kwaku kilu iyi? Vahumisa kuvala tigana kugona nawu.”<verse eid="GEN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6" />Lutu akahuma kuvala, akadinda mlyangu chamumbele, <verse eid="GEN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7" />akavajovela, “Chondi mwavamkozi vangu. Mkoto kukita uhakau wenuwu! <verse eid="GEN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8" />Mlola, nivii navu vasikana vavili katu vakona vagonikini lepi na mgosi. Chondi nikuvayupa nivaletela vasikana vangu na nyenye muvakitila chochoha chemwigana. Nambu mkoto kuvakitila chochoha vagosi ava, ndava vayehe vangu.”<verse eid="GEN 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9" />Vakamyangula, “Wuka.” Vakayendelela kujova, “Mundu uyu abwelili kutama pamulima witu ngati myehe nambu hinu akujikita muhamula witu! Yati tikumhengela gahakau kuliku venavo.” Vakamkang'a neju Lutu na kugana kudenya mlyangu. <verse eid="GEN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10" />Nambu vayehe vala vakatalambula mawoko gavi, vakamhutila Lutu mugati ya nyumba na kudinda mlyangu. <verse eid="GEN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11" />Kangi vakavakoyosa mihu vandu vala, vagosi voha vevayimili pamlyangu, vasongolo na vagogo, penapo vahotwili lepi kavili kuuwona mlyangu.<verse eid="GEN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lutu iwuka ku Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12" />Vandu vavili vala vakamjovela Lutu, “Uvii navu vandu vangi penapa, vakuhanu vaku, vana vaku vagosi na vadala, amala yungi yoyoha mweitama muji wenuwu? Vawusa pandu penapa, <verse eid="GEN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13" />ndava tikupakomakesa pandu penapa. Ndava malovi gahakahu neju ga vandu ava gamuhikili Bambu na mwene atitumili tete tipakomakesa.”<verse eid="GEN 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14" />Ndava yeniyo Lutu akahamba kwa vasongolo vevagana kuvagega vasikana vaki akavajovela, “Muwukayi kanyata pandu apa, ndava Bambu avii papipi kuukoma mulima uwu!” Nambu vene vakahololela kuvya ijova udesi.<verse eid="GEN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15" />Kwepachili, vamitumi va kunani vala vakamung'ang'anisa Lutu, vakamjovela, “Wuka kanyata! Mtola mdala waku na vasikana vaku vavili muwuka, ngati lepi ya mkomiwa peukomiwa mulima wenuwu.” <verse eid="GEN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16" />Lutu akalyungalyunga, vandu vala vakamkamula chiwoko chaki, na chiwoko cha mdala waki, na hiwoko ya vasikana vaki vavili vala, vakavahumisa kuvala ya mulima wula, muni Bambu avahengili lipyana. <verse eid="GEN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17" />Pevamalili kuvahumisa kuvala, mtumu mmonga akavajovela, “Mujumbayi ndava ya kujisangula! Nambu mukotoka kung'anamka mumbele mewa mkotoka kuyima popoha mulikemba lenili! Jisangula kwa kutilila kuhitumbi, walakomewa.”<verse eid="GEN 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18" />Lutu akavayangula, “Yikoto kuvya chenicho, mwavakulu vangu. <verse eid="GEN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19" />Chakaka kuvya nene namvanda winu munihengili lipyana, na nyenye mulangisi ubwina uvaha neju kusangula wumi wangu. Nambu nihotola lepi kujumbalila kuhitumbi. Yati nikomiwa kwakona nangahika kuhitumbi. <verse eid="GEN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20" />Mlola, kula kuvii na muji udebe wenihotola kutilila ndava uvi papipi. Hinu Muniyidakila nitilalila kwenuko, ndi yati nisanguliwa wumi wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21" />Akamyangula, “Goha genago, nikuyidakili. Yati nikomakesa lepi muji wenuwo weujovili. <verse eid="GEN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22" />Kita kanyata kutilila kwenuko, nene yati nikita lepi loloha mbaka uhika kwenuko.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:22">Pegamaliki genago muji wenuo wakemeliwi Soali.<verse eid="GEN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukomakeswa kwa Sodoma na Gomola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23" />Lutu ahikili pamuji wa Soali lukumbi lwa mbalala. <verse eid="GEN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24" />Ndi Bambu akahelesa motu ukali na mangwala kuhuma kunani kwaki kuyocha miji ya Sodoma na Gomola. <verse eid="GEN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25" />Ndi akatinyisa miji yila, likemba loha, vandu voha va mulima pamonga na mikongo na manyahi gegamelili penapo. <verse eid="GEN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26" />Nambu mdala wa Lutu akalola mumbele, ndi akang'anamuka kuvya lipanda la mwinyu.<verse eid="GEN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27" />Chilau yaki lukela pee, Ibulahimu ahambili pandu pala peayimili palongolo ya Bambu. <verse eid="GEN 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28" />Peavili penapo akalola pahi upandi wa Sodoma na Gomola, na pandu poha palikemba, akalola lyohi lihuka, lyohi ngati lyohi lelihuma mulitembe livaha. <verse eid="GEN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29" />Bambu peatinyisi milima ya kunyasi kweatamayi Lutu, akamkumbuka Ibulahimu kwa kumuwusa Lutu kuhuma pamuji wenuo, muni Lutu akotoka kutinyika pamonga nawu.<verse eid="GEN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lutu na Vasikana vaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30" />Lutu akayogopa kutama ku Soali, ndava yeniyo akawuka muji wenuo, mwene pamonga na vasikana vaki vavili, vakahamba kutama kumbugu. <verse eid="GEN 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31" />Lukumbi vitama kwenuko msikana waki mvaha akamjovela mdebe, “Dadi witu ndi mgogolo, na kawaka mgosi mweakutigega muni tipata vana ngati cheuvi mvele pamulima woha. <verse eid="GEN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32" />Hinu, timgalisa dadi kwa divayi, muni tihotola kugona nayu na tivya na vana kwaki.” <verse eid="GEN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33" />Kilu yila vakamgalisa dadi wavi kwa divayi, na msikana waki mvaha akayingila akagona nayu. Nambu dadi waki amanyili lepi lukumbi msikana waki peagonili nayu amala peawukili.<verse eid="GEN 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34" />Chilau yaki msikana mvaha yula akamjovela mbena waki, “Golo kilu nagonili na dadi, mewa, lelu timgalisa divayi ndi akagalayi uyingilayi veve ukagona nayu, ndava yeniyo tavoha yati tipata vana ndava ya dadi witu muni chiveleku chaki kikoto kuyaga.” <verse eid="GEN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35" />Hinu, kilu yila mewawa vamgalisi mewa dadi wavi kwa divayi, kangi msikana mdebe yula, akayingila akagona nayu. Nambu dadi waki amanyili lepi msikana waki peagonili nayu mewa peawukili. <verse eid="GEN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36" />Ndava yeniyo ndi vasikana voha vavii va Lutu vakapata ndumbu kwa kugona na dadi wavi. <verse eid="GEN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37" />Msikana mvaha akaveleka mwana, akamkemela lihina laki Moabu, mwene ndi utumbula wa Vamoabu voha hati lelu. <verse eid="GEN 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38" />Mewa msikana mdebe akaveleka mwana, na mwene akamkemela Benami, mwene ndi utumbula wa Vaamoni voha hati lelu.<verse eid="GEN 19:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20" />
  <para style="s">Ibulahimu na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1" />Hinu Ibulahimu akayendelela kulongolo kuhuma kwenuko mbaka kumulima welihumila lilanga wa Kaanani na kutama pagati ya Kadeshi na Shuli. Kwa lukumbi ndu atamili ku Gelali, <verse eid="GEN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2" />kwenuko Ibulahimu akajova kumvala mdala waki Sala, “Mwenuyu ndi mlumbu wangu.” Kangi Abimeleki nkosi wa Gelali akalagiza vandu vamletela Sala, ndi akamtola. <verse eid="GEN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3" />Nambu Chapanga akambwelela Abimeleki mundoto lukumbi lwa kilu akamjovela, “Veve yati wifwa ndava ya mdala uyu mwemutolili, muni mwenuyu ndi mdala wa mundu.”<verse eid="GEN 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4" />Lukumbi lwenulo Abimeleki avii akona angagona na Sala, akayangula, “Bambu yati ukuvakoma vandu vangahoka? <verse eid="GEN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5" />Ibulahimu mwene ndi mweanijovili kuvya mwenuyu ndi mlumbu waki. Mewa hati Sala mwene ajovili kuvya Ibulahimu ndi mhaja waki! Nene nikitili chenikitili kwa mtima wabwina na nihokili lepi.”<verse eid="GEN 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6" />Hinu Chapanga akamjovela mundoto yeniyo, “Ena. Nimanyili kuvya ukitili chenichi kwa mtima wabwina, na nene nikudivalila ukotoka kukita gahakau, ndi muni nikuyidakili lepi ugona nayu. <verse eid="GEN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7" />Hinu umuwuyisa mdala uyu kwa mngwana waki. Ibulahimu ndi mlota, mwene yati akuyupila na veve yati wivya wilama. Nambu ngati umuwuyisi lepi, chakaka umanya kuvya veve yati wifwa pamonga na vandu vaku voha.”<verse eid="GEN 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8" />Chilau yaki akayimuka lukela pee, akavakemela vatumisi vaki voha, akavajovela malovi genago goha, na vene vakayogopa neju. <verse eid="GEN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9" />Ndi Abimeleki akamkemela Ibulahimu na akamkota, “Utikitili kyani? Nikubudili kyani mbaka uniletili misolo iyi nene na unkosi wangu? Unikitili mambu gangaganikiwa.” <verse eid="GEN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10" />Abimeleki akamkota Ibulahimu, “Ndava kyani unikitili naha?”<verse eid="GEN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11" />Ibulahimu akayangula, “Naholalili kuvya, vandu va apa chakaka mkumuyogopa lepi Chapanga, na ngavanikomili ndava ya mdala wangu. <verse eid="GEN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12" />Pamonga na ago, chakaka mwenuyu mlumbu wangu. Mwene na nene tivelekiwi kwa dadi mmonga, nambu tivelekiwi lepi kwa mau mmonga, ndi mana nikamtola avyayi mdala wangu. <verse eid="GEN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13" />Lukumbi Chapanga peanipeliki kumulima wa uyehe kuhuma panyumba ya dadi wangu, namjovili mdala wangu, ‘Pandu popoha petihamba nilangisa uganu waku na kujova nene ndi namhaja wako!’ ”<verse eid="GEN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14" />Kangi Abimeleki akatola mambelele na ng'ombi na vavanda va chigosi na vachidala akampela Ibulahimu, akamuwuyisa Sala kwa mngwana waki. <verse eid="GEN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15" />Kangi Abimeleki akamjovela Ibulahimu, “Lola mulima weuvi palongolo ndi wangu! Hinu, hagula pandu pewigana utama.” <verse eid="GEN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16" />Mewa akamjovela Sala, “Nimpeli mhaja waku maganga ga feza hipandi alufu yimonga, ndava ya kuvalangisa voha vevavi pamonga na veve kuvya wangahoka, kila mundu yati imanya kuvya wangahoka.”<verse eid="GEN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17" />Ndava ya gegahumalili kwa Sala mdala wa Ibulahimu, Chapanga adindili maleme ga voha vevavii munyumba ya Abimeleki vakoto kuveleka. <verse eid="GEN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18" />Kangi Ibulahimu akamuyupa Chapanga, ndi Chapanga akamlamisa Abimeleki na mdala waki na mvanda waki wa chidala hati vakahotola kuveleka vana kavili.<verse eid="GEN 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Kuvelekewa kwa Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1" />Bambu akamkumbuka Sala, akamhengela ngati cheamujovili. <verse eid="GEN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2" />Sala akavya na ndumbu, akamvelekela mwana mgosi Ibulahimu muugogolo waki, mulukumbi lula lweajoviwi na Chapanga. <verse eid="GEN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3" />Ibulahimu akamkemela mwana mweavelekiwi na Sala lihina laki Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4" />Isaka adumuliwi jandu na dadi waki peavii na magono nane, ngati Chapanga cheamulagisi Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5" />Lukumbi peavelekewayi Isaka, Ibulahimu avii na miyaka miya yimonga. <verse eid="GEN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6" />Sala akajova, “Chapanga anikitili luheku, mundu yeyoha mweiyuwanayi kuvya nivi na mwana yati iheka pamonga na nene.” <verse eid="GEN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7" />Akayonjokesa kujova, “Yani ngaahotwili kumjovela Ibulahimu kuvya Sala nene yati ninyongesa vana? Nimuvelekili mwana mgosi muugogolo waki.”<verse eid="GEN 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8" />Mwana akakula, akalekeswa kunyonga, ligono Isaka lealekeswayi kunyonga Ibulahimu akitili mselebuko uvaha.<verse eid="GEN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hajili na Ishimaeli vivingiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9" />Ligono limonga Sala amuweni Ishimaeli mwana wa Ibulahimu mweavelikwi kwa Hajili, Mumisili, ikina na Isaka mwana waki akumvevesa. <verse eid="GEN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10" />Sala akamjovela Ibulahimu, “Mvinga mvanda uyu pamonga na mwana waki, muni mwana wa mdala mvanda ihotola lepi kuhala vindu pamonga na Isaka mwana vangu.” <verse eid="GEN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11" />Malovi genago gamuvinisi mtima neju Ibulahimu ndava Ishimaeli avii mwana waki mewa. <verse eid="GEN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12" />Nambu Chapanga akamjovela Ibulahimu, “Kotoka kuviniswa mtima ndava ya mvanda na mwana waku. Muyidakila Sala cheakujovela, ndava chiveleku chaku chenikujovili yati chihumila kwa Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13" />Mwana wa mvanda waku mewawa yati nikumkita kuvya dadi wa mulima uvaha, ndava mwenuyu mewa ndi mwana waku.”<verse eid="GEN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14" />Ibulahimu akayimuka lukela pee, akatola chakulya na kahaku kachikumba kamanji akampela Hajili. Akavivika mumavega ga Hajili, akamuwusa pamonga na mwana vaki. Hajili akawuka, akalyungalyunga mulikemba la Beeli Sheba. <verse eid="GEN 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15" />Manji pegamaliki mukahaku kachikumba, Hajili akamgonesa mwana pahi ya mkongo. <verse eid="GEN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16" />Akahamba kutama utali ngati wa mita miya, akajova, “Nihotola lepi kumlola mwana vangu afwayi.” Peatamili papipi penapo akatumbula kuvemba kwa lwami.<verse eid="GEN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17" />Chapanga akamyuwana mwana ivemba, mtumu wa Chapanga akamkemela Hajili kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga na kumjovela, “Ung'ahika kyani Hajili? Kotoka kuyogopa muni Chapanga ayuwini lwami lwa mwana ivemba peagonili pala. <verse eid="GEN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18" />Yima umuyinula mwana na umkamula mumawoko gaku, ndava yati nikumukita avya dadi wa mulima uvaha.” <verse eid="GEN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19" />Kangi Chapanga akamdindula mihu Hajili ndi achiwene chiliva chechivi na manji. Ndi akachihambila akamemesa manji mukahaku kachikumba na kumunywiha mwana. <verse eid="GEN 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20" />Chapanga akavya pamonga na mwana peayendelelayi kukula, akatama kulugangatu na akavya mtova upindi mkekesi. <verse eid="GEN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21" />Peatama kulugangatu lwa Palani, ndi nyina waki akamugotolela mdala kuhuma ku Misili.<verse eid="GEN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibulahimu na Abimeleki vikita lilaganu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22" />Lukumbi lwenulo Abimeleki na Fikoli mkulu wa manjolinjoli gaki vakamjovela Ibulahimu, “Chapanga avii pamonga na veve mu kila chindu chewikita. <verse eid="GEN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23" />Hinu nilapakisa kwa lihina la Chapanga kuvya yati ukunikitila lepi gahakau nene, vana vangu hati chiveleku changu. Ngati nene chenivili msadikika kwaku na veve mewa uvya msadikia kwa nene na kwa mulima uwu weutama.”<verse eid="GEN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24" />Ibulahimu akajova, “Yati nilapa.”<verse eid="GEN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25" />Ndi Ibulahimu akamujovela Abimeleki mhalu kuchivala chiliva cha manji cheanyagiwi na vavanda vaki Abimeleki. <verse eid="GEN 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26" />Abimeleki akayangula, “Nimanyili lepi kuvya yani mweahengili chenichi. Veve wanijovili lepi na lelu ndi niyuwana.” <verse eid="GEN 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27" />Penapo Ibulahimu akatola mambelele na ng'ombi, akampela Abimeleki, ndi vavii venavo vakavika lilaganu. <verse eid="GEN 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28" />Ibulahimu akabagula mambelele gadala saba kuhuma mumsambi. <verse eid="GEN 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29" />Abimeleki akamkota Ibulahimu, “Mambelele aga saba gadala geugabagwili mana yaki kyani?”<verse eid="GEN 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30" />Ibulahimu akamyangula, “Nikupela kwa mawoko gangu namwene mambelele aga saba gadala kuvya ulangisu nene ndi mwenigimili chiliva ichi.” <verse eid="GEN 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31" />Ndava yeniyo pandu pala vapakemili Beeli Sheba, ndava penapo valapalini voha vavili.<verse eid="GEN 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32" />Pevamali kulagana ku Beeli Sheba kwenuko, Abimeleki na Fikoli mkulu wa manjolinjoli vaki ndi vakawuya kumulima wa Vafilisti. <verse eid="GEN 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33" />Ibulahimu akapanda mkongo wa mukwaju bahapo pa Beeli Sheba, na akamuyupa Bambu, Chapanga wa magono goha. <verse eid="GEN 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34" />Ibulahimu akatama pamulima wa Vafilisti ngati myehe kwa magono gamahele.<verse eid="GEN 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22" />
  <para style="s">Chapanga akumlagiza Ibulahimu amuwusa Isaka luteta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1" />Mwanakandayi Chapanga akamlinga Ibulahimu. Akamkemela, “Ibulahimu!” Ibulahimu akayangula, “Nivi apa.”<verse eid="GEN 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2" />Akamjovela, “Umtola mwana waku Isaka, mwana wa chiganu chaku mweavii mwene nduu, uhamba naku kumulima wa Molia. Kwenuko ukamuwusayi luteta ya kutinyiswa kunani ya chitumbi chenikulangisa.”<verse eid="GEN 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3" />Ibulahimu akayimuka lukela pee, akatendekeha lipunda ndava ya lugendu, akavatola vavanda vavili pamonga na Isaka mwana waki. Akatinya sagala ya kutinisila luteta lwenulo, ndi akatumbula lugendu kuhamba kuchitumbi cheajoviwi na Chapanga. <verse eid="GEN 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4" />Ligono la datu Ibulahimu akayinula mihu gaki, akapawona pandu penapo cha kutali. <verse eid="GEN 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5" />Akavajovela vavanda vaki, “Mutamayi apa pamonga na lipunda. Lukumbi nene na mwana vangu tihamba kula, kumuyupa, ndi tikamalayi yati tikuvawuyila.”<verse eid="GEN 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6" />Ibulahimu akatola sagala za kutinisila luteta, akamutwika Isaka, mwene akatola motu na chipula. Vakahamba pamonga. <verse eid="GEN 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7" />Isaka akamkota Ibulahimu, “Dadi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Mwene akayangula, “Ena mwana vangu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Isaka akakota, “Tivii na motu na sagala, nambu livii kwoki limbelele la kuwusa luteta ya kutiniswa?”<verse eid="GEN 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8" />Ibulahimu akayangula, “Chapanga mwene yati akutipela.” Voha vavili vakayendelela kuhamba pamonga.<verse eid="GEN 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9" />Peahikili pandu peajoviwi na Chapanga, Ibulahimu akajenga pandu pa maganga pa kuwusila teta, akavika sagala panani yaki. Akamukunga nyosi Isaka na akamugoneka panani ya pandu pa kuwusila teta. <verse eid="GEN 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10" />Ibulahimu akatalambula chiwoko chaki akatola chipula muni amuchinja mwana vaki. <verse eid="GEN 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11" />Nambu mutumu wa Bambu akamkemela kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga, “Ibulahimu! Ibulahimu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:11">Mwene akayangula, “Nivi apa.”<verse eid="GEN 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12" />Mutumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga akamjovela, “Kotoka kumlemasa mwana, na ukoto kumukitila chochoha. Hinu nimanyili kuvya ukumyogopa Chapanga, muni vaninotili lepi hati mwana waku ngayuyu.”<verse eid="GEN 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13" />Penapo Ibulahimu akalola cha kutindisa mihu, akaliwona limbelele ligosi lipatimi mang'elu palitutu la mumbele ya Ibulahimu. Akahamba akalitola limbelele lila ndi akaliwusa luteta pahala pa mwana waki. <verse eid="GEN 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14" />Pandu pala Ibulahimu akapakemela, “Bambu yati akutipela.” Ngati cheyijovekana mbaka lelu, “Muchitumbi cha Bambu, yati akutipela.”<verse eid="GEN 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15" />Mtumu wa Bambu akamkemela kangi Ibulahimu kuhuma kunani kwa chapanga, <verse eid="GEN 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16" />akamjovela, “Chapanga ijova naha, ‘Nilapili kwa mtima wangu kuvya ndava ukitili chenichi, vaninotili lepi mwana waku ngayuyo, <verse eid="GEN 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17" />chakaka yati nikumotisa na kukuyonjokesela vana vaku ngati ndondo vya kumahundi na ngati msavati weuvii kumbwani. Viveleku vyaku yati vitola miji ya vamakoko yivya yavi. <verse eid="GEN 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18" />Ndava uyidakili kukita genakujovili, ndi vandu voha va pamulima yati vimotisiwa kwa njila ya viveleku vyaku.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19" />Penapo Ibulahimu akavawuyila vavanda vaki, ndi vakawuka vakahamba voha pamonga ku Beeli Sheba. Ndi Ibulahimu akatama kwenuko.<verse eid="GEN 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Viveleku vya Naholi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20" />Pegamaliki genago, Ibulahimu akajovewa, “Mlongo waki Naholi apatili vana vagosi kwa mdala waki mwaikemiwa Milika. <verse eid="GEN 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21" />Mveleku wa kutumbula ndi Usi, mwealandili avi Buzi kangi Kemueli dadi wa Alamu, <verse eid="GEN 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22" />na Keseli na Hazo na Pilidashi na Yidilafu na Besueli.” <verse eid="GEN 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23" />Besueli akamveleka Lebeka. Milika akamveleka Naholi mlongo wa Ibulahimu vana venavo nane. <verse eid="GEN 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24" />Hawala waki Leubeni mewa avaveliki, Teba na Gahamu na Tahashi na Maaka.<verse eid="GEN 22:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23" />
  <para style="s">Kufwa kwa Sala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1" />Miyaka ya Sala yeatamili pamulima ndi yavii miya yimonga na ishilini na saba. <verse eid="GEN 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2" />Sala afwilalili ku Kiliasi Alabu ndi ku Hebuloni kumulima wa Kanaani. Ibulahimu akumvembenekela Sala na kumuyupila kwa Chapanga.<verse eid="GEN 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3" />Ibulahimu akayinuka peyagoniswi higa ya mdala waki, akahamba kulongela na Vahiti, akavajovela, <verse eid="GEN 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4" />“Nene nitama ngati myehe pagati yinu. Mnigulisila ndima ya matinda, muni nimuzika mdala wangu mweafwili.<verse eid="GEN 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5" />Vahiti vakamyangula Ibulahimu, <verse eid="GEN 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6" />Tiyuwanila, mkulu. Veve ndi wachilongosi witu mweumanyikana neju, mzika mdala waku mweafwili mulitinda loloha leuliganili pagati ya matinda gitu aga. Kawaka mundu mweakudivalila litinda ndava ya kuzika mdala waku mweafwili.”<verse eid="GEN 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7" />Penapo Ibulahimu akayinuka na kugundama palongolo ya vakolojinji va mulima wa Vahiti kuvasengusa. <verse eid="GEN 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8" />Akavajovela, “Ngati mukuniyidakila nimuzika mdala wangu mweafwili, chondi muniyupilayi kwa Efuloni mwana wa Sohali, <verse eid="GEN 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9" />ndi anigulisilayi mbugu yeyavili ku Makipela yeyivii mumbaka wa mugunda waki. Mumuyupayi anigulisilayi livyayi la matinda gangu, anipelayi kwa mashonga gegiganikiwa bahapa palongolo yinu.”<verse eid="GEN 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10" />Efuloni mwene avii bahopo pamonga na Vahiti venavo vevakonganiki palimlyangu la mulima. Ndi Efuloni Muhiti akamyangula Ibulahimu bahapo palongolo ya Vahiti voha. <verse eid="GEN 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11" />Akamjovela, “Lepi, mkulungu wangu, chondi uniyuwanila, nikupela mugunda woha pamonga na mbugu yeyavili mwenumo, nikupela palongolo ya vandu vangu, uzikayi vandu vaku.”<verse eid="GEN 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12" />Ibulahimu akagundama kangi palongolo ya vakolonjinji, <verse eid="GEN 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13" />akamjovela Efuloni, na vandu voha viyuwana, “Chondi uniyuwanila, yati nikulipa mashonga ga mugunda waku, nikuyupa upokelayi luhuna ulu muni nihotola kumzika mwenumo mdala wangu mweafwili.” <verse eid="GEN 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14" />Efuloni akayangula, <verse eid="GEN 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15" />“Niyuwanila, mkulungu wangu, mugunda wenuwu hipandi ya mashonga gaki ndi miya mcheche ndu, nambu zenizi ndi chindu lepi pagati yaku na nene? Mzika mdala waku mweafwili.” <verse eid="GEN 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16" />Ibulahimu akagayidakila malovi ga Efuloni, akampela hipandi ya maganga ga feza geajovili palongolo ya Vahiti, hipandi miya mcheche ya maganga ga feza, ngati cheyavili chipimu cha vagulisa vindu lukumbi lwenulo.<verse eid="GEN 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17" />Penapo mgunda wa Efuloni wewavii ku Makipela papipi na Mamle, pamonga na mbugu yeyavili mwenumo na hikongo yoha yeyavili mwenumo na mugunda woha, <verse eid="GEN 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18" />akapewa Ibulahimu, palongolo ya vandu voha vevavili penapo palimlyangu wa muji.<verse eid="GEN 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19" />Pegamaliki genago Ibulahimu akamzika mdala waki mweafwili mumbugu yeyavili mumgunda wa Makipela upandi wa Mamle, yeyivili ku Hebuloni mumlima wa Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20" />Hinu mgunda wa Vahiti na mbugu yeyavili mwenumo, apewili Ibulahimu yivya ndava ya kuvazika vandu vaki vevifwa.<verse eid="GEN 23:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24" />
  <para style="s">Isaka igega mdala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1" />Lukumbi lwenulo Ibulahimu avii mgogolo wa miyaka yamahele neju, na Bambu avili amotisiwi mu kila chindu cheakitili. <verse eid="GEN 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2" />Ligono limonga Ibulahimu akamjovela muvanda waki mweavii mgogolo kuliku vayaki, mweiyimalila vindu vyaki vyoha, “Vikayi chiwoko chaku pagati ya mawondo gangu. <verse eid="GEN 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3" />Na nene yati nikulapisa kwa lihina la Bambu, Chapanga wa pamulima na Chapanga wa kunani, kuvya yati ukumugegesa lepi mwana vangu msikana yoyoha pagati ya Vakanani venitama navu mumlima uwu. <verse eid="GEN 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4" />Nilapilayi kuvya yati uhamba kumulima wangu, na kwavalongo vangu, kumtolela mwana vangu Isaka mdala.”<verse eid="GEN 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5" />Mvanda yula akamkota, “Wu, ngati mdala uyo akabelayi kubwela na nene kumulima uwu? Wu, nimuwuyisayi mwana waku kumulima wewahumili?”<verse eid="GEN 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6" />Ibulahimu akayangula, “Katu, kotoka kumuwuyisa mwana vangu kwenuko! <verse eid="GEN 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7" />Bambu, Chapanga wa kunani, mweaniwusili munyumba ya dadi wangu mumulima wanavelikwi, na mweajovili na nene, anilapakisi kuvya mulima uwu yati akuvipela viveleku vyangu. Mwenuyo yati akupela mtumu waki akulongolela na veve ukamuletelayi mwana vangu mdala kuhuma kwenuko. <verse eid="GEN 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8" />Ngati mdala mwenuyo abelili kulandana na veve mbaka kuni, penapo chilapu changu yati chikukukunga lepi. Nambu kotoka kumuwuyisa mwana vangu kwenuko.” <verse eid="GEN 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9" />Mvanda yula akavika chiwoko chaki pagati ya mawondo ga Ibulahimu akalapa ndava ya genago.<verse eid="GEN 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10" />Penapo mvanda mwenuyo akatola ngamiya kumi ya mkulungu waki, akahamba kuni agegili njombi ndalindali. Akahamba mbaka kumuji kweatamayi Naholi, kumulima wa Mesopotamia. <verse eid="GEN 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11" />Peahikili akavafugamisa mafugamilu ngamiya pamuhana ya chiliva chechavili kuvala ya muji. Yavili kimihi lukumbi vadala pevihamba kunega manji. <verse eid="GEN 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12" />Na mwene akayupa, “Bambu wa mkulu vangu Ibulahimu, nikuyupa mambu aga gahotoleka bwina lelu, ulangisa lipyana kwa mkulungu wangu Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13" />Lola niyimili apa papipi na chiliva cha manji, na vasikana va vandu va muji vibwela kunega manji. <verse eid="GEN 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14" />Hinu yivyayi naha, msikana mwenikumjovela, ‘Chondi tula chihulu chaku cha manji unipela nene manji ninywayi,’ Mwene akajovayi, ‘Nywayi, mewawa yati ninywiha ngamiya zaku mewa.’ Mwenuyo ndi avyayi msikana mweumuhagulili mtangatila waku Isaka. Kwa kukita genago umulangisi ubwina mkulungu vangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15" />Kwakona angamala kuyupa, akamuhumila Lebeka kuni agegili chihulu pamutu. Avii msikana wa Betueli. Betueli avii mwana wa Milika mweavili mdala wa Naholi mlongo waki Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16" />Msikana mwenuyo panyambili neju, na avii akona angamanya mgosi tangiya kuvelekewa. Akahelela kuchiliva, akamemesa manji muchihulu akakwela. <verse eid="GEN 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17" />Ndi mvanda yula akamuhambila kanyata, akamjovela, “Chondi, unipele manji chidogo muchihulu chaku ninywe.”<verse eid="GEN 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18" />Msikana yula akamyangula, “Nywayi, mkulu wangu.” Akahulusa chihulu mumawoko gaki, akachikamulila ndava amunywihayi. <verse eid="GEN 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19" />Peamalili kumunywiha manji, akamjovela, “Yati ninega manji mewawa ndava ya ngamiya yaku, hinywayi mbaka hikolayi.” <verse eid="GEN 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20" />Ndi akakita kanyata, manji gegavi muchihulu chaki akahisopela ngamiya mu chindu cha kunywelela, akajumba kunega manji kuchiliva, akanywiha ngamiya zoha. <verse eid="GEN 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21" />Mvanda yula akamuhutusila mihu musikana changali kujova chindu, ndava amanyayi ngati Bambu amuhotwisi lugendu amala lepi.<verse eid="GEN 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22" />Ngamiya peyayukwiti manji, mvanda akampela musikana yula kipini cha zahabu ya yeyina utopa wa gilamu sita, na bangili zivili za mashonga gamahele. <verse eid="GEN 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23" />Penapo akamkota, “Chondi unijovelayi, veve wamusikana wa yani? Wu, kuvi fwasi ya kugona kunyumba ya dadi waku?”<verse eid="GEN 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24" />Lebeka akayangula, “Nene namusikana wa Betueli mwana wa Milika, mdala waki Naholi,” <verse eid="GEN 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25" />Akayendelela kujova, “Kunyumba yitu kuvi manyahi na vyakulya ndava ya hinyama, na pakutama nyenye pavili.”<verse eid="GEN 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26" />Ndi mundu yula akagundama na kumuyupa Bambu. <verse eid="GEN 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27" />Akajova, “Alumbiwayi Bambu, Chapanga wa mkulungu wangu Ibulahimu, muni akosiwi lepi kumuhengela ubwina na usadikika mkulungu wangu. Nene mewa Bambu anilongwisi mulugendu lwangu mbaka munyumba ya valongo vaki mkulungu wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28" />Musikana yula akajumba kuhamba kuvajovela vandu va munyumba ya nyina waki mambu ago. <verse eid="GEN 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29" />Lebeka avii na muhaja mweikemelewa Labani, mwenuyo ndi akayumbatika kuhamba kukonganeka na mvanda wa Ibulahimu kuchiliva. <verse eid="GEN 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30" />Kwakona angahamba Labani achiweni chipini chila pameng'elu na bangili mumawoko ga mlumbu waki, na kuyuwana malovi gala Lebeka geajoviwi na mundu yula, ndi akamuhambila na akamukolela ayimili papipi na ngamiya pachiliva. <verse eid="GEN 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31" />Labani akamjovela, “Ubwela kunyumba yitu veve mweumotisiwi na Bambu, ndava kyani uyima kuvala? Nene nimali kukutendelekela nyumba na pandu pa ngamiya.”<verse eid="GEN 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32" />Ndi mvanda yula akayingila munyumba. Labani akaziwopola mizigu mungamiya zila na kuzipela manyahi na chakulya cha mifuya, akampela manji ga kusanja magendelu mwene pamonga na vandu vealongosini navu. <verse eid="GEN 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33" />Vakamletela chakulya, nambu mwene akajova, “Nilya lepi mbaka nimalayi kuvajovela malovi genivii nagu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:33">Labani akamjovela, “Ena tijovelayi.”<verse eid="GEN 24:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34" />Akajova, “Nene namtangatila wa Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35" />Bambu amumotisi neju mkulungu wangu, na ana vindu vyamahele. Ampelili msambi wa mambelele na mene na ng'ombi zamahele, maganga ga feza na zahabu ampeli vavanda va chigosi na va chidala, ngamiya na mapunda. <verse eid="GEN 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36" />Lihina la mdala wa mkulungu wangu ikemiwa Sala, mwenuyo amuvelekili mkulungu wangu mwana muugogolo waki, na mwene ampeli vindu vyoha vyeavii navyu. <verse eid="GEN 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37" />Mkulu wangu anilapakisi, ‘Ukotokayi kumugegesa mwana wangu mdala pagati ya vasikana va kumulima wa Vakaanani venitama navu mumulima wavi, <verse eid="GEN 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38" />nambu uhambayi mbaka kumulima wangu na kunyumba ya dadi wangu, kwa valongo vangu, kwenuko ukamlondelayi mwana wangu mdala.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39" />Penapo nikamkota mkulungu wangu, ‘Wu, yati yivya wuli ngati mdala mwenuyo akabelayi kulandana nene?’ <verse eid="GEN 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40" />Nambu mwene akajova, ‘Bambu mweakunilongosa magono goha muwumi wangu, mwenuyo yati akunitumila mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapnga alongosanayi na veve ndi yati uhotola. Na veve yati ukumuletela mwana wangu mdala kuhuma kwa valongo vangu, na wa munyumba ya dadi wangu. <verse eid="GEN 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41" />Ndi ukahambayi ndu kulukolo lwangu, hati ngati vabelili kukupela musikana ndi yati ukungiwa lepi na chilapu changu.’”<verse eid="GEN 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42" />“Lelu panakahikili pachiliva nikayupa, ‘Chondi Bambu, Chapanga wa mkulungu wangu Ibulahimu, nikuyupa unihotolesayi lelu pa aga genikita, umukitilayi ubwina mkulungu wangu Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43" />Lolayi niyimili apa papipi na chiliva. Msikana yoyoha mweibwelayi kunega manji, nikamyupa manji gadebe ga muchihulu chaku ninywa, <verse eid="GEN 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44" />na mwene akayidakila na kunipela manji ninywayi, na ngamiya yaku mewa yati nikuzinegela manji zinywayi, mwenuyo ndi avyayi msikana mweahaguliwi na Bambu avyayi mdala wa mwana wa mkulungu wangu.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45" />Kwakona nangamala kujova mumutima wangu, akahumila Lebeka agegili chihulu pamutu, akahelela kuchiliva akanega manji, ndi nene nikamujovela, ‘Chondi ni niyupa manji ninywe.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46" />Ndi akahelesa kanyata chihulu pamutu na akajova, ‘Nywayi na ngamia zaku yati nikuzinywiha mewa.’ Ndi nikanywa mewa akazinywiha na ngamiya. <verse eid="GEN 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47" />Nikamkota, ‘Veve wamusikana wa yani?’ Mwene akayangula, ‘Dadi wangu ikemiwa Betueli, mwana wa Naholi, mweavelekiwi kwa Milika.’ Penapo nikamuwalika chipini mumeng'elu yaki na bangili mumawoko gaki. <verse eid="GEN 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48" />Kangi akafugama, na kumyupa Bambu. Nikamlumba Bambu Chapanga wa mkulungu wangu Ibulahimu, mweanilongwisi mbaka kwa valongo va mkulungu wangu nimtolelayi mwana waki mdala. <verse eid="GEN 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49" />Hinu, munijovelayi ngati mukumuhengela mkulungu wangu usadikika na ubwina, mujova ngati mukita lepi, nimanyayi chakukita.”<verse eid="GEN 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50" />Labani na Betueli vakamyangula, “Lijambu lenili lihumili kwa Bambu tete tihotola lepi kukujovela linenu loloha labwina amala lihakau. <verse eid="GEN 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51" />Lebeka uyu apa, umtola uhamba naku akavyayi mdala wa mwana wa mkulu waku ngati cheajovili Bambu.” <verse eid="GEN 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52" />Mtumisi wa Ibulahimu peayuwini malovi genago, Akagundama mbaka pahi palongolo ya Bambu <verse eid="GEN 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53" />penapo mtangatila mwenuyo akampela Lebeka vindu vyakujinyambisila vyevyatenganizwi kwa feza na zahabu, pamonga na nyula. Mewa avapelili vindu vya mashonga gamahele muhaja na nyina waki.<verse eid="GEN 24:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54" />Mtumisi wa Ibulahimu na vala veavii navu vakalya, na kunywa na kugona baho. Pevayimwiki lukela, mtangatila yula akajova, “Niyupa niwunye kwa mkulungu wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55" />Penapo mhaja waki Lebeka na nyina waki vakamjovela, “Linda kamwali atame hoti na tete lukumbi lwa magono kumi, na gakamalikayi ndi uhamba naku.”<verse eid="GEN 24:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56" />Mwene akayangula, “Chondi mukoto kunidivalila, muni Bambu amali kuhotosa lugendu lwangu, niyupa munileka niwuye kwa mkulungu wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57" />Na vene vakajova, “Linda timukemele hoti msikana, timukote mwene.” <verse eid="GEN 24:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58" />Ndi vakamkemela Lebeka na vakamkota, “Wu, yati uhamba na mundu uyu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:58">Akayangula, “Ena nihamba naku.”<verse eid="GEN 24:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59" />Penapo vakamulaga Lebeka pamonga na mdala mweamulelili kuhumila wana waki vahambayi pamonga na mtangatila wa Ibulahimu na vandu veavii navu. <verse eid="GEN 24:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60" />Vakamumotisa Lebeka, vakamjovela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 24:60">“Veve, wamulongo witu, uvyayi wamau wa vana maelufu kwa maelufu kumi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 24:60">Viveleku vyaku yati vitola miji ya makoko na kuvya yavi.”<verse eid="GEN 24:60" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61" />Penapo Lebeka na vavanda vaki, vakakwela ngamiya zavi vakamulanda mtangatila wa Ibulahimu, ndi vakawuka voha.<verse eid="GEN 24:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62" />Lukumbi lwenulo, Isaka awukili ku Belai Loi, na atamili upandi wa kusini wa mulima wa Kaanani. <verse eid="GEN 24:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63" />Ligono limonga, Isaka akahamba kumugunda kuholalela lukumbi lwa chimihi, pealolili akawona ngamiya zibwela. <verse eid="GEN 24:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64" />Lebeka pealolili na kumuwona Isaka, akahuluka pa ngamiya yaki, <verse eid="GEN 24:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65" />akamkota mvanda wa Ibulahimu, “Mundu mweigenda mumugunda mwaakutibwelela ndi yani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:65">Mvanda akayangula, “Mwenuyo ndi mkulungu wangu.” Penapo Lebeka akatola mtandilu waki akajigubika kumihu.<verse eid="GEN 24:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66" />Mvanda yula akamkokosela Isaka mambu goha geagakitili. <verse eid="GEN 24:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67" />Ndi Isaka akamutola Lebeka akayingila naku mulindanda la Sala nyina waki, penapo Lebeka ndi akavya mdala waki. Isaka akamgana neju Lebeka na akapoleswa mtima ndava ya lifwa la nyina waki.<verse eid="GEN 24:67" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25" />
  <para style="s">Viveleku vingi vya Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:32-33">1 Lus 1:32-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1" />Ibulahimu akagega mdala yungi, mweikemelewa Ketula. <verse eid="GEN 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2" />Mwenuyo amuvelekili vana ava, Zimlani na Yokishani na Medani na Midiani na Ishibaki na Shua. <verse eid="GEN 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3" />Yokishani amuveliki Sheba na Dedani, viveleku vya Dedani vavii Vaashulu na Valetushi na Valeumi. <verse eid="GEN 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4" />Vana va Midiani vavii Efa na Efeli na Hanoki na Abida na Elidaa, venavo voha vavii viveleku va Ketula.<verse eid="GEN 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5" />Ibulahimu amugotolili Isaka kila chindu cheavii nachu. <verse eid="GEN 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6" />Lukumbi Ibulahimu akona mumi akavapela njombi vana va chigosi va havala vaki. Kwakona angafwa akavapeleka upandi welihumila lilanga vatama kutali na Isaka.<verse eid="GEN 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufwa na kuzikwa kwa Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7" />Ibulahimu atamili miyaka miya yimonga sabini na mhanu. <verse eid="GEN 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8" />Kangi Ibulahimu afwili peatamili miyaka yamahele ya uhotola, muugogolo waki, akapumulila pamonga na vagogo vaki vevamlongolili. <verse eid="GEN 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9" />Vana va Isaka pamonga na va Ishimaeli vakamuzika mumbugu ya Makipela, papipi na Mamle mumgunda wewavii wa Efloni, mwana wa Sohali, kabila laki Muhiti. <verse eid="GEN 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10" />Ibulahimu agulili mgunda kwa Vahiti. Mwenumo ndi mwene pamonga na mdala waki Sala vazikiwi. <verse eid="GEN 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11" />Ibulahimu peamalili kufwa Chapanga ammotisi mwana waki Isaka. Na Isaka akatama papipi na chiliva cha Beeli Lahai Loi.<verse eid="GEN 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Vachiveleku va Ishimaeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:28-31">1 Lus 1:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12" />Ava ndi vana va Ishimaeli mwana wa Ibulahimu mweavelekiwi na Hajili mundu wa ku Misili mweavii yaya wa Sala, amvelekili Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13" />Mahina ga vana va Ishimaeli, gegayandikwi kulandana na chevavelekiwi, mweavili mtumbula ndi Nebayoti, vakalanda Kedali na Adibeeli na Mibisamu, <verse eid="GEN 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14" />Mishima na Duma na Masa, <verse eid="GEN 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15" />Hadadi na Tema na Yetuli na Nafishi na Kedema. <verse eid="GEN 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16" />Venavo ndi vana va chigosi va Ishimaeli, na genago ndi mahina gavi. Vavi vachilongosi va makabila kumi na gavili mewawa mahina ago ndi gavii mahina ga pandu pevatamili na vijiji vyavi. <verse eid="GEN 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17" />Ishimaeli afwili atamili kwa miyaka miya yimonga selasini na saba ndi afwili akagona pamonga na vagogo vaki. <verse eid="GEN 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18" />Viveleku vya Ishimaeli vatamili pamulima pagati ya Hawila na Shuli, papipi na mbaka wa Misili, kuhamba ku Ashulu. Venavo vayelewini lepi na valongo vavi viveleku vya Ibulahimu.<verse eid="GEN 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvelekewa kwa Esau na Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19" />Vyenivi ndi viveleku vya Isaka, mwana wa Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20" />Lukumbi Isaka peamgegili Lebeka mwana wa Betueli alameani kuhuma ku Padan Alamu mlumbu waki Labani, Isaka avii na miyaka alubaini. <verse eid="GEN 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21" />Isaka peamgegili Lebeka kumbi Lebeka avii ngaveleka, nambu Isaka akamuyupa Bambu na Bambu akaludindula lutumbu lwa Lebeka na akavya na ndumbu. <verse eid="GEN 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22" />Akavya na ndumbu ya mapaha, vana venavo vakang'ahana mulutumbu, Lebeka akajova, “Ndava kyani aga gihumila kwa nene?” Penapo akahamba kumkota Bambu.<verse eid="GEN 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23" />Bambu akamyangula,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">“Makabila gavili gavii mulutumbu lwaku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">Makabila gavili genago yati givya nakuyelewana tangiya mulutumbu lwaku.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">Limonga yati livya na makakala kuliku lingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">Mvaha yati akumuhengela mdebe.”<verse eid="GEN 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24" />Pegahikili magono gaki ga kuveleka, ndi Lebeka akaveleka vana vavili mapaha. <verse eid="GEN 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25" />Mweatumbwili avii mdung'u na higa yaki yoha yamemili mayunju, ndi vakamkemela Esau. <verse eid="GEN 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26" />Mwana wa pili avelikwi kuni chiwoko chaki amukamwili muyaki chinjekenjeke, penapo vakamkemela Yakobo. Lukumbi Lebeka akuvaveleka venavo Isaka avii na miyaka sitini.<verse eid="GEN 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau igulisa uvaha waki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27" />Vana vakakula, Esau akavya mulumba mkekesi wa hinyama, mweigana kugendagenda kudasi, nambu Yakobo akavya mpoli, mweigana kutama panyumba. <verse eid="GEN 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28" />Isaka amganili neju Esau ndava aganili neju kulya nyama za kudasi zeazangili Esau, nambu Lebeka amuganili Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29" />Ligono limonga Yakobo ateliki dengu, Esau akawuya kunyumba kuhuma kuzingila kuni avi na njala neju. <verse eid="GEN 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30" />Ndi akamjovela Yakobo, “Njala yikunivina, chondi nipela chakulya chidung'u icho nilye.” Ndi mana vamukemili Edomu mana yaki mudung'u.<verse eid="GEN 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31" />Yakobo akamyangula, “Yati nikukupela ngati unipelili uvaha waku nivya mveleku mtumbulanu.”<verse eid="GEN 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32" />Esau akajova, “Lola! Nene nivili papipi kufwa, uvaha wa uveleku mtumbulanu yati ukunitangatila kyani?”<verse eid="GEN 25:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33" />Yakobo akamjovela, “Nilapila hoti.” Penapo Esau akamulapila, na kumgulisila Yakobo uvaha waki wa kutumbula kuvelekewa.<verse eid="GEN 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34" />Penapo ndi Yakobo akampela Esau libumunda pamonga na msusi wa dengu, Esau akalya na kunywa, na akayinuka akawuka. Chenicho ndi Esau cheauvevisi uvaha wa uveleku waki utumbulanu.<verse eid="GEN 25:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26" />
  <para style="s1">Isaka na Abimeleki ku Gelali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1" />Hinu yikahumila njala yivaha pamulima wenuwo, yingi ndalindali ya yila yeyahumalili lukumbi lwa Ibulahimu. Isaka akahamba kwa Abimeleki nkosi wa Vafilisti, ku Gelali. <verse eid="GEN 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2" />Bambu akamuhumila Isaka akamjovela, “Kotoka kuhamba ku Misili, nambu utama pamulima wenikujovelayi. <verse eid="GEN 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3" />Tama pamulima wa uyehe kwa lukumbi ndu, nene yati nivya pamonga na veve na yati nikumotisa. Muni yati nikupela veve na viveleku vyaku milima yeniyi yoha na yati nitimilisa chilapu chenamulagizili dadi waku Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4" />Yati nikupela chiveleku chechivya chamahele ngati ndondo za kunani kumahundi, na viveleku vyaku yati nikuvipela milima yeniyi yoha. Kupitila viveleku vyaku vandu voha va pamulima yati vimotisiwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5" />Yati nikukumotisa ndava Ibulahimu aniyidakili nene, akakita chenaganili na malagizu gangu pamonga na mihilu yangu.”<verse eid="GEN 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6" />Hinu Isaka akatama ku Gelali. <verse eid="GEN 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7" />Vandu va pandu pala pevamukotili kumuvala mdala waki, akajova, “Mwenuyu ndi mlumbu wangu,” Ayogwipi kujova kuvya mdala waki ndava ya kuyogopa kukomiwa na vandu va mulima wula, muni Lebeka avii anyambili neju. <verse eid="GEN 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8" />Isaka peatamili kwenuko kwa lukumbi lwamahele, ligono limonga Abimeleki, nkosi wa Vafilisti, akalingulila palidilisa, akamuwona Isaka amunyambatili kuni akumpapaha mdala waki Lebeka. <verse eid="GEN 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9" />Abimeleki akamkemela Isaka na akamjovela, “Kumbi uyu mdala waku! Mboni wanijovili mwenuyu mlumbu waku?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 26:9">Isaka akayangula, “Ndava nayogwipi kuvya nganikomiwi ngati nganijovili mdala wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10" />Pena Abimeleki akamkota, “Ndava kyani utikitili naha? Ngati mgosi mmonga pagati yitu ngaigonekana na mdala waku, penapo veve ngautikitili tete tivya mukubuda.” <verse eid="GEN 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11" />Ndi Abimeleki akavalagisa vandu voha akajova, “Mundu yoyoha mweakumpanisa mdala wa mgosi uyu, yati ikomiwa.”<verse eid="GEN 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12" />Isaka akamija mbeyu mumuli, mumwaka wuwowo akabena mala miya, ndava muni Chapanga amumotisi. <verse eid="GEN 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13" />Isaka akavya na vindu vyamahele na vindu vyaki vikayendelela kuyonjoseka akavya na vindu vyamahele neju. <verse eid="GEN 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14" />Avii na msambi wa mambele pamonga na ng'ombi na vavanda vamahele neju, mbaka Vafilisti vakamuwonela wihu. <verse eid="GEN 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15" />Ndava yeniyo Vafilisti vakavihilalila viliva vyoha vyevyagimiwi na vavanda va Ibulahimu dadi waki peavi akona mumi.<verse eid="GEN 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16" />Penapo Abimeleki akamjovela Isaka, “Wuka kwitu muni veve unavindu vyamahele na unamakakala neju kuliku tete.” <verse eid="GEN 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17" />Ndi Isaka akawuka kwenuko akatendekeha lindanda mulikemba la Gelali, akatama kwenuko. <verse eid="GEN 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18" />Isaka akavihukula viliva vila vya manji vyevyagimiwi lukumbi Ibulahimu dadi waki akona mumi, viliva vyevyahilaliwi na Vafilisti lukumbi ndu Ibulahimu peafwili, akavikemela mahina galagala geavikemelayi dadi waki.<verse eid="GEN 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19" />Vavanda va Isaka vakagima mulikemba lila ndi vakapata chiliva chechina chinyepa cha manji gegipupuma. <verse eid="GEN 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20" />Nambu vadimaji va pa Gelali vajovisini na vadimaji va Isaka kuni vijova, “Manji aga gitu.” Penapo Isaka akachikemela chiliva chila Eseki, muni vajovisini navu.<verse eid="GEN 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21" />Vakagima kangi chiliva chingi, cheni mewa vakajovesana. Akachikemela Sitna. <verse eid="GEN 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22" />Kangi Isaka akahamba pandu pangi na akagima chiliva chingi. Chenicho vajovasini lepi, ndi Isaka akachikemela Leoboti akajova, “Hinu Bambu Chapanga atilekili fwasi, na tete yati tinekenala mumulima uwu.”<verse eid="GEN 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23" />Akahuma kwenuko akahamba mbaka ku Beelisheba. <verse eid="GEN 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24" />Kilu yilayila Bambu Chapanga akamuhumila akamjovela, “Nene ndi Bambu Chapanga wa dadi waku Ibulahimu, kotoka kuyogopa ndava nene nivii pamonga na veve, yati nikukumotisa na kuvayongesa viveleku vyaku ndava ya muhengaji wangu Ibulahimu.” <verse eid="GEN 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25" />Ndi kwenuko Isaka akajenga pandu pa maganga akamuyupa Bambu Chapanga. Kangi kwenuko akajenga lindanda, na vavanda vaki vakagima chiliva.<verse eid="GEN 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isaka na Abimeleki vivikilana lilaganu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26" />Lukumbi lwenulo Abimeleki akahuma ku Gelali pamonga na Ahuzati mkozi waki, na Fikoli mkulu wa manjolinjoli vaki vakamuhambila Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27" />Isaka akavakota, “Ndava kyani mubwela kwa nene kuni nyenye mwanivengili na kunivinga kwinu?”<verse eid="GEN 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28" />Vakajova, “Tamanyili chakaka kuvya Bambu Chapanga avii pamonga na veve. Hinu tiholalela kuvya yiganikiwa tivikayi chilapu pamonga na veve na tivikayi lilaganu na veve, <verse eid="GEN 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29" />kuvya yati ukutihengela lepi gahakau, ngati tete chetalekili kukuhengela gahakau. Takuhengili gabwina, tikakuleka uhambayi cha uteke. Ndi hinu veve umotisiwi na Bambu Chapanga.” <verse eid="GEN 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30" />Penapo Isaka akavatendelekela mselebuko wa chakulya ndi vene vakalya na kunywa. <verse eid="GEN 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31" />Chilau yaki vakayimuka lukela pehe pena vakavikilana chilapu. Pevamali Isaka akavahindikila na vene ndi vakahamba cha uteke.<verse eid="GEN 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32" />Ligono lilalila vavanda va Isaka vakamubwelela vakamjovela kuchivala chiliva chila, ndi vakamjovela, “Tigapatili manji!” <verse eid="GEN 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33" />Chiliva chenicho Isaka akachikemela Shiba, ndava yeniyo muji wenuwo ukemelewa Beelisheba.<verse eid="GEN 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau igega vadala Vahiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34" />Esau peavii na ntanga wa miyaka alubaini ndi akagega vadala vavili, Yudisi mwana wa Beeli na Basemati mwana wa Eloni. <verse eid="GEN 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35" />Nambu Vadala venavo vavakitili Isaka na Lebeka vavyai na mvinisu.<verse eid="GEN 26:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27" />
  <para style="s1">Isaka akumumotisa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1" />Isaka avii mgogolo na mihu gaki gakoywiki. Kangi akamkemela Esau mwana waki muvaha, akamjovela, “Mwana wangu.” Akayangula.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:1">“Ena dadi, nivi apa.”<verse eid="GEN 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2" />Isaka akajova, “Hinu nene namugogolo na nimanyili lepi ligono la kufwa kwangu. <verse eid="GEN 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3" />Hinu, tola upindi na mbeta yakuvikila migoha yaku, uambayi kudasi ukanizingila chinyama. <verse eid="GEN 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4" />Unitendelekelayi chakulya chechinoga ngati chenikuchigane nene chila, uniletelayi nilyayi, muni nihotola kukumotisa kwakona nangafwa.”<verse eid="GEN 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5" />Penapo Lebeka akayuwana malovi gala Isaka geamujovelayi Esau mwana waki. Esau peawukili kuhamba kudasi kuzingila na kuleta chinyama, <verse eid="GEN 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6" />Lebeka akamjovela Yakobo mwana waki, “Nimuyuwini dadi waku akumjovela muhaja waku Esau, <verse eid="GEN 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7" />‘Niletelayi nyama ya kudasi na unitendelekelayi chakulya chabwina, muni alyayi, na ahotola kumumotisa kwakona angafwa.’ <verse eid="GEN 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8" />Wamwana, wangu,” Hinu uyuwanilayi bwina malovi gangu na ukitayi chenikujovela. <verse eid="GEN 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9" />Hambayi kuchivaya katola mipapakasi ya mene hivili yehivii yabwina, muni nimutendelekelayi dadi waku chakulya chabwina ngati cheigana. <verse eid="GEN 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10" />Ndi umupelekela dadi waku alyayi na ahotola kukumotisa kwakona angafwa.<verse eid="GEN 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11" />Nambu Yakobo akamjovela Lebeka nyina waki, “Kumbuka mlongo wangu Esau anamayunju muhiga, na nene nivii nagu lepi mayunju. <verse eid="GEN 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12" />Pangi dadi yati igana kunipamisa, na nene yati nivye ninamakehu kwaki, hinu yati nijigotolele likoto pahala pa mota.”<verse eid="GEN 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13" />Nyina waki akamjovela, “Likoto lenilo linikolela nene, kitayi ngati chenikujovela, hamba katola mipapakasi ya mene uniletelayi.” <verse eid="GEN 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14" />Yakobo akahamba akatola mipapakasi hivili, akampelekela nyina waki, nyina waki akateleka chakulya chechinoga ngati chila cheakuchigana dadi waki. <verse eid="GEN 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15" />Penapo Lebeka akatola nyula yabwina ya Esau mwana waki muvaha yeavikayi mugati yaki, na akamuwalika Yakobo mwana waki mudebe. <verse eid="GEN 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16" />Akamuwalika mewa chikumba cha mipapakasi ya mene mumawoko, na pandu panyilili muhingu yaki. <verse eid="GEN 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17" />Ndi akampela Yakobo chakulya chila chechinoga mumawoko pamonga na libumunda lealitendelekili.<verse eid="GEN 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18" />Yakobo akayingila kwa dadi waki, akamkemela, “Dadi!” Dadi akayidika.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:18">“Ena! Veve ndi wayani wamwana wangu?”<verse eid="GEN 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19" />Yakobo akamyangula dadi waki, “Nene na Esau namwana waku mvaha. Nikitili ngati chewanijovili, chondi uyimukayi utama ulyayi chenikahambili kuchizingila, muni unimotisayi.”<verse eid="GEN 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20" />Isaka akamkota mwana waki. “Wamwana wangu upatili kwoki kanyata naha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:20">Yakobo akamyangula dadi waki, “Bambu, Chapanga waku anitangatili kupata kanyata.”<verse eid="GEN 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21" />Penapo Isaka akamjovela Yakobo, “Hinu hegelelayi wamwana wangu, muni nikupamisa nimanya kuvya veve ndi wamwana wangu Esau amala lepi.” <verse eid="GEN 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22" />Ndi Yakobo akamuhegelela Isaka dadi waki, akampamisa na akajova, “Lwami lwa mwana wangu Yakobo, nambu mawoko ndi mawoko ga Esau.” <verse eid="GEN 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23" />Amumanyili lepi, muni mawoko gaki gavii ganamayunju ngati ga Esau muhaja waki, ndi akamumotisa, <verse eid="GEN 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24" />akamkota kangi, “Wu, chakaka veve ndi wamwana wangu Esau?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:24">Akayangula, “Ena ndi nene.”<verse eid="GEN 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25" />Kangi akajova, “Niletelayi nyama yeuzingili wamwana wangu nilya, muni nikumotisa.” Pena Yakobo akamupelekela akalya, mewa akamupelekela na divayi akanywa. <verse eid="GEN 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26" />Penapo dadi akamjovela, “Hinu hegelela papipi, unikumbatila wamwana wangu.” <verse eid="GEN 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27" />Yakobo akahegelela akamukumbatila, Isaka akayuwana unungalilu lwa nyula zaki, akamumotisa chakujova, “Lola mwana wangu chewinungalila bwina ngati unungalilu wa mugunda weawumotisi na Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="GEN 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28" />Nikumyupa Chapanga akuyitilayi mbetu wa kunani kwaki na ludaka lwabwina pamonga na mota ya pamulima, mabenu gamahele na divayi. <verse eid="GEN 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29" />Vandu va milima yingi vakuhengelayi kangi vandu vamahele vakugundamila cha utopesa. Uvya wa chilongosi wa valongo vaku, na vana vagosi va nyina waku vakugundamilayi cha utopesa. Kila mweakupela likoto apewa likoto, kila mweakumotisa amotisiwayi!”<verse eid="GEN 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau iyupa amotisiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30" />Isaka paamali kumotisa Yakobo, na mwene Yakobo peahumayi palongolo ya dadi waki, ndi akayingila Esau muhaja Yakobo ihuma mukuzingila. <verse eid="GEN 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31" />Na mwene Esau akateleka chakulya chechinoga akamletela dadi waki, akamjovela, “Uyimukayi dadi ulyayi chenizingili nene namwana waku, muni uhotola kunimotisa.”<verse eid="GEN 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32" />Isaka akamkota, “Veve wayani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:32">Akayangula, “Nene na Esau, mvelekanu waku mtumbulanu.”<verse eid="GEN 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33" />Isaka akandendema neju, akajova, “Yani mwenayula mweazingili na kuniletela nene? Na nene nimali kulya kwakona veve wangabwela, na nimumotisi, na mwene chakaka amali kumotiswa!”<verse eid="GEN 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34" />Esau peayuwini malovi genago ga dadi waki, akavemba kwa lwami luvaha na cha mvinisu, na kumjovela dadi waki, “Chondi dadi unimotisayi na nene mewa!”<verse eid="GEN 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35" />Nambu Isaka akajova, “Mulongo waku abwelili akanikonga, ndi atolili mota yaku.”<verse eid="GEN 27:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36" />Esau akajova, “Ndi mana ikemelewa Yakobo? Anikongi mala zivili. Hoti aninyagili uhali wangu ngati mtumbulanu kuvelekwa, na hinu atolili mota yangu!” Akamkota dadi waki, “Wu, wanisigalisili lepi mota yoyoha ndava yangu?”<verse eid="GEN 27:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37" />Isaka akamyangula Esau, “Lola nimukitili Yakobo avya mtalalila waku, na valongo vaku voha vavyayi vatumisi vaki. Nimpelili mabenu na divayi. Nikitayi kyani ndava yaku mwana wangu, nihotola lepi kukukitila chochoha?”<verse eid="GEN 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38" />Esau akamjovela dadi waki, “Nambu dadi, uvii nayu mota yimonga ndu? Dadi wangu, unimotisayi na nene!” Penapo Esau akavemba kwa lwami luvaha.<verse eid="GEN 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39" />Ndi, Isaka akamyangula, akamjovela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">“Kutama yati kuvya patali na ndima yeyina ludaka lwa bwina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">Na yati uvya patali na mbetu wa kunani.<verse eid="GEN 27:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40" />Cha utame kwa upanga waku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">Na veve yati ukumuhengela mulongo waku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">Nambu ukambela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">Yati uhuma mmawoko gaki.”<verse eid="GEN 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41" />Esau akamuvenga Yakobo ndava ya mota yeamumotisi dadi waki. Esau akaholalela, “Pegimalikayi magono ga malilu ga dadi wangu, ndi yati nimukome mbena wangu Yakobo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42" />Nambu Lebeka peayuwini maholo ga mwana waki muvaha, akamkemela Yakobo mwana waki mdebe, akamjovela, “Mulongo waku Esau igana kukukoma. <verse eid="GEN 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43" />Hinu, wamwana wangu, kitayi chenikujovela. Tilalilayi kwa muhaja wangu Labani kula ku Halani. <verse eid="GEN 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44" />Ukatamayi kwenuko mulukumbi, mbaka ligoga la muhaja waku pelipola. <verse eid="GEN 27:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45" />Ligoga laki pelipolayi, na peikosewayi geumukitili, yati nileta mundu akuwuyisayi. Ndava kyani nyenye mwavoha mufwayi mwavavili kwa ligono limonga?”<verse eid="GEN 27:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isaka akumutuma Yakobo kwa Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46" />Lebeka akamujovele Isaka, “Mumtima wangu musangaluka lepi ndava ya ava vadala va Esau Vahiti. Ngati na Yakobo akagegayi mdala muvasikana va Vahiti, wumi wangu yati uvya na chiyonjokesu choki?”<verse eid="GEN 27:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1" />Kangi Isaka akamkemela Yakobo akammotisa na akamulagiza na kujova, “Kotoka kugega mdala kwa Vakanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2" />Wuka uhamba ku Padani Alamu, kunyumba ya gogo vaku Betueli, ukagegayi mmonga wa vasikana va mjomba waku Labani. <verse eid="GEN 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3" />Chapanga mweana uhotola akumotisayi uvyayi na uveleku uyonjosekayi neju, muni uvyayi dadi wa makabila gamahele ga vandu. <verse eid="GEN 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4" />Chapanga akumotisayi veve pamonga na viveleku vyaku ngati cheamumotisi Ibulahimu, uutola mulima weutama ngati myehe, mulima uwu Chapanga weampelili Ibulahimu!” <verse eid="GEN 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5" />Hinu Isaka akamutuma Yakobo, ni mwene akahamba ku Padani Alamu kwa Labani, mwana wa Betueli, wa likabila la Valami muhaja waki Lebeka, mweavii nyina wavi Yakobo na Esau.<verse eid="GEN 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau igega mdala yungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6" />Pena Esau akamanya kuvya Isaka amumotisi Yakobo na amupeliki ku Padani Alamu akalonda mdala. Akamanya peamumotisayi amubesili akotoka kugega mdala muvasikana va Vakanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7" />Mewawa Yakobo avii avayidakili dadi pamonga na nyina waki na avii ahambili ku Padani Alamu. <verse eid="GEN 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8" />Esau akamanya kuvya dadi waki avaganili lepi vadala va ku Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9" />Ndi Esau akahamba kwa Ishimaeli mwana wa Ibulahimu na kumgega Mahalati, msikana wa Ishimaeli mlumbu waki Nebayoti avyayi mdala waki pamonga na vadala veavili navu.<verse eid="GEN 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo ilota ku Beteli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10" />Yakobo akawuka ku Belisheba na kuhamba ku Halani. <verse eid="GEN 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11" />Lilanga palatimi pandu nunuyu ndi akatama penapo. Akavika liganga kumutu waki ngati msagamilu, akagona lugono. <verse eid="GEN 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12" />Akalota ndoto ayiweni ngazi yiyimikwi pamulima mbaka kunani kwa Chapanga, vamitumu va kunani vikwela na kuhelela. <verse eid="GEN 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13" />Na Bambu avi ayimi panani ya ngazi yeniyo, ndi akamjovela, “Nene ndi Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Ibulahimu na Chapanga wa Isaka, mulima weugonili panani yaki yati nikupela veve na viveleku vyaku. <verse eid="GEN 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14" />Viveleku vyaku yati vivya vyamahele ngati lububu lwa pamulima. Na vene yati vidandasika kuyelekela ku upandi wa kwe litipamila lilanga, na kwe lihumila na kunena na kunyasi. Kwa njila ya veve na viveleku vyaku vandu voha va pamulima yati vimotiswa. <verse eid="GEN 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15" />Nene nivii pamonga na veve, yati nikuvika bwina kila pewihamba na yati nikuwuyisa kavili mulima uwu. Yati nikukuleka lepi mbaka nikuhengelayi chila chenikujovili.”<verse eid="GEN 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16" />Yakobo akayimuka kuhuma mulugono, akajova, “Chakaka Bambu Chapanga avii pandu apa, nambu nene nikamanyi lepi!” <verse eid="GEN 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17" />Yakobo akayogopa ndi akajova, “Pandu apa piyogopesa neju! Chakaka pandu apa ndi nyumba ya Chapanga, na penapa ndi mlyangu wa kuyingila kunani kwa Chapanga.”<verse eid="GEN 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18" />Lukela pehe Yakobo akawuka, akalitola liganga lealigonalili lila ndi akaliyimika ngati lipanda akalinyunyusila mahuta panani yaki na kulinyambisa ndava ya Bambu. <verse eid="GEN 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19" />Pandu pala Yakobo apakemili Beteli, mana yaki ndi nyumba ya Chapanga, nambu mulima wula pakutumbula wakemeliwi Luzu. <verse eid="GEN 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20" />Pena Yakobo akalapa kwa Chapanga akajova, “Ngati Chapanga ukavyayi pamonga na nene na kuniyunga mulugendu lwangu, na ukanipelayi chakulya nilyayi na nyula niwalayi, <verse eid="GEN 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21" />na nikawuya bwina kwa dadi wangu, ndi Bambu yati uvya Chapanga wangu. <verse eid="GEN 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22" />Liganga ili leniliyimiki apa ngati lipanda ndi yati pivya pandu pa kumuyupila Chapanga, na vyoha vyaunipelili yati nikuwusila lilundu la kumi.”<verse eid="GEN 28:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo ihika kunyumba ya Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1" />Yakobo akayendelela na lugengu lwaki na akahika kumilima ya vandu va kwelihumila lilanga. <verse eid="GEN 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2" />Kwenuko kumtambu wa dasi akachiwona chiliva, pamuhana waki gavii mambelele misambi yidatu gagonili. Gavii ganywiswayi muchiliva chechagubikwi kwa liganga livaha. <verse eid="GEN 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3" />Misambi yoha ya mambelele pegikonganeka penapo, vadimaji vakulibilingusa liganga lenilo liwuka pamulomo wa chiliva na kunyweha mambelele. Vakamalayi vakuliwuyisa kangi pamulomo wa chiliva.<verse eid="GEN 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4" />Yakobo akavakota vadimaji, “Mwavankozi vangu, nyenye mwavandu va koki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:4">Vakayangula, “Tete tavandu va ku Halani?”<verse eid="GEN 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5" />Akavakota, “Mumumanyili Labani, mjukulu wa Naholi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:5">Vakayangula, “Ena, timumanyili.”<verse eid="GEN 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6" />Kangi Yakobo akavakota, “Wu, Labani ayimwiki bwina?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:6">Vakamyangula, “Avi bwina, hati msikana waki yula ibwela Laheli na mambelele.”<verse eid="GEN 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7" />Yakobo akavajovela, “Hinu kwakona muhi, lukumbi lepi lwa kuvika mambelele pamonga, muganywihayi manji na muhambayi kugadima.”<verse eid="GEN 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8" />Vakayangula, “Tihotola lepi, mbaka misambi yoha ya mambelele gakonganekayi ndi tibilindusa liganga na tinywisa.”<verse eid="GEN 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9" />Yakobo peavii akona ilongela na venavo, akahika Laheli alongwisi mambelele ga dadi waki, muni avii mdimaji. <verse eid="GEN 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10" />Yakobo peamuweni Laheli msikana wa mjomba waki Labani, na mambelele ga Labani, akahamba kuliwusa liganga pachiliva pala, akaganywiha mambelele ga mjomba waki. <verse eid="GEN 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11" />Yakobo akamkumbatila Laheli, akatumbula kuvemba kwa lwami. <verse eid="GEN 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12" />Yakobo akamjovela Laheli kuvya mwene ndi mjomba wa dadi waki na mewa ndi mwana wa Lebeka, penapo Laheli akajumba kunyumba kumjovela dadi waki mambu genago.<verse eid="GEN 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13" />Bahapo Labani peayuwini mambu ga Yakobo, msengesana waki, akayumbatika kumpokela akamukumbatila cha uganu akamukalibisa kunyumba yaki. Kangi Yakobo akamukokosela Labani mambu goha gegahumalili. <verse eid="GEN 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14" />Labani akajova, “Veve ndi mlongo wangu ngasi yimonga na nene.” Yakobo akatama naku kwa lukumbi lwa mwehi woha.<verse eid="GEN 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo igega vasikana va Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15" />Ligono limonga Labani akamjovela Yakobo, “Veve wamulongo wangu njwee, yiganikiwa lepi unihengela waka, jovayi ugana nikupela luhuna lwoki?” <verse eid="GEN 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16" />Labani avii na vasikana vavili, muvaha ikemelewa Lea, na mudebe lihina laki Laheli. <verse eid="GEN 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17" />Lea mihu gaki galembukayi, nambu Laheli avii mbwina wa higa na anyambili bwina.<verse eid="GEN 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18" />Yakobo amuganili Laheli, ndi akajova, “Yati nikuhengela kwa miyaka saba, luhuna lwangu ndi unigegesa Laheli mwana waku mudebe.”<verse eid="GEN 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19" />Labani akajova, “Mbanga Laheli nikupe veve, kuliku kuvapela vangi yendelela kutama penapa na nene.” <verse eid="GEN 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20" />Penapo Yakobo akamuhengela Labani miyaka saba ndava ya kumupata Laheli, nambu kwaki miyaka yeniyo akayiwona ngati magono gadebe ndu ndava cheamuganili Laheli.<verse eid="GEN 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21" />Kangi Yakobo akamjovela Labani, “Nipela mdala wangu muni nihotola kumgega, ndava miyaka yangu yimaliki.” <verse eid="GEN 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22" />Ndi Labani akavagongolela vandu voha va pandu pala na akakita mselebuko wa mtimbu. <verse eid="GEN 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23" />Nambu peyavii kilu Labani akamutola Lea msikana waki muvaha, akamuleta kwa Yakobo, na Yakobo akagona nayu. <verse eid="GEN 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24" />Labani akamutola Zilipa mvanda waki wa chidala, akampela Lea avyayi mvanda waki. <verse eid="GEN 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25" />Pelwahikili lukela Yakobo akamanya kumbi apewi Lea! Ndi akamkota Labani, “Ndava kyani unikitili naha? Wu, nakuhengili lepi ndava ya kumgega Laheli? Hinu ndava kyani unikongili?”<verse eid="GEN 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26" />Labani akamyangula, “Mvelu witu lepi tete kumugegesa mudebe na kumleka mvaha, titumbula mvaha. <verse eid="GEN 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27" />Mala hoti magono saba ga ndowa ya Lea, ndi na tete yati tikupela miyaka hingi saba ndava ya kumgega Laheli.”<verse eid="GEN 29:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28" />Yakobo akayidakila, akavya mumutimbu na Lea magono saba. Ndi Labani akampela Laheli avya mdala waki. <verse eid="GEN 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29" />Labani akamutola Biliha mtumisi waki wa chidala akampela Laheli avya mtumisi waki. <verse eid="GEN 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30" />Mewa Yakobo akagona na Laheli, akamugana neju Laheli kuliku Lea, akamuhengela Labani miyaka yingi saba.<verse eid="GEN 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vana va Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31" />Bambu Chapanga peaweni kuvya Yakobo amganili lepi Lea ndi akamukita aveleka vana, nambu Laheli akavya ngaveleka. <verse eid="GEN 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32" />Lea akavya na ndumbu, akaveleka mwana wa chigosi, ndi akamkemela Leubeni muni ajovi, “Hinu Bambu Chapanga agaweni mang'aiso gangu, hinu mngana wangu yati anigane.” <verse eid="GEN 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33" />Lea akavya na ndumbu yingi ndi akaveleka mwana wa chigosi, akamkemela Simeoni, akajova, “Bambu Chapanga anigotolili kavili mwana wa chigosi ndava ayuwini kuvya niganwa lepi.” <verse eid="GEN 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34" />Akavya kangi na ndumbu, akaveleka mwana wa chigosi akamukemela Lawi, ndi akajova, “Hinu mngana wangu yati ivya pamonga na nene, ndava nimuvelekili vana vadatu va chigosi.” <verse eid="GEN 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35" />Lea akavya na ndumbu kavili, akaveleka mwana wa chigosi, akamkemela Yuda, akajova, “Lukumbi ulu yati nikumulumba Bambu Chapanga.” Kangi Lea akaleka kuveleka vana.<verse eid="GEN 29:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1" />Laheli peaweni amuvelekili lepi Yakobo vana, akamuwonela wihu mulongo waki, ndi akamjovela Yakobo, “Nipela na nene vana, ngati lepi nifwa.”<verse eid="GEN 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2" />Yakobo akamuyomela Laheli, akamjovela, “Wu, nene ndi na Chapanga, mweakudivalili ndumbu na chiveleku?”<verse eid="GEN 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3" />Laheli akamjovela, “Apa avii Biliha mvanda wangu, gonekanayi naku ndi nene nipata uveleku kwa mwenuyo.” <verse eid="GEN 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4" />Penapo Laheli akampela Yakobo Biliha avyayi mdala waki, ndi Yakobo akagonekana naku. <verse eid="GEN 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5" />Kangi Biliha akavya na ndumbu, ndi akamuvelekela Yakobo mwana mgosi. <verse eid="GEN 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6" />Laheli akajova, “Chapanga anihengili lipyana, ayuwini kuvemba kwangu na anipelili mwana wa chigosi.” Ndi akamkemela mwana mwenuyo lihina laki Dani. <verse eid="GEN 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7" />Biliha, mvanda wa Laheli akavya na ndumbu kavili, akamuvelekela Yakobo mwana yungi wa chigosi. <verse eid="GEN 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8" />Penapo Laheli akajova, “Nibunini ngwala na mlumbu wangu na nene nihotwili.” Ndi mwana mwenuyo akamkemela Nafutali.<verse eid="GEN 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9" />Lea peaweni akotwiki kuveleka vana, ndi akamutola Zilipa mvanda waki akampela Yakobo avyayi mdala waki. <verse eid="GEN 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10" />Zilipa akamvelekela Yakobo mwana wa chigosi. <verse eid="GEN 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11" />Lea akajova, “Hinu mambu ganihambili bwina.” Akamkemela lihina laki Gadi. <verse eid="GEN 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12" />Zilipa mvanda wa Lea akamvelekela Yakobo mwana wa pili wa chigosi. <verse eid="GEN 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13" />Lea akajova, “Nivi na luheku neju, hinu vadala voha yati vakunikemela luheku.” Ndi akamkemela lihina laki Asheli.<verse eid="GEN 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14" />Lukumbi lwa mabenu ga nganu, Leubeni akahamba kumugunda akakolela mkongo wula mikiga yaki vadala vilya muni vapata ndumbu, ndi akazitola akamupelekela Lea nyina waki. Laheli akamjovela Lea, “Chondi nikuyupa unipele na nene mikiga ya mwana waku.”<verse eid="GEN 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15" />Nambu Lea akayangula cha ligoga, “Wu, wiholalela chindu chidebe veve kuninyaga mngwana wangu, na hinu wigana kutola na mikiga ya kunihotasa kuvya na ndumbu yila yeanipeli mwana wangu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:15">Laheli akayangula, “Ngati unipelili mikiga ya mwana waku, uhotola kugona na Yakobo kilu ya lelu.”<verse eid="GEN 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16" />Lilanga pelatipamayi Yakobo awuyayi kuhuma kumugunda, Lea akahamba kumukumbatila, akamjovela, “Lelu uganikiwa ugona pamonga na nene, muni nikulipili kwa mikiga ya kunihotosa kuvya na ndumbu ya mwana wangu.” Ndi Yakobo akagona nayu kilu yeniyo.<verse eid="GEN 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17" />Chapanga akayuwana kuyupa kwa Lea, Lea akavya na ndumbu akavelekela Yakobo mwana mgosi wa mhanu. <verse eid="GEN 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18" />Lea akajova, “Chapanga anipelili njombi muni namupelili mgosi wangu mvanda wangu.” Ndi akamkemela lihina laki Isakali. <verse eid="GEN 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19" />Lea akavya na ndumbu kavili, akamuvelekela Yakobo mwana wa sita wa chigosi. <verse eid="GEN 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20" />Ndi Lea akajova, “Chapanga anipeli njombi yivaha neju. Lukumbi ulu mngana wangu yati akunihengela kwa utopesa ndava muni nimuvelekili vana sita wa vagosi.” Ndi akamkemela lihina laki Zabuloni. <verse eid="GEN 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21" />Mwanakandahi akaveleka mwana mdala, ndi akamkemela Dina.<verse eid="GEN 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22" />Kangi Chapanga akamkumbuka Laheli akayamyngula kuyupa kwaki, na akamdindula lutumbu lwaki na kamkita kuveleka. <verse eid="GEN 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23" />Akavya na ndumbu, akaveleka mwana wa chigosi, akajova, “Chapanga aniwusili soni yangu. <verse eid="GEN 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24" />Akamkemela lihina laki Yosefu.” Akajova Bambu aniyonjokesa mwana yungi wa chigosi.<verse eid="GEN 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mifuya ya Yakobo yiyongeseka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25" />Laheli peamalili kumveleka Yosefu, ndi Yakobo akamjovela Labani, “Niyupa niwuyayi kunyumba, kumulima wangu. <verse eid="GEN 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26" />Nipela vadala vangu na vana vangu, venigotwili ndava kukuhengela niwuka navu, umanyi namuna yoki chenikuhengili.”<verse eid="GEN 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27" />Labani akamjovela, “Niyupa na nene nijove nimanyili kwa njila ya ulondola kuvya Bambu Chapanga animotisi ndava ya veve. <verse eid="GEN 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28" />Luwula luhuna lwewigana yati nikupele.”<verse eid="GEN 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29" />Yakobo akamyangula, “Wamwene umanyili chenakuhengili, na namuna mifuya yaku cheyayonjosiki mumawoko gangu. <verse eid="GEN 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30" />Muni kwakona nangabwela wavii na vindu videbe ndu, nambu tangiya nibwelili kwaku vindu vyaku viyonjosiki neju, Bambu akumotisi kila kwenahambili. Hinu mambu ga munyumba yangu namwene cha nikite ndali?”<verse eid="GEN 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31" />Labani akamkota, “Nikupela kyani?” Yakobo akamyangula, “Kotoka kunipela chochoha. Yati niyendelela kudima mifuya yaku ngati ndu unikitili chenigana. <verse eid="GEN 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32" />Niyidakila lelu nipitayi mumisambi yaku yoha ya mifuya, mumisambi nitola mambelele goha gegana mabala na madonyo, na mambelele goha gatitu goha kuhuma mumambelele genago, na mene yehina mabaka na madonyo. Lwenulo ndi cha luvye luhuna lwangu. <verse eid="GEN 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33" />Penapo ndi cha uuwone usadikika wangu magono gegibwela, peubwelayi kulola luhuna lwangu, mene yoyoha yangali mabaka amala madonyo, amala mambelele gangavya gatitu vikawonekanayi mumisambi yangu ndi yati umanya kuvya viyiviwi.”<verse eid="GEN 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34" />Labani akajova, “Chabwina! Yivyayi ngati cheujovili.” <verse eid="GEN 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35" />Nambu muligono lilolo Labani akahamba kuwusa mambelele gagosi goha gegana mabaka na madonyo na mbuguma zoha zezivi na mabaka na madonyo. Mewawa na kila hinyama vyevyavili na madonyo gamusopi, na mambelele goha gatitu, akavapela vana vaki vadima. <verse eid="GEN 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36" />Kangi Labani akajivagula patali na Yakobo lugendu lwa magono gadatu, ndi Yakobo akayendelela kudima mifuya ya Labani yeyasigalili.<verse eid="GEN 30:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37" />Yakobo akatola mambanda yivisi ga mikongo yeyikemiwa mlubina na mlozi na mwalamoni, akaziwusa mabasi, misitali yamusopi yiwonekanayi mumambanda geniyo. <verse eid="GEN 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38" />Mambanda genago akagayimika palongolo ya mifuya mu chindu cha kunywehela mifuya, pandu pepavii ndava ya mifuya kubwela kunywa manji. Muni mifuya yakwelini na kupata mgegu peyabwelili kunywa manji. <verse eid="GEN 30:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39" />Hinyama yikapata mgegu palongolo ya ndonga zenizo vakababa hinyama yeyivi na mabaka na madonyo.<verse eid="GEN 30:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40" />Mewa Yakobo akavagula mambelele gawana gene, akagakita galolesanayi pamihu na gala ga Labani gegavii gatitu na gegana mabaka na madonyo. Ahihangisini lepi na mifuya ya Labani ndi Yakobo apatili mifuya yaki mwene.<verse eid="GEN 30:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41" />Yikavya kila lukumbi lwa hinyama hyehikulupalili pehihamula, ndi Yakobo avikili mambanda genago palongolo ya vindu vya kunywihila manji muni hinyama yipata mgegu pa mambanda genago. <verse eid="GEN 30:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42" />Nambu avikili lepi mambanda genago palongolo ya mifuya yanga kulupala, ndi lukumbi luhupi ndu mifuya yehikulupalili hikavya ya Yakobo na yangakulupala hikavya ya Labani. <verse eid="GEN 30:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43" />Kwa njila yeniyo ndi Yakobo akavya na vindu yvamahele neju, mifuya yamahele na vavanda va chidala na vachigosi, na ngamiya na mapunda.<verse eid="GEN 30:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo akumutila Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1" />Yakobo akayuwana kuvya vana vagosi va Labani ving'ung'uta nakujova, “Yakobo ayivili vindu vyoha vya dadi witu, ndi mana ahotwili kuvya na vindu vyamahele.” <verse eid="GEN 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2" />Yakobo akalola kuvya Labani akumlola lepi bwina ngati cheyavili pakutumbula. <verse eid="GEN 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3" />Bambu akamjovela Yakobo, “Wuyayi mbaka kunyumba ya dadi waku, na kwa valongo vaku na nene yati nivya pamonga na veve.”<verse eid="GEN 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4" />Yakobo akatuma vandu vahambayi kuvakemela Kaheli na Lea vabwelayi kudasi kweidima. <verse eid="GEN 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5" />Yakobo akavajovela, “Niweni kuvya pamihu pa dadi winu pakunilola lepi ngati pakutumbula, nambu Chapanga wa dadi wangu avii pamonga na nene. <verse eid="GEN 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6" />Na nyenye mumanyili kuvya nene nimuhengili dadi winu kwa makakala gangu goha. <verse eid="GEN 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7" />Na dadi winu anikongili na ang'anamwiswi luhuna lwangu mala kumi, nambu Chapanga amlekili lepi anikitila uhakau. <verse eid="GEN 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8" />Ngati akajova, ‘Yehina mabala hivyahi luhuna lwaku,’ hinu misambi yoha yababili yehina mabaka, na ngati ajovili, ‘Yehina madonyomadonyo hivyai luhuna lwaku,’ hinu misambi hyoha yababili yehina mabala. <verse eid="GEN 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9" />Ndi Chapanga cheatolili mifuya ya dadi winu, akanipela nene.”<verse eid="GEN 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10" />“Palwahikili lukumbi lwa mifuya kuvya na mgegu ndi nikalota ndoto, mapongo goha gegakwela mbuguma zezina misitali na madonyomadonyo na mabala. <verse eid="GEN 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11" />Ndi Mtumu wa Chapanga kajova na nene mu ndoto, akanikemela, ‘Yakobo.’ Nikamyangula, ‘Eee, nivi apa.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12" />Akanijovela, ‘Lola mapongo goha gegikwela mbuguma gana misitali, madonyomadonyo na mabala. Ndava nigaweni mambu goha geakukitili Labani. <verse eid="GEN 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13" />Nene ndi Chapanga mwenakuhumalili kula ku Beteli, kula kwewaliyitalili liganga mahuta ndava ya kulinyambisa na kulapa kwa nene. Hinu wukayi mumulima uwu uwuya kumulima wawaveliki.’”<verse eid="GEN 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14" />Laheli na Lea vakamyangula Yakobo, “Wu, chisigalili chindu chochoha chechiganikiwa tete tichihala kwa dadi witu? <verse eid="GEN 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15" />Mwene akutihengela tete ngati tavayehe, muni lepi atigulisi ndu, nambu mewa itumili chila cheapewili ndava yitu. <verse eid="GEN 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16" />Chakaka vindu vyoha vyeanyagiwi na Chapanga vyenivyo ndi vitu tete pamonga na vana vitu, hinu chochoha cheakujovili Chapanga ndi ukitayi.”<verse eid="GEN 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17" />Ndi Yakobo akavakweha vana vaki pamonga na vadala vaki panani ya ngamiya vakawuka. <verse eid="GEN 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18" />Akayilongolesa mifuya yoha palongolo yaki na vindu vyoha vyeapatili ku Padani Alamu, akatumbula kuwuya kwa dadi waki ku mulima wa Kanaani, pamonga na vana vaki na vadala vaki. <verse eid="GEN 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19" />Labani ahambili kugadumula mangoma mambelele gaki, ndi Laheli akayiva michapanga ya dadi waki. <verse eid="GEN 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20" />Yakobo akamukonga Labani, wa kabila la Vashami, kwakubela kumjovela kuvya iwuka. <verse eid="GEN 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21" />Ndi Yakobo akatila pamonga na vindu vyoha vyeavili navyu, akayomboka mfuleni Fulati akahamba kumulima wa vidunda wa Gileadi.<verse eid="GEN 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Labani akumulanda Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22" />Ligono la datu Labani akajovewa kuvya Yakobo atolwiki. <verse eid="GEN 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23" />Ndi Labani akavatola valongo vaki va chigosi, vakamulanda Yakobo kwa lukumbi lwa magono saba, vakamukolela ku mulima wa kuvidunda wa Gileadi. <verse eid="GEN 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24" />Nambu Chapanga akamuhumalila Labani mundoto akamjovela, “Jiyangalilayi, kotoka kumjovela chindu chochoha chila chechivii chabwina amala chihakau.” <verse eid="GEN 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25" />Yakobo avii ajengili lindanda kumulima wa vidunda vya Gileadi, Labani na valongo vaki vakajenga lindanda lavi penapo.<verse eid="GEN 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26" />Kangi Labani akamjovela Yakobo, “Ndava kyani unikitili nene naha? Uvatolili na vasikana vangu ngati vavanda veuvakamwili kungondo? <verse eid="GEN 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27" />Ndava kyani unitilili chinunu na kunikonga? Ndava kyani wanilagili lepi, muni nganikulagili chiluheku na nyimbu na ng'oma pamonga na kanjeke? <verse eid="GEN 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28" />Ndava kyani waniyidakili lepi nivakumbatila vajukulu vangu na kuvalaga vasikana vangu? Chakaka ukiti uyimu! <verse eid="GEN 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29" />Nivi na uhotola wa kukulemasa, nambu Chapanga wa dadi waku akanihumalili kilu ya lelu, akanijovela, ‘Jiyangalila! Kotoka kumjovela Yakobo linenu loloha lila lelivii labwina amala lihakau.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30" />Nimanyili kuvya wanichengili ndava ya kunogela neju kuwuya kunyumba ya dadi waku. Hinu ndava kyani waniyivili na michapanga yangu?”<verse eid="GEN 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31" />Yakobo akayangula Labani, “Nayogwipi kukulaga ndava naholalili kuvya ngauninyagili vasikana vaku. <verse eid="GEN 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32" />Londayi wamwene na ukamukolelayi mundu yoyoha mweanamichapanga yaku akomewayi. Lolokehayi wamwene pagati ya vandu venivili navu na ngati ukachikolelayi chindu chaku tola.” Yakobo amanyili lepi kuvya Laheli ayivili michapanga ya Labani.<verse eid="GEN 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33" />Ndi Labani akayingila mulindanda la Yakobo na la Lea na la vavanda vavili vala kulonda michapanga, nambu aviweni lepi, ndi akahuma mulindanda la Lea akayingila mulindanda la Laheli. <verse eid="GEN 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34" />Laheli ndi mweatolili michapanga yeniyo ndi akavihiha pahi ya misagamilu ya kutandikila ngamiya na mwene na akayitamila. Labani akalonda lindanda loha nambu aviweni lepi. <verse eid="GEN 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35" />Pena Laheli akamjovela dadi waki, “Pepayi dadi kutoka kuniyomela nivii mumagono gangu ga mwehi ndi nihotola lepi kuyima nave uvii baha.” Labani akalonda michapanga yaki nambu ayiwene lepi.<verse eid="GEN 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36" />Ndi Yakobo akamuyomela Labani, akamjovela, “Kubuda kwangu ndi kwoki? Akamkojovela Labani, nihoki kyani mbaka ukunilandalila naha? <verse eid="GEN 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37" />Hinu umalili kulingulila mumizigu yangu yoha ndi uchiwene kyani chamunyumba yaku? Chivikayi apa palongolo ya valongo vaku na valongo vangu, ndi vene vahamulayi pagati yitu. <verse eid="GEN 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38" />Natamili na veve miyaka ishilini. Magono ago goha mambelele pamonga na mene yaleki lepi kubaba, ndi nalili lepi nyama ya mambelele gaku gagosi kuhuma mumifuya yaku. <verse eid="GEN 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39" />Nakuletili lepi hati ligono limonga chinyama chaku chechikomiwi na hinyama ya kudasi, na chechakomiwi nene nakuwuyasili, na veve waganyi nikuwuyasila chochoha chechayiviwi kilu amala muhi. <verse eid="GEN 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40" />Chenichi ndi chanatamili, muhi lilanga laniyakili na kilu mbepu yanibunili nagonili lepi hati padebe. <verse eid="GEN 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41" />Chenichi ndi chenatamili kwaku miyaka yoha ishilini. Miyaka kumi na mcheche nakuhengili ndava ya vasikana vaku vavili, na miyaka sita nahuhengili ndava ya kupata mifuya yaku, nambu veve wang'anamwisi luhuna lwangu mala kumi. <verse eid="GEN 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42" />Ngati Chapanga wa dadi wangu, na Chapanga wa Ibulahimu, na wogoyu wa Isaka ngavikotoka kuvya upandi wangu chakaka ngaunilekili nihamba mawoko gawaka. Nambu Chapanga agaweni mang'aiso gangu na lihengu lenihengili kwa mawoko gangu ndi mana akulakalili kilu ya lelu.”<verse eid="GEN 31:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Labani na Yakobo vivikilana lilaganu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43" />Penapo Labani akamyangula Yakobo, “Vadala ava ndi vana vangu, na vana vavii ndi vajukulu vangu, na vinyama ivi ndi vinyama vyangu, na vyoha vyeuvii navyu ndi vyangu. Nambu nene nihotola kukita kyani lelu kwa vana vangu pamonga na vana vevavaveliki, <verse eid="GEN 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44" />hinu tikitayi lilaganu pagati yaku na nene, livyayi chindu cha kutikumbusa chetilagini.”<verse eid="GEN 31:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45" />Ndi Yakobo akatola liganga na akaliyimamisa ngati lipanda. <verse eid="GEN 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46" />Yakobo akavajovela valongo vaki, “Mnonga maganga.” Vakanonga maganga vakagavika palilundu, ndi vakalya chakulya papipi na lilundu lenilo. <verse eid="GEN 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47" />Lilundu lenilo Labani akalikemela Yegali Sahaduta nambu Yakobo akakemela Galedi. <verse eid="GEN 31:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48" />Labani akamjovela Yakobo, “Lilundu ili la maganga yati livya ukumbuso wa malaganu gitu.” Ndi mana Yakobo akalikemela Galedi. <verse eid="GEN 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49" />Mewawa Labani akajova, “Bambu Chapanga ndi atilolayi hati tikavya kutali nene na veve.” Mewawa pandu pala pakemiwi Mizipa. <verse eid="GEN 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50" />Labani akayendela kujova, “Ngati ukavang'aha vasikana vangu amala ukagega vadala vangi, hati ngati tivii kutali ngambukukayi kuvya Chapanga ndi mweilola pagati yitu.” <verse eid="GEN 31:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51" />Labani akamjovela Yakobo, “Lolai lilundu ili la maganga na lipanda leniliyimiki pagati yaku na nene. <verse eid="GEN 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52" />Lilundu ili na lipanda lenili ndi yati vikutikumbusa, yati kuyomboka lepi lilundu ili na lipanda kubwela upandi waku kukulemasa mewa na veve yati uyomboka lepi lilundu ili na lipanda ili kubwela kunilemasa. <verse eid="GEN 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53" />Chapanga wa Ibulahimu na Chapanga wa Naholi na Chapanga ihamula pagati yitu.” Kangi Yakobo akalapa kwa Chapanga wa Isaka dadi waki kukamula malaganu genago. <verse eid="GEN 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54" />Yakobo akawusa teta ya kuhinja kuchitumbi na akavagongolela valongo vaki vabwelayi kulya chakulya, pevamalili kulya vakagona baho kilu yeniyo. <verse eid="GEN 31:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55" />Chilau yaki lukela pehe, Labani akavakumbatila vajukulu vaki na vasikana vaki akavamotisa, kangi Labani akawuya kunyumba yaki.<verse eid="GEN 31:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo akujitendekela kukonganeka na Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1" />Ndi Yakobo akatumbula kuhamba, vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga vakakonganeka naku. <verse eid="GEN 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2" />Yakobo peavaweni, akajova, “Venava ndi manjolinjoli va Chapanga!” Ndava yeniyo akapakemela pandu pala Mahanaimu.<verse eid="GEN 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3" />Yakobo akatuma vajumbi vamulongolela vahambayi kwa Esau mulongo waki, ku Seili kumulima wa Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4" />Akavalagisa naha, “Mukamujovela mkulu wangu Esau aga, mvanda waku Yakobo ijova, ‘Nitamili kwa Labani chiuyehe mbaka hinu. <verse eid="GEN 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5" />Nivii na ng'ombi na mapunda na mambelele na mene, vavanda va chigosi na va chidala. Hinu ndi nitumili ujumbi uwu kwa mkulu wangu ndava muni ukaniwonayi unihengela lipyana.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6" />Vajumbi pevawuyili kwa Yakobo, vakamjovela, “Tahikili kwa mlongo waku Esau, hinu mwene avi munjila ibwela kukonganeka na veve, avii na vandu miya mcheche.” <verse eid="GEN 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7" />Penapo Yakobo akayogopa neju na akavya na wogoyu. Akagava misambi hivili ya vandu veavii pamonga navu, mewa akavagava makundi gavili ga mambelele na mene misambi gavili gavili ng'ombi na ngamiya. <verse eid="GEN 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8" />Yakobo akaholalela, “Ngati Esau akauzangila msambi umonga, msambi weusigalilayi ndi yati wivya yegwa.”<verse eid="GEN 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9" />Kangi Yakobo akamyupa Chapanga, “Veve Chapanga wa gogo wangu Ibulahimu, Chapanga wa dadi wangu Isaka, veve Bambu mwewanijovili niwuyayi kumulima wangu kwa valongo vangu, wanilagazili yati ukunihengela gabwina. <verse eid="GEN 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10" />Nene niganikiwa lepi hati padebe ubwina wewanihengili na usadikika nene mvanda waku. Navili na ndonga ndu mumawoko gangu penayombokayi mfuleni uwu Yoludani, nambu hinu nivii nagu misambi iyi yivili. <verse eid="GEN 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11" />Nikuyupa unisangulayi kuhuma mumawoko ga mlongo wangu Esau, muni niyogopa yati akutizangila na kutikoma tete tavoha, vamau pamonga na vana. <verse eid="GEN 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12" />Veve wanilagisi kuvya yati ukunikitila gabwina na kuvikita viveleku vyangu vivya vyamahele ngati msavati wa kubwani wangavalangika.”<verse eid="GEN 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13" />Kilu yila ndi Yakobo akagona penapo. Kangi akavagula hinyama veavi nawu ampela njombi Esau mlongo waki. <verse eid="GEN 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14" />Mene zidala miya zivili na mapongo ishilini, mambelele gadala miya hivili na gagosi ishilini, <verse eid="GEN 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15" />ngamiya zidala selasini pamonga na vana vavi, ng'ombi zidala alubaini na zigosi kumi, mapunda gadala ishilini na gagosi kumi. <verse eid="GEN 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16" />Akavagotolela vavanda vaki kila mmonga msambi waki, akavajovela, “Munilongolelayi na pemwigenda mulekayi fwasi pagati ya msambi na msambi wungi.” <verse eid="GEN 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17" />Akamulagisa mvanda mwealongolili yula, “Peukonganekayi na mulongo wangu Esau na akakukotayi, ‘Veve wamuvanda wa yani? Uhamba kwoki? Na hinyama yeniyi ndi za yani?’ <verse eid="GEN 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18" />Ndi umujovelayi, ‘Vya muvanda waku Yakobo. Zenizi ndi njombi zenilagiziwi nimupelayi mkulu wangu Esau. Na mwene Yakobo akutilanda mumbele.’” <verse eid="GEN 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19" />Mewawa amlagizi genago kwa mvanda wa pili na wa datu na vangi voha vevayimalila misambi akavajovela, “Pemwikonganeka na Esau mumjovela genago. <verse eid="GEN 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20" />Mkotoka kukosiwa kumjovela, ‘Mvanda waku Yakobo ibwela mumbele yitu.’” Yakobo akitili chenicho aholalili, “Pangi yati nikumpolesa mtima kwa njombi zenimulongolisili, pangi penikonganekayi naku yati akunipokela bwina.” <verse eid="GEN 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21" />Ndi Yakobo akalongolesa njombi zaki, nambu mwene kilu yila akagona bahapo.<verse eid="GEN 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo ikemelewa Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22" />Kilu yiyoyo Yakobo akayimuka, akavatola vadala vaki vavili, na vana vaki kumi na mmonga, akavatola na vavanda vaki vavili, akayomboka pamfuleni Yaboki. <verse eid="GEN 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23" />Akavayombosa kumwambu ya mfuleni, akayombosa mewa na vindu vyoha vyeavii navyu. <verse eid="GEN 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24" />Yakobo akasigalila mwene, ndi akabwela mundu mmonga akakomana naku malimba mbaka hamba kucha.<verse eid="GEN 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25" />Mundu mwenuyo peaweni kuvya ihotola lepi kumuhotola Yakobo, ndi amtovili pachibuna chaki, ndi chikatenuka peavii itovana naku malimba. <verse eid="GEN 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26" />Penapo mundu yula akamjovela Yakobo, “Nileka nihambayi, muni kuvya lukela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:26">Nambu Yakobo akamjovela, “Nikuleka lepi katu, mbaka unimotisayi.”<verse eid="GEN 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27" />Mundu yula akamkota, “Lihina laku wayani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:27">Akamyangula, “Lihina langu Yakobo.”<verse eid="GEN 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28" />Akamjovela, “Yati ukemelewa lepi kavili Yakobo, yati ukemelewa Isilaeli, muni uhotolini na Chapanga na vandu na veve uhotwili.”<verse eid="GEN 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29" />Yakobo akajova, “Chondi nijovela lihina laku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:29">Nambu mwene akamyangula, “Lihina langu ve la kyani?” Kangi akamumotisa Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30" />Pandu pala Yakobo akapakemela Penueli akajova, “Nimuweni Chapanga kwamihu gangu na nene nifwili lepi.” <verse eid="GEN 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31" />Yakobo peawukayi pa Penueli lilanga lavii limali kuhuma, akagenda cha kuchipila ndava ya chibuna kutenuka. <verse eid="GEN 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32" />Ndi mana mbaka lelu Vaisilaeli vilya lepi mseketa wa chibuna, muni mundu yula amtovili Yakobo mseketa wa chibuna chaki.<verse eid="GEN 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo ikonganeka na Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1" />Yakobo akalola kulongolo akamuwona Esau ibwela pamonga na vandu vaki miya mcheche, ndi penapo akavavagula vana vaki pagati ya Lea na Laheli na vala vavanda vaki vavili va chidala. <verse eid="GEN 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2" />Akavalongolesa vatumisi pamonga na vana vavi, akalanda Lea na vana vaki, akamalakisa Laheli na Yosefu mwana waki. <verse eid="GEN 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3" />Yakobo mwene avalongolili palongolo ahambili kuni igundama pahi mala saba, mbaka peahikili papipi kwa mlongo waki. <verse eid="GEN 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4" />Nambu Esau akahamba kanyata kumpokela Yakobo na kumukumbatila na kumbusu, ndi voha vavili vakavemba. <verse eid="GEN 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5" />Esau pealingulili na kuvawona vamau na vana vavi, akamkota, “Vayani veulongosini navu ava?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:5">Yakobo akayangula, “Venava ndi vana vala Chapanga ampeli mtumisi waki kwa ubwina waki wa Chapanga?”<verse eid="GEN 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6" />Kangi vatumisi vala vakahegelela na vana vavi, vakagundama kwa utopesa. <verse eid="GEN 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7" />Mewawa vakamhegelela Lea na vana vaki na Laheli na Yosefu mwana waki ndi voha vakagundama cha utopesa.<verse eid="GEN 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8" />Esau akakota, “Mana yaku kyani misambi ihi yenikonganiki nayu kunjila?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:8">Yakobo akamyangula, “Naholalili kuhengelwa lipyana palongolo yaku veve wa mkulu wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9" />Nambu Esau akamyangula, “Wamulongo wangu nivi na vindu vyamahele neju. Vindu vyeuvii navyu vivyayi vyaku wamwene.”<verse eid="GEN 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10" />Yakobo akamjovela, “Kotoka kukita naha! Chondi ngati unipokili chiuganu, upokela na njombi izi zenikuletili. Chakaka chenipaweni pamihu paku, ndi ngati nipaweni pamihu pa Chapanga, ndava cheunipokili bwina. <verse eid="GEN 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11" />Chondi upokelayi njombi zeniziletili, muni Chapanga animotisi neju na nene nivii navyu vyoha vyenigana.” Yakobo ayendalili kumyupa neju mbaka Esau akayidakila kupokela njombi zila.<verse eid="GEN 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12" />Kangi Esau akajova, “Tiye tihambayi na nene yati nikulongolela.”<verse eid="GEN 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13" />Nambu Yakobo akamjovela, “Mkulu wangu umanyili kuvya vana ava ndi vang'enya, na kuvya mambelele na ng'ombi vyenivii navyu vinyongesa. Ngati tigendili kanyata kwa lukumbi lwa ligono limonga ndu, mifuya yoha yati vifwa. <verse eid="GEN 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14" />Mkulu wangu chondi nikuyupa ulongolelayi, na nene yati nikukulanda mbolimboli, yati nihamba ngati vana na mifuya chevihamba, mbaka penikuhikilayi kwenuko ku Seili.”<verse eid="GEN 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15" />Penapo Esau akamkota, “Manya nikulekela vandu vangu vangi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:15">Nambu Yakobo akayamngula, “Ndava kyani ukita chenicho? Yikola veve niyidakiliwa palongolo yaku mkulu wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16" />Ndi ligono lilo Esau akawuya ku Seili. <verse eid="GEN 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17" />Nambu Yakobo akahamba mbaka ku Sukoti, kwenuko ndi kweajengili nyumba na kujenga mandanda ndava ya mifuya yaki. Ndava yeniyo pandu penapo ndi akapakemela Sukoti.<verse eid="GEN 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18" />Yakobo peawuyili kuhuma ku Padan Alamu, akahika bwina kumuji wa Shechemu ku Kanaani, akajenga vindanda papipi na muji wenuwo. <verse eid="GEN 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19" />Pandu penapo peajengili vindanda agulili kuhuma vakolonjinji vachiveleku va Hamoli dadi wakii Shechemu, kwa vipandi miya vya feza. <verse eid="GEN 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20" />Kwenuko akajenga pandu pa maganga pa kuwusila teta, akapakemela Eli Elohe Isilaeli, mana yaki Chapanga, ndi Chapanga wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="GEN 33:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34" />
  <para style="s">Dina na vandu Vashekemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1" />Ligono limonga Dina, mwana wa Yakobo na Lea, akahamba kuvagendelela vadala va mumulima wa Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2" />Shekemu mwana wa Hamoli Muhivi, mweavili mkulu wa mulima wenuwo, peamuwene Dina, akamtola na kumlimba. <verse eid="GEN 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3" />Nambu Shekemu amuganili neju Dina mwana wa Yakobo, ndi akalongela naku cha kumubembelesa muni amugana. <verse eid="GEN 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4" />Penapo Shekemu akalongela na Hamoli dadi waki, akamjovela, “Chondi, unigegelayi msikana avya mdala wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5" />Yakobo payuwini kuvya Shekemu avevisi Dina msikana waki, akaguna nuhu mbaka pevawuyili vana vaki vavii vakona kwevidima. <verse eid="GEN 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6" />Pena Hamoli dadi waki Shekemu, akahamba kulongela na Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7" />Lukumbi lulwolwo vana va chigosi va Yakobo vawuyili kuhuma mukudima ndi pevayuwini chechihumalili, vakayoma na kumema ligoga, ndava Shekemu avakitili vandu va Isilaeli uhakau wa kugonekana na msikana wa Yakobo, muni lijambu lenilo labesiwi. <verse eid="GEN 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8" />Nambu Hamoli akavajovela, “Mwana wangu Shekemu umuganili neju msikana winu, chondi mumupelayi amgege. <verse eid="GEN 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9" />Hinu tipatanayi, tete tigega vasikana vinu na nyenye mugega vasikana vitu. <verse eid="GEN 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10" />Nyenye muhotola kutama na tete, na muhotola kutama popoha pamulima uwu, muhotola kugulisa vindu na mupata vindu vyamahele.”<verse eid="GEN 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11" />Hinu Shekemukamjovela dadi wa Dina pamonga vahaja vaki, “Niyupa muniyidikila, na nene yati nikuvapela chochoha chemwigana. <verse eid="GEN 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12" />Mnijovelayi malowola gogoha chemwigana na njombi yoyoha hati ngati yikavya yivaha, yati nikuvapela, ngati ndu munipelili msikana winu muni nimgega.”<verse eid="GEN 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13" />Hinu vana va Yakobo vakamyangula Shekemu na dadi waki Hamoli kwa udesi ndava Shekemu avii amali kumuhakasa mlumbu wavi Dina. <verse eid="GEN 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14" />Vakavajovela, “Tihotola lepi kumugegesa mlumbu witu kwa mundu angadumuliwa jandu, kukita chindu chenicho yati tipata soni na kuveveswa. <verse eid="GEN 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15" />Tihotola kuvayidakila kwa malagizu aga, muyidakili kuvya ngati tete, muvadumulayi jandu vagosi vinu voha vevavii kwinu. <verse eid="GEN 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16" />Kangi yati mgega vasikana vitu na tete yati tigega vasikana vinu. Ndi yati titama na nyenye na tivya tavamonga. <verse eid="GEN 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17" />Nambu ngati mwakabela kudumuliwa jandu, yati tikumutola mlumbu witu na kuwuka.”<verse eid="GEN 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18" />Hamoli na Shekemu vaganiswi na malagizu ago. <verse eid="GEN 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19" />Ndi msongolo mwenuyo akakita kanyata kukita ngati chevajovili muni amuganili neju msikana wa Yakobo, Shekemu ndi akatopeswa neju kuliku voha vevavii munyumba ya dadi waki.<verse eid="GEN 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20" />Hamoli na mwana waki Shekemu, vakahamba palimlyangu wa muji pandu pamngonganu wavi, vakalongela na vandu muji wavi. <verse eid="GEN 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21" />Akajova, “Vandu ava vamkozi vitu, ndi tivakalibisayi vatama pamulima witu na vagulisayi vindu, muni tivi na mulima uvaha, ukutikola tete na vene. Tete tigega vasikana vavi na vene vagegayi vasikana vitu. <verse eid="GEN 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22" />Nambu vene yati viyidakila kutama na tete na kuvya chindu chimonga kwa malagizu aga, kuvya tidumuliwayi jandu tavagosi tavoha ngati chevavili vene. <verse eid="GEN 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23" />Wu, mwilola lepi mifuya yavi va vindu vyavi vyoha lepi yati vivya vitu? Manya tivayidakila ndu vatama pamonga na tete.” <verse eid="GEN 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24" />Ndi vagosi voha vevavili penapo palimlyangu wa kuyingilila ndi vakavayidakila Hamoli na mwana waki Shekemu, ndi vagosi voha vakadumuliwa jandu.<verse eid="GEN 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25" />Pegamaliki magono gadatu, kuni vavi na mvinusu wa kudumuliwa jandu, vana vavili va Yakobo Simeoni na Lawi, vahaja vaki Dina, vakatola mapanga geganoliwi pandi zoha gavi vakauzangila muji chimfiyu na vakavakoma vagosi voha. <verse eid="GEN 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26" />Vakamkoma Hamoli na mwana waki Shekemu kwa mapanga gavi, vakamutola Dina munyumba ya Shekemu vakawuka naku. <verse eid="GEN 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27" />Pevamali kuvakoma ndi vana vangi va Yakobo vakabwela na kutola vindu vyoha kwa makakala mumlima wenuwo ndava vamuhakisi Dina mlumbu wavi. <verse eid="GEN 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28" />Vakatola mambelele gavi, ng'ombi zavi na mapunda gavi pamonga na vyoha vyevyavili mumuji wenuwo na vyevyavii kumigunda. <verse eid="GEN 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29" />Vakatola vindu vyavi vyoha, vana vavi voha na vadala vavi, na vyoha vyevyavili munyumba zavi.<verse eid="GEN 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30" />Kangi Yakobo akavajovela Simeoni na Lawi, “Nyenye muniletili nene mang'aiso kwa kunikita nivengwa na vandu va mulima uwu wa Vakanaani na Vapelizi, nene ninavandu lepi vamahele, hinu ngati vayolini kubwela kunihanganila ndi yati vakunikoma nene pamonga na nyumba yangu.”<verse eid="GEN 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31" />Nambu vakamyangula, “Wu, yavii chabwina vamukitila mlumbu witu ngati mkemi?”<verse eid="GEN 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35" />
  <para style="s1">Chapanga akumumotisa Yakobo ku Beteli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1" />Kangi Chapanga akamjovela Yakobo, “Tumbulayi kuwuka uhambayi ku Beteli ukatamayi kwenuko. Ukanijenjelayi pandu pa kuwusila teta nene Chapanga mwenakuhumalili pewamutilayi muhaja waku Esau.”<verse eid="GEN 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2" />Penapo Yakobo akavajovela vandu vaki na voha vevavii pamonga naku, “Mtagalilayi kutali michapanga ya chiyehe yemuvili nayu, mjitendekeha mwavene kuvya muyidakiliwi kumuyupa Chapanga na muwalayi nyula zamupya. <verse eid="GEN 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3" />Kangi tiwukayi tihambayi ku Beteli, kwenu nikamujengela pandu pa kuwusila teta Chapanga mweanitangatili lukumbi lwa mang'aiso gangu, Chapanga mweavii na nene kwoha kwenahambili.” <verse eid="GEN 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4" />Ndava yeniyo vakampela Yakobo michapanga yavi yoha ya chiyehe yevavili nayu, pamonga na ndolola zevawalili mumakutu, ndi akavihilalila pahi ya mkongo wa mwaloni wewavili papipi na Shekemu.<verse eid="GEN 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5" />Yakobo na vana vaki pevawukayi, Chapanga akavayogopesa vakolonjinji va miji yila, penapo kawaka mweavalandalili. <verse eid="GEN 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6" />Yakobo na vandu vaki voha vakahika pandu pepikemiwa Luzu mumulima wa Kanaani hinu pikemiwa Beteli. <verse eid="GEN 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7" />Kwenuko akajenga pandu pa kuwusila teta kwa maganga, akapakemela Eli Beteli, muni pandu penapo Chapanga amuhumalili Yakobo peamutilayi muhaja waki. <verse eid="GEN 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8" />Debola mweamuleli Lebeka mdala wa Isaka peavi mwana, akafwa vakamuzika kwenuko papipi na Beteli, pahi ya mkongo weukemiwa mwaloni. Penapo Yakobo akapakemela pandu pala Aloni Bakuti, mana yaki mkongo wa chivembu.<verse eid="GEN 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9" />Yakobo peawuyili kuhuma ku Padani Alamu, Chapanga akamuhumila kangi na kummotisa. <verse eid="GEN 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10" />Chapanga akamjovela, “Veve lihina laku Yakobo nambu yati ukemelewa lepi kavili Yakobo, tangiya hinu lihina laku yati livya Isilaeli.” Chenicho Chapanga akamkemela lihina laki Isilaeli. <verse eid="GEN 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11" />Chapanga akamjovela, “Nene ndi Chapanga mwenina uhotola woha. Ukavelekayi na kuyonjoseka. Mulima na vandu va milima yati vihumila kwaku, na vankosi yati vihumila muchiveleku chaku. <verse eid="GEN 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12" />Mulima wenavapelili Ibulahimu na Isaka yati nikupela veve, mewawa yati nikuvipela viveleku vyaku mulima wenuwo.” <verse eid="GEN 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13" />Chapanga peamalili kulongela na Yakobo pandu penapo, ndi akakwela kunani. <verse eid="GEN 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14" />Pandu pala Chapanga pealongili naku, Yakobo akayimamisa lipanda la liganga kwa kuyitalila panani yaki mahuta na kuyitalila teta ya mnyweso. <verse eid="GEN 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15" />Yakobo akapakemela Beteli, pandu pala peakonganiki na Chapanga.<verse eid="GEN 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laheli ifwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16" />Kangi Yakobo na vandu vaki vakayendelela na lugendu lwavi vakawuka ku Beteli. Pevavii munjila vakona vangahika ku Efulati, Laheli akavya na lipyanda neju la kuveleka. <verse eid="GEN 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17" />Peavili mumvinisu wenuwo, ndi mvelekisa akamjovela, “Kotoka kuyogopa, muni upatili mwana yungi wa chigosi.” <verse eid="GEN 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18" />Laheli peavi mukutyalatyala kufwa akampela lihina laki Benoni, nambu dadi waki akampela lihina Benyamini.<verse eid="GEN 35:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19" />Laheli akafwa, vakamuzika pamuhana ya njila yeyihamba ku Efulati, hinu yikemelewa Betelehemu. <verse eid="GEN 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20" />Panani ya litinda lenilo Yakobo akayimamisa liganga panani yaki mbaka lelu limanyikana kuvya litinda la Laheli. <verse eid="GEN 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21" />Isilaeli mewa ikemiwa Yakobo, akayendelela na lugendu lwaki ndi akajenga lindanda upandi wungi wa munala wa Edeli.<verse eid="GEN 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vana vagosi va Yakobo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 2:1-2">1 Lus 2:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22" />Isilaeli peatama pamulima wenuwo, Lubeni mwana waki akagona na Bilha, mweavi ngati mdala wa dadi waki, ndi Isilaeli akayuwana mambu genago.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:22">Yakobo avii na vana va chigosi kumi na vavili.<verse eid="GEN 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23" />Mwana mtumbula wa Lea ndi Leubeni mwene avii mvelekwa mtumbula wa Yakobo kangi ndi Simeoni na Lawi na Yuda na Isakali na Zabuloni. <verse eid="GEN 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24" />Vana va Laheli vavii Yosefu na Benyamini. <verse eid="GEN 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25" />Vana va Bilha mtangatila wa chidala wa Laheli vavii Dani na Naftali. <verse eid="GEN 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26" />Vana vevavelekiwi na Zilifa mvanda wa Lea vavii Gadi na Asheli. Venavo ndi vana vachigosi va Yakobo vevavelekiwi lukumbi peavili ku Padani Alamu.<verse eid="GEN 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isaka ifwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27" />Yakobo ahambili kwa dadi Isaka mweatamayi ku Mamle, papipi na Kiliati Alba mewawa pikemelewa Hebuloni, pandu pevatamili Ibulahimu na Isaka ngati vayehe. <verse eid="GEN 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28" />Isaka atamili miyaka miya yimonga na semanini. <verse eid="GEN 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29" />Isaka afwili avi mgogolo wa miyaka yamahele, vana vaki Esau na Yakobo vakamuzika.<verse eid="GEN 35:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36" />
  <para style="s">Viveleku vya Esau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:34-37">1 Lus 1:34-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1" />Vyenivi ndi viveleku vya Esau mewawa ikemiwa Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2" />Esau agegili vadala kuhuma kwa Vakanaani, Ada msikana wa Eloni wa likabila la Vahiti, Oholibama msikana wa Ana, mjukulu wa Sibeoni wa likabila la Vahivi, <verse eid="GEN 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3" />na Basemati, msikana wa Ishimaeli mlongo waki Nebayoti. <verse eid="GEN 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4" />Ada akamvelekela Esau mwana mgosi mweakemiwi Elifazi na Basemati amuveliki Leueli. <verse eid="GEN 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5" />Oholibama amvelekili Esau vana vagosi Yeushi na Yalamu na Kola. Venava ndi vana va Esau vavelekiwi peavi ku Kanaani.<verse eid="GEN 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6" />Esau akavatola vadala vaki, vana vaki va chigosi na vachidala na voha vevavili munyumba yaki pamonga na mifuya yaki na hinyama yaki yoha na vindu vayaki vyoha vyeavipatili ku Kanaani, akahamalila mulima wewuvii patali na mlongo waki Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7" />Awukili kwenuko ndava mulima wevatamayi mwene na Yakobo yavi yidebe kwa vene kutama pamonga, vavi na mifuya yamahele na vahotwili lepi kutama pamonga. <verse eid="GEN 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8" />Kangi Esau akahamba kutama ku Seili mulima weuna vidunda, lihina lingi la Esau ndi lavii Edomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9" />Vyenivi ndi viveleku vya Esau, dadi wavi Vaedomu vevatamili kumulima wa vidunda vya Seili. <verse eid="GEN 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10" />Aga ndi mahina ga vana va Esau, Elifazi, mweavelekiwi na Ada mdala wa Esau. Leueli mwana waki Besemati mdala wa Esau. <verse eid="GEN 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11" />Vana va chigosi va Elifazi ndi vavii Temani na Omali na Sefo na Gatamu na Kenazi. <verse eid="GEN 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12" />Elifazi mwana wa Esau mewa avii na ngati mdala waki lihina laki Timna. Mwenuyu amvelekili mwana lihina laki Amaleki. Genaga ndi mahina ga Ada mdala wa Esau. <verse eid="GEN 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13" />Na ava ndi vana va Leueli, Nahati na Zela na Shama na Miza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 36:13">Venavo vavii vana va Basemati mdala wa Esau.<verse eid="GEN 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14" />Oholibama mdala wa Esau, mweavi mwana wa Ana, mjukulu wa Sibeoni, amvelekili Esau vana vadatu vachigosi, Yeushi na Yalamu na Kola.<verse eid="GEN 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15" />Ava ndi vevavili manduna pagati ya uveleku wa Esau, ndi Elifazi, mweavili mmwana mtumbula wa Esau, vavii manduna va Lukolo lwa Temani na lukolo lwa Omali na lukolo lwa Sefo na lukolo lwa Kenazi, <verse eid="GEN 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16" />Kola na Gatamu na Amaleki. Venava ndi vevavili manduna va lukolo lwelwahumili kwa Elifazi ku mulima wa Edomu, venava vavii vajukulu va Ada.<verse eid="GEN 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17" />Leueli, mwana waki Esau, avaveliki Nahati na Zela na Shama na Miza kila mmonga avii nduna wa likabila laki. Voha venavo ndi vana vachigosi va Leueli kumulima wa Edomu, na vene vavii vajukulu va Basemati, mdala wa Esau.<verse eid="GEN 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18" />Vana vachigosi va Oholibama mdala waki Esau, vavii Yeushi na Yalamu na Kola, kila mmonga avili nduna wa lukolo lwaki. Venavo ndi vana va Oholibama mwana wa Ana, mdala waki Esau. <verse eid="GEN 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19" />Venavo ndi vana va Esau yani Edomu, na venavo ndi vavii manduna va lukolo lwavi.<verse eid="GEN 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Viveleku vya Seili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:38-42">1 Lus 1:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20" />Ava ndi vana va Seili, lukolo lwa Mholi, mkolonjinji wa mulima wula, venavo ndi Latani na Shobali na Sibeoni, na Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21" />Dishoni na Eseli na Dishani. Venava ndi vana va Seili vevahumili ku Edomu vevavili manduna va Vaholi pa mulima wa Edomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22" />Vana va Latani vavii Holi na Hemani na mlumbu waki Lotani akameliwi Timna.<verse eid="GEN 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23" />Vana va Shobali vavii, Alivani na Manahati na Ebali na Shefo na Onamu.<verse eid="GEN 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24" />Vana va Sibeoni vavii, Aiya na Ana. Ana ndi yula mweachiweni chinyepa cha manji ga moto kulugangatu, peadimayi mapunda ga Sibeoni dadi waki. <verse eid="GEN 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25" />Vana va Ana vavii, Dishoni na Oholibama, Oholibama avii msikana wa Ana. <verse eid="GEN 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26" />Vana va Dishoni vavii, Hemudani na Eshibani na Itilani na Kelani.<verse eid="GEN 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27" />Vana va Eseli vavii, Bilihani na Zaawani na Akani.<verse eid="GEN 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28" />Vana va Dishani vavii, Usi na Alani.<verse eid="GEN 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29" />Ava ndi vavii manduna va lukolo lwa Vaholi na Lotani na Shobali na Sibeoni na Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30" />Dishoni na Eseli na Dishani. Venava ndi vavii manduna va lukolo Vaholi, kulandana na lukolo lwavi kumulima wa Seili.<verse eid="GEN 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vankosi va mulima wa Edomu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:43-45">1 Lus 1:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31" />Ava ndi vankosi vevatalalili pamulima wa Edomu kwakona angatalalila nkosi yoyoha pa Isilaeli. <verse eid="GEN 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32" />Bela mwana wa Beoli avii nkosi wa mulima wa Edomu, na lihina likulu la muji waki ndi Dinihaba. <verse eid="GEN 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33" />Peafwili Bela, Yobabu mwana wa Zela kuhuma kumulima wa Bosila akavya nkosi. <verse eid="GEN 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34" />Peafwili Yobabu, Hushamu kuhuma mulima wa Vatemani akavya nkosi. <verse eid="GEN 36:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35" />Peafwili Hushamu, Hadadi mwana wa Bedadi, mwavahotwili Vamidiani kumulima wa Vamoabu akavya nkosi. Muji waki wavii Aviti. <verse eid="GEN 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36" />Peafwili Hadadi, Samula kuhuma mulima Masileka akavya nkosi. <verse eid="GEN 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37" />Peafwili Samula, Shauli kuhuma muji wa Lehoboti weuvii papipi na mfuleni Eufulate, akavya nkosi. <verse eid="GEN 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38" />Peafwili Shauli, Baali Hanani mwana wa Akiboli, akavya nkosi. <verse eid="GEN 36:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39" />Peafwili Baali Hanani mwana wa Akiboli, Hadadi akavya nkosi. ndi muji waki ukakemelewa Pau. Mdala waki akemiwi Mehetabeli, msikana wa Matiledi, mjukulu wa Mezahabu.<verse eid="GEN 36:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40" />Genago ndi mahina ga manduna gegahumalili muchiveleku cha Esau, kulandana na lukolo lwavi na miji yevahumili na milima yavi, vene ndi Timna na Aliva na Yeteti, <verse eid="GEN 36:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41" />Oholibama na Ela na Pinoni, <verse eid="GEN 36:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42" />Kenazi na Temani na Mibusali, <verse eid="GEN 36:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43" />Magidieli na Ilamu. Venavo ndi manduna va mulima wa Edomu. Vamanyikini kulandana na pandu pevatamili. Esau ndi dadi wa lukolo lwa vandu va ku Edomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37" />
  <para style="s">Yosefu na vahaja vaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1" />Yakobo akayendelela kutama ku mulima wa Kanaani, mweatamili dadi waki ngati myehe, <verse eid="GEN 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2" />Wenuwu ndi ukokoso viveleku vya Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:2">Yosefu peavii na ntanga wa miyaka kumi na saba, peadimayi mifuya pamonga na vahaja vaki, vana va Biha na Zipa, vevavii ngati vadala va dadi waki. Yosefu avi ajovalelayik kwa dadi wavi gahakau gevikita vahaja vaki.<verse eid="GEN 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3" />Isilaeli amuganili Yosefu kuliku vana vangi voha, ndava amveliki muugogolo waki, ndi akamutotela kanzu yabwina yitali. <verse eid="GEN 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4" />Valongo vaki pevaweni dadi wavi akumugana neju Yosefu kuliku vene, vakamuvenga na vagani lepi kulongela naku bwina.<verse eid="GEN 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5" />Kilu yimonga Yosefu akalota ndoto, nambu peavadandaulili valongo vaki ndi vakamuvenga neju. <verse eid="GEN 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6" />Akavajovela, “Muyuwanilayi ndoto yenilotili. <verse eid="GEN 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7" />Nalotili tavoha tavii kumugunda tikunga makinja ga muhono, balapala likinja langu likayima. Ndi makinja ginu goha gakatindila na kuligundamila likinja langu.”<verse eid="GEN 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8" />Vahaja vaki vakamjovela, “Wu, veve yati uvya wankosi witu? Wu, veve yati uvya wamukulu witu?” Penapo vakayongesa kumuvenga ndava ya ndoto yaki na malovi gaki.<verse eid="GEN 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9" />Yosefu akalota ndoto yingi, ndi akavajoela vahaja vaki, akajova, “Muyuwanila nilotili ndoto yingi, lukumbi ulu lilanga na mwehi na ndondo kumi na monga vyanigundamila.”<verse eid="GEN 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10" />Peavajovili dadi waki na vahaja vaki ndoto yeniyo, ndi dadi waki akamlakalila akajova, “Ndoto gani iyi yeulotili? Wu, nyina waku na nene na valongo vaku ndi yati tibwela kukufugamila veve mbaka pai kwa utopesa?” <verse eid="GEN 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11" />Vahaja vaki vakamuwonela wihu, nambu dadi waki akagavika kumutima.<verse eid="GEN 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yosefu iguliswa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12" />Ligono limonga vahaja vaki Yosefu vakahamba papipi na Shekemu kudima mifuya ga dadi wavi. <verse eid="GEN 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13" />Ndi Isilaeli akamjovela Yosefu, “Umanyili vahaja vaku vidima mifuya papipi na Shekemu. Hinu nigana nikutuma kwavi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:13">Yosefu akayangula, “Ena unitumayi.”<verse eid="GEN 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14" />Ndi akamjovela, “Uhambayi ukalolayi ngati vahaja vaku vavii bwina na mifuya ngati hivii bwina ndi ubwe unikokoselayi.” Yosefu akawuka mulikemba la Hebuloni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:14">Akahika ku Shekemu. <verse eid="GEN 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15" />Mundu mmonga akamukolela ityalatyala mudasi ndi akamkota, “Ulonda kyani?”<verse eid="GEN 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16" />Yosefu akayangula, “Nikuvalonda vahaja vangu, Chondi uhotola kunilangisa kwevidimila?”<verse eid="GEN 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17" />Mundu yula akayangula, “Vawukili apa, muni nikavayuwini vijova, ‘Tihamba ku Dotani.’” Penapo akavalandalila vahaja vaki akahamba kuvakolela ku Dotani.<verse eid="GEN 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18" />Vahaja vaki vamuweni kuhumila kutali, kwakona angavahegelela ndi vakayidakilana kumukoma. <verse eid="GEN 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19" />Vakajovesana, “Lola! Yula mlota ndoto ibwela. <verse eid="GEN 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20" />Mubwelayi timukomayi, na timutagayi mulilindi limonga pagati ya malindi aga. Kangi tete yati tijova aliwi na chinyama cha mdasi. Ndi yati tilola ndoto zaki yati zivya wuli.”<verse eid="GEN 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21" />Lubeni peayuwini genago, akalinga kumusangula kuhuma mumawoko gavi akajova, “Tikotoka kumukoma. <verse eid="GEN 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22" />Tikotoka kuyita ngasi, mumutagayi mulilindi limonga lelivili penapa, nambu tikotoka kumlemasa.” Lubeni alongili genago muni amusangulayi mumawoko gavi na amuwuyisayi kwa dadi waki. <verse eid="GEN 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23" />Yosefu peavahikalili kwa vahaja vaki, vakamuhula kwa makakala kanzu yila yitali yabwina. <verse eid="GEN 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24" />Kangi vakamukamula vakamutagila mulilindi, lilindi lila lavii waka na lavi lepi na manji.<verse eid="GEN 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25" />Pevatamili kulya chakulya, vakauwona msambi wa vachuuzi va lukolo lwa Ishimaeli vevavili mulugendu kuhuma ku Gileadi vihamba ku Misili. Ngamiya zavi zagegili ndwika za ubani, uvumba na manemane. <verse eid="GEN 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26" />Yuda akavajovela valongo vaki, “Yati tipata chiyonjokesu choki ndava ya kumukoma mulongo witu na kuhiha lifwa laki? <verse eid="GEN 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27" />Mbanga timugulisayi kwa ava Vaishimaeli, tikotokayi kumlemasa muni pamonga na naha mwenuyu mulongo witu, mwenuyu na tete tavana va dadi mumonga.” Valongo vaki vakamyidakila. <verse eid="GEN 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28" />Vachuuzi va chi Midiani pevahikili penapo, valongo vaki vakamuhumisa Yosefu kuhuma mulilindi mula, vakamugulisa kwava Vaishimaeli kwa hipandi ishilini vya madini ga feza, kisha vakahamba naku Kumisili.<verse eid="GEN 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29" />Leubeni peawuyili palilindi lila, amuwene lepi Yosefu, ndi akapapula nyula zaki kwa mvinisu. <verse eid="GEN 37:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30" />Akawuya kwa valongo vaki, akavajovela, “Msonmgolo avii lepi mulilindi mula! Hinu nikita kyani?”<verse eid="GEN 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31" />Ndi vakahinja mene, vakayitola kanzu ya Yosefu vakayijwiga mungasi yeniyo. <verse eid="GEN 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32" />Kangi vakamupelekela dadi wavi kanzu yila, vakamjovela, “Tiyinongili kanzu iyi. Hinu yilolayi ngati ya mwana waku amala lepi?”<verse eid="GEN 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33" />Dadi wavi akayimanya kanzu yila akajova, “Yeniyi ndi kanzu ya mwana wangu Yosefu, chakaka mwana wangu aliwi na chinyama cha kudasi! Yosefu apapuliwi hipandi hipandi.” <verse eid="GEN 37:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34" />Penapo Yakobo akapapula nyula yaki kwa mvinisu, akawala ligunila, akamuvembela mwana waki kwa magono gamahele. <verse eid="GEN 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35" />Vana vaki va chigosi na va chidala vakabwela kumpolesa mtima nambu mwene akabela kupoleswa, akajova, “Munilekayi niyendelelayi kumuvembela mwana wangu mbaka na nene penifwa.” Ndi dadi waki cheamuvembili.<verse eid="GEN 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36" />Lukumbi lwenulo ku Misili kula, Vamidiani vakamugulisa Yosefu kwa mundu mweikemelewa Potifa, mmonga wa vakulu vevavii pahi ya Falao ndi mweavili mkulu wa msambi wa valonda.<verse eid="GEN 37:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38" />
  <para style="s">Yuda na Tamali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1" />Lukumbi lwenulo, Yuda akavaleka valongo vaki, akahamba kutama na mundu mmonga wa kuhumila kumuji wa Mwadulami, mundu mwenuyo akemiwa Hila. <verse eid="GEN 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2" />Yuda peavili kwenuko, akakonganeka na msikana wa ku Kanaani, dadi waki ikemiwa Shua, Yuda akamtola msikana mwenuyo avya mdala waki. <verse eid="GEN 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3" />Msikana wa Shua akavya na ndumbu akaveleka mwana wa chigosi, Yuda akamkemela mwana mwenuyo Eli. <verse eid="GEN 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4" />Akavya na ndumbu yingi, akaveleka mwana wa chigosi, akamkemela Onani. <verse eid="GEN 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5" />Kangi akaveleka mwana yungi wa chigosi akamkemela Shela. Shela peavelikwi Yuda na mdala waki vatamayi Kezibu.<verse eid="GEN 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6" />Yuda amgegasili Eli mwana waki mtumbulanu, mdala mwenuyo akemiwi Tamali. <verse eid="GEN 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7" />Nambu Eli mvelekwa wa kutumbula wa Yuda, avili muhakau palongolo ya Chapanga ndi Chapanga akamukoma. <verse eid="GEN 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8" />Yuda akamjovela Onani mwana waki, “Mgega mlamu waku, ndava chenicho ndi cheuganikiwa kukita muni uhotola kumvelekela muhaja waku vana.” <verse eid="GEN 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9" />Nambu Onani akamanya kuvya vana venavo yati vivya vaki lepi, ndi peagona na mlamu waki naku atundila pavala muni akotoka kumvelekela mulongo waki vana. <verse eid="GEN 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10" />Chenicho cheakitili ndi chamuyomisi Bambu Chapanga, ndi na mwene akamukoma. <verse eid="GEN 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11" />Ndi Yuda akamjovela Tamali mkamwana waki, “Tamayi ngati lipwela munyumba ya dadi waku mbaka Shela peivyayi mvaha.” Muni aholalili, “Ngahotwili kufwa ngati valongo vaki.” Ndi Tamali akahamba kutama munyumba ya dadi waki.<verse eid="GEN 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12" />Pelwapitili lukumbi lutali mdala wa Yuda msikana wa Shua akafwa. Yuda peamali malilu, akahamba ku Timna, kwa vandu vevadumulayi wagi wa mambelele gaki, kuni alongosini na Hila mkozi waki mweavili mundu wa Mwadulami. <verse eid="GEN 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13" />Tamali peayuwini kuvya mkuhanu waki avi munjila ihamba ku Timna kudumula wagi wa mambelele gaki, <verse eid="GEN 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14" />ndi Tamali kahula nyula za ulipwela na akajigubika shela muni akotoka kumanyikana, akatama pamlyangu wa kuyingilila Enaimu, papipi na njila ya kuhambila ku Timna. Akitili chenicho ndava aweni kuvya Shela amali kuvya muvaha na agegiswi lepi avyayi mdala waki.<verse eid="GEN 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15" />Yuda peamukolili penapo ndi amuholalili kuvya mdala mkemi muni ajigubiki pamihu. <verse eid="GEN 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16" />Yuda changali kumanya kuvya mwenuyu mkamwana, akamuhegelela pamuhana wa njila akamjovela, “Nigana kugona na veve.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:16">Tamali akamkota, “Nikagona na nene yati ukunipela kyani?”<verse eid="GEN 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17" />Yuda akamyangula, “Yati nikupela mene kuhuma mumusambi wangu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:17">Tamali akakota, “Yati ukunipela kyani nitama nchu mbaka pekuniletela mene.”<verse eid="GEN 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18" />Yuda akamkota, “Nikupela kyani utama nachu mbaka penikuletela mene?” Tamali akamyangula, “Nipela peta yeyivi na lihina laku na kamba yaki pamonga na mkongojoa weukamwili mumawoko.” Yuda akamupela vindu vyenivyo na akagona naku, na Tamali akavya na ndumbu.<verse eid="GEN 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19" />Hinu Tamali akawuya kunyumba akahula shela yeajigubiki, na kuwala kavili nyula zaki za ulipwela.<verse eid="GEN 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20" />Yuda amutumili Hila mweavi mkozi waki, mundu wa ku Mwadulami apelekayi mene kwa mdala yula muni awuyasiwayi vindu vyaki vyeamupelili, nambu amukolili lepi mdala yula. <verse eid="GEN 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21" />Hila akavakota vandu vevavi pandu pala, “Avili kwoki mdala mkemi mweatamayi apa pamuhana ya njila ya kuhamba Enaimu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:21">Vandu vala vakamyangula, “Lepi, pandu apa avili lepi na mkemi.”<verse eid="GEN 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22" />Ndi Hila akamuwuya kwa Yuda akamjovela, “Nimukolili lepi. Na vandu vevitama pandu pala, vajovili kuvya pandu pala pavi lepi na mdala mkemi.”<verse eid="GEN 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23" />Yuda akajova, “Leka avitola vyenivyo, ngati lepi yati akutipela soni. Nikupeli mene umpelekela nambu umukolili lepi.”<verse eid="GEN 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24" />Peyapitili miyehi hidatu, mundu mmonga amjovili Yuda, “Mkamwana waki Tamali abudili la kukita ukemi ndi avi na ndumbu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:24">Ndi Yuda akalagiza, “Mumuhumisa kuvala ya muji mumkoma kwa kumuyocha moto!”<verse eid="GEN 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25" />Pevamuhumisayi kuvala muji, ndi Tamali akapeleka ujumbi kwa mkohanu waki, kujova, “Mkolo vindu ivi ndi mweanipelili ndumbu. Hinu nikuvayupa mumanyayi vindu ivi ndi vyayani, pete na nyosi yaki na mkongojo uwu.”<verse eid="GEN 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26" />Yuda akavimanya kuvya vyaki, ndi akajova, “Tamali akitili chabwina kuliku nene, muni namjoli lepi mwana wangu Shela amgegagayi.” Kuhuma ligono lila Yuda agonili lepi kavili na Tamali.<verse eid="GEN 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27" />Pelwahikili lukumbi lwa Tamali kuveleka, kumbi avi na ndumbu yaki yivi na vana mapaha. <verse eid="GEN 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28" />Peavelikayi, ndi mwana mmonga akalongosa chiwoko kuvala, mvelekisa akamukunga nyosi yidung'u muchiwoko akajova, “Mwenuyu ndi mtumbula.” <verse eid="GEN 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29" />Nambu mwana yula akawuyisa chiwoko chaki mugati, ndi muyaki akatumbula kuvelekewa. Kangi mvelikisa akajova, “Mboni veve uhumili kwa makakala!” Ndi akamkela Pelesi. <verse eid="GEN 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30" />Mwanakandahi ndi akahuma mulongo waki akungiwi nyosi muchiwoko, ndi akamkemela Zela.<verse eid="GEN 38:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39" />
  <para style="s1">Yosefu na mdala wa Potifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1" />Hinu Vaishimaeli vakamupeleka Yosefu ku Misili, vakamgulisa kwa Mumisili mweakemelewayi Potifa mweavili mmonga wa vilongosi va pahi ya Falao mwene avii mkulu wa valonda. <verse eid="GEN 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2" />Bambu Chapanga akavya pamonga na Yosefu, ndi akanekanala, atamayi munyumba ya yula mkulu waki Mumisili yula mweamugulili. <verse eid="GEN 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3" />Mkulu waki akamuwona kuvya Chapanga avii pamonga na Yosefu na Bambu akumtangatila ahotola kukita bwina kila jambu leikita. <verse eid="GEN 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4" />Ndi Potifa akaganiswa neju Yosefu, akamuvika avya mtumisi waki mwene mewawa akamvika kuvya myimamila wa nyumba yaki na vindu vyaki vyoha. <verse eid="GEN 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5" />Kuhumila Potifa peamkitili Yosefu kuvya mkulu wa nyumba yaki pamonga na vyoha vyeavili navyu, ndi Bambu Chapanga akayimotisa nyumba ya Mumisili mwenuyo ndava ya Yosefu. Mota za Bambu Chapanga zikavya mukila chindu cheavili nachu Potifa, munyumba na kumugunda. <verse eid="GEN 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6" />Ndava yeniyo Potifa akamupela Yosefu uhotola mumambu gaki goha na Potifa ahengili lepi na chindu chochoha ndi nga chakulya chaki mwene. Yosefu avili msongolo wa bwina na kunyamba.<verse eid="GEN 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7" />Pelwahambili lukumbi nunuyu, mdala wa Potifa mkulu waki akamunogela Yosefu ndi akamjovela, “Gonana na nene!” <verse eid="GEN 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8" />Nambu Yosefu akabela, akamjovela mdala wa Potifa, “Mbwitu, mkulu wangu anipeli uhotola ga kila chindu chechivi mugati, vindu vyoha anipeli niviyangalila. <verse eid="GEN 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9" />Avili lepi mkulu kuliku nene munyumba iyi, mkuilu anidivalili lepi chindu chochoha chila nambu veve ndu, ndava veve wamdala waki. Nihotola wuli kukita uhakau uvaha ngati wenuwo na kumbudila Chapanga.” <verse eid="GEN 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10" />Mdala mwenuyo akayendelela kumukulukisa Yosefu ligono kwa ligono, nambu Yosefu amuyuwanili lepi na agonili naku lepi.<verse eid="GEN 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11" />Ligono limonga Yosefu akayingila mugati ya nyumba kuhenga lihengu, na pavili lepi na mundu yoyoha mugati mwenumo. <verse eid="GEN 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12" />Mdala wa Potifa akamukamula Yosefu nyula yeawalili na kumjovela, “Bwela tigonana!” Nambu Yosefu akamulekela nyula yila mumawoko gaki, na akatilalila kuvala. <verse eid="GEN 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13" />Mdala yula peaweni kuvya Yosefu amulekili nyula mumawoko na kutilili kuvala, <verse eid="GEN 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14" />Mdala yula akavakemela vavanda va munyumba ndi akavajovela, “Mbwela mlola! Muebulania mweatiletili mngwana wangu akutipela soni. Ayingili muchumba changu kugana kunilimba nambu nikaywanga neju. <verse eid="GEN 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15" />Peakayuwini nivemba kwa lwami luvaha ndi akanilekela nyula yaki na kutilila kuvala!”<verse eid="GEN 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16" />Hinu mdala yula akavika nyula yila mbaka peawuyili mngwana waki. <verse eid="GEN 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17" />Ndi akamudandaulila malovi galagala kujova. “Mvanda Wachiebulania yula mweutiletili akaniyingalili muchumba changu na kugana kunilimba. <verse eid="GEN 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18" />Nambu penikaywangili ndi akanilekili nyula yaki, akatila kuvala.”<verse eid="GEN 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19" />Potifa peayuwini malovi geajoviwi na mdala waki, kuvala lijambu lila leahengili mvanda waki. Potifa akamema ligoga. <verse eid="GEN 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20" />Potifa akamtola Yosefu akamusopa muchifungu, pandu pevakungiwi vavanda vangi va nkosi, na Yosefu akavya muchifungu. <verse eid="GEN 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21" />Nambu Bambu Chapanga akavya na Yosefu, akammotisa na mkulu wa chifungu akaganiswa Yosefu. <verse eid="GEN 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22" />Mkulu wa chifungu akamukita Yosefu avyayi mkulu kwa vakungiwa vangi voha, ayimamilayi vindu vyoha vyevii mwenumo. <verse eid="GEN 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23" />Mkulu wa chifungu ahengili lepi kavili chindu chochoha chila cheamugotolili Yosefu, muni Bambu Chapanga avili pamonga na Yosefu na amtangatili mumambu goha geagahengili.<verse eid="GEN 39:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40" />
  <para style="s">Yosefu idandaula ndoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1" />Pelwamaliki lukumbi nunuyu, mnywehaji wa nkosi na myocha mabumunda wa nkosi vamubudili mkulu wavi nkosi wa ku Misili. <verse eid="GEN 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2" />Falao avayomili mnyeshaji mkulu na myochaji mkulu, <verse eid="GEN 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3" />akavavika muulonda wa munyumba ya mkulu wa manjolinjoli, muchifungu chichocho cheakungiwi Yosefu. <verse eid="GEN 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4" />Vavii muchifungu kwa lukumbi nunuyu na mkulu wa manjolinjoli akamhagula Yosefu avahengela.<verse eid="GEN 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5" />Hinu kilu yimonga, muchifungu mula yikavya munywesaji mkulu na yula myocha mabumunda mkulu wa nkosi wa ku Misili valotili ndoto, kila ndoto yavi na mana yaki. <verse eid="GEN 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6" />Lukela Yosefu peavahambili kuvalola, akavakolela voha vavili vavi ngolongondi. <verse eid="GEN 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7" />Hinu, Yosefu akavakota vakulu vala vevavii pahi ya Falao vevavi muchifungu pamonga nayu munyumba ya mkulu waki, “Ndava kyani pamihu pinu lelu piwonekana pavii ngolongondi?”<verse eid="GEN 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8" />Vakamyangula, “Kila mumonga alotili ndoto yaki nambu kawaka mundu mweihotola kudandaula ndoto zenizo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 40:8">Yosefu akavajovela, “Wu, kudandaula ndoto lihengu lepi la Chapanga? Hinu, mnijovela ndoto zinu.”<verse eid="GEN 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9" />Myangalila vinyweso mkulu wa nkosi akamdandaulila Yosefu ndoto yaki, akajova, “Mundoto yangu nalotili kuvii na mzabibu palongolo yangu, <verse eid="GEN 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10" />wene wavi na mambanda gadatu. Bahapo ndu pewatumbwili kutupu, ndi maluva gaki gakahomola na vikonyo vyaki vikavya na zabibu zezihundili. <verse eid="GEN 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11" />Mumawoko gangu navili na chikombi cha Falao, hinu, nikatola zabibu, nikaminyila muchikombi chenicho, nikampela Falao.”<verse eid="GEN 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12" />Yosefu akamjovela mkulu yula, “Wenuwu ndi udandaula wa ndoto yaku, gala mambanda gadatu gewagaweni ndi magono gadatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13" />Pegimalika magono gadatu Falao yati akukuwusa kuhuma muchifungu na kukuwuyisa kavili pandu paku. Yati wihotola kavili kumpela Falao chikombi mumawoko gaki ngati chewakitili kadeni pewavii munywehaji. <verse eid="GEN 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14" />Nambu mambu pegakuhambila bwina, unikumbuka na unihengela lipyana, na ujova mambu gangu palongolo ya Falao, muni aniwusa muchifungu. <verse eid="GEN 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15" />Ndava muni natoliwi kwa makakala kuhuma pamulima wa Vaebulania, na penapa pa Misili nikitili lepi chochoha chihakahu chechikunikita nikungiwayi.”<verse eid="GEN 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16" />Myocha mabumunda yula mkulu peawene kuvya udandaula wula ndi wabwina, akamjovela Yosefu, “Hati nene nalotili ndoto! Niloti nigegili madengu gadatu ga mabumunda pamutu wangu. <verse eid="GEN 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17" />Mulidengu la kunani, kwavili na vyakula ndalindali vyevitendekiwi ndava ya Falao. Nambu, videge vikahola mulidengu lelavii pamutu wangu!”<verse eid="GEN 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18" />Yosefu akamjovela, “Wenuwu ndi udandaula wa ndoto yaku. gala madengu gadatu gewagalotili ndi magono gadatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19" />Pamagono aga gadatu Falao yati akuwusa muchifungu na kudumula mutu waku na kukuyinjisa pamkongo, videge yati vilya higa yaku.”<verse eid="GEN 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20" />Paligono la datu lavi ligono la mselebuko wa kuvelekwa kwaki Falao. Muligono lenilo avatendelekela mselebuko vatumisi vaki voha. Akavawusa muchifungu myangalila vinyweso waki mkulu na myocha mabumunda mkulu, akavaleta palongolo ya vakulu vevavii pahi yaki. <verse eid="GEN 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21" />Falao akamuwuyisa mulihengu laki myangalila minyweso, avya akumpela Falao chikombi. <verse eid="GEN 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22" />Nambu yula myocha mabumunda mkulu akamning'inisa pamkongo, ngati Yosefu cheavadandaulili ndoto zavi. <verse eid="GEN 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23" />Nambu mnywesaji mkulu amkubwiki lepi Yosefu, akamkosewa njwee.<verse eid="GEN 40:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41" />
  <para style="s">Yosefu idandaula ndoto za nkosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1" />Peyamaliki miyaka yivili, Falao alotili. Ajiwene ayimili pamuhana ya mfuleni Naili, <verse eid="GEN 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2" />aziwene ng'ombi saba zabwina na zezikulupili zihuma kumfuleni zibwela kulya manyahi. <verse eid="GEN 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3" />Kangi, ng'ombi zingi saba zezavi ngalingasi neju zihuma ku mfuleni Naili, zikabwela na kuyima papipi na zila ng'ombi zabwina na zezikulupili, pamuhana ya mfuleni. <verse eid="GEN 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4" />Ng'ombi zila ngalingasi neju zikalya zingi zila saba zabwina na zezikulupili. Penapo Falao akayumuka mulugono. <verse eid="GEN 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5" />Peagoni kavili, akalota ndoto ya pili kila ndoto yavi na mana yaki. Aziwene ngele saba gavaha na gabwina gimela mulipei limonga. <verse eid="GEN 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6" />Kangi ngele zingi saba ngalingasi na gegayumili kwa mpungu uyumu wa kulugangatu gakahumila. <verse eid="GEN 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7" />Ngele zila saba ngalingasi gakagamila gala ngele saba zivaha gegamemili mbeyu. Hinu Falao peayumwiki akamanya kuvya yavili ndoto. <verse eid="GEN 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8" />Kwapachili, Falao kuni ityalatyala, akavakemela valondola voha va ku Misili, na vevavi na luhala, akavajovela ndoto zaki, nambu kawaka hati mmonga mweahotwili kumdandaulila ndoto zenizo.<verse eid="GEN 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9" />Kangi, yula mkulu wa minyweso akamjovela Falao, “Lelu nikugakumbuka mabudilu gangu! <verse eid="GEN 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10" />Ligono limonga watiyomili tete vavili, wanikungili nene pamonga na myocha mabumunda mkulu, munyumba ya mkulu wa msambi wa valonda. <verse eid="GEN 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11" />Kilu yimonga talotili ndoto, kila ndoto yavi na mana yaki. <verse eid="GEN 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12" />Hinu msongolo mmonga Mwebulania, mtangatila wa mkulu wa msambi wa valonda, avili pamonga na tete muchifungu. Petamjovili ndoto zitu, mwene ahotwili kutidandaulila kila mmonga witu kuwanangana na ndoto yaki. <verse eid="GEN 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13" />Cheadandawili ndi cheyahumili. Veve waniwuyisi nene kulihengu langu, na yula myocha mabumunda mkulu wamtundiki pamkongo.”<verse eid="GEN 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14" />Hinu Falao akalagiza Yosefu aleta, mwene akawusiwa muchifungu kanyata. Peamali kuketa na kubadilisha nyula zaki, Yosefu akaletwa palongolo ya Falao. <verse eid="GEN 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15" />Falao akamjovela Yosefu, “Nene nilotili ndoto, nambu kawaka mundu mweahotwili kunidandaulila. Niyuwini ulumba waku kuvya veve ukajoviwayi ndoto wihotola kudandaula.”<verse eid="GEN 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16" />Yosefu akamyangula Falao, “Uhotola wenuwo nivi nawu lepi, nambu Chapanga yati akujovela mana ya ndoto zenizo.”<verse eid="GEN 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17" />Penapo Falao akamjovela Yosefu, “Nalotili kuvya niyimili pamuhana ya mfuleni Naili, <verse eid="GEN 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18" />naziwene ng'ombi saba zabwina na zezikulupili zihuma kumfuleni kubwela kulya manyahi. <verse eid="GEN 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19" />Ndi zikagelekelwa na ng'ombi vangi saba, ngalingasi na zigandili neju. Katu niziwene lepi ng'ombi ngalingasi zezigandili ngati zenizo pamulima wa Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20" />Hinu zila ng'ombi ngalingasi na zezigandili neju zikalya zila ng'ombi saba zezikulupili. <verse eid="GEN 41:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21" />Nambu hati pevamali kulya vala vevakulupili, mundu yeyoha ngaahotwili lepi kumanya kuvya vavalili vayavi, muni kwakona vavi vagandili ngati pakutumbula. Penapo nikayumuka mulugono. <verse eid="GEN 41:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22" />Kangi nalotili ndoto yingi. Naziwene ngele saba gabwina gegamemili mbeyu zezingali mulipehi limonga. <verse eid="GEN 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23" />Kangi gakagelekela ngele zingi saba gangali mbeyu, ngalingasi na gegayumiswi na mpungu uyumu wa kulugangatu. <verse eid="GEN 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24" />Ngele zila saba ngalingasi gakazimila zila ngele saba zabwina. Hinu nene navajovili valondola ndoto zenizo nambu kawaka mundu mweahotwili kunidandaulila.”<verse eid="GEN 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25" />Kangi Yosefu akamjovela Falao, “Ndoto zaki zoha zivili udandawula waki ndi umonga. Chapanga akugubukulili mambu geihenga papipi. <verse eid="GEN 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26" />Ngo'mbi zila saba zabwina ndi miyaka saba, na gala ngele saba gabwina mewa ndi miyaka saba, ndoto zenizo udandauwula waki ndi umonga. <verse eid="GEN 41:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27" />Zila ng'ombi saba zezigandili neju, na kugelekela vala vevakulupili, na zila ngele gngali mbeyu saba, gegayumiswi na mpungu uyumu wa kulugangatu, mana yaki ndi miyaka saba ya njala. <verse eid="GEN 41:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28" />Ngati chenikujovili nkosi Falao, Chapanga akugubukulili mambu geakuhahenga papipi naha. <verse eid="GEN 41:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29" />Yati kwivya na miaka saba ya kumota mabenu pamulima woha wa ku Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30" />Nambu mwanakandahi yati yigelekela miyaka saba ya njala, hati vandu yati vikosiwa miyaka yila ya kumota mabenu. Njala yeniyo yati yikuuhalabisa mulima woha. <verse eid="GEN 41:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31" />Mabenu gevamotili pamulima yati vikosiwa njwe ndava njala yeyigelekela yati yivya yikali neju. <verse eid="GEN 41:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32" />Ndoto yaku yawuyili mala zivili kwa miluhumu yeyiwanangana kukulangisa kuvya Chapanga apangili, mwene yati ihenga lijambu lenilo papipi.”<verse eid="GEN 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33" />“Ndava yeniyo hinu, nkosi Falao, umhagula mundu mweavi na umanya na luhala, umpela lihengu la kuuyangalila mulima woha wa Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34" />Kavili, nkosi Falao, uvahagula vayimilila vangi penapa pamulima, uvalagiza vavika pandu pa mhanu pa mabenu goha ga Misili mulukumbi ulu lwa miyaka saba ga mabenu. <verse eid="GEN 41:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35" />Uvalagiza vayimilila venavo vavika pamonga mota ya mabenu goha pamiyaka saba yeyibwela. Mabenu genago na vavika pavibana vyaku nkosi Falao, chivya chibana cha kwa miji yoha, na vene vaviyangalila vibana. <verse eid="GEN 41:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36" />Chakulya chenicho yati chivya chibana cha kupela vandu kwa miyaka saba yeyibwela pamulima wa Misili, ndi vandu yati vifwa lepi kwa njala.”<verse eid="GEN 41:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yosefu ipewa ukulu mu Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37" />Lijambu lenilo lawonikini labwina kwa Falao na vakulu voha vevavii pahi yaki. <verse eid="GEN 41:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38" />Ndava yeniyo Falao akavakota vilongosi vayaki, “Mundu uyu avi na mpungu wa Chapanga! Wu, tihotola kumpata mundu yungi ngati uyu?” <verse eid="GEN 41:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39" />Kangi akamjovela Yosefu, “Ndava muni Chapanga akugubukulili aga goha, kawaka mundu yungi mweimanya na avi na luhala ngati veve. <verse eid="GEN 41:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40" />Veve ndi weuyimamila mulima wangu, na vandu vangu voha yati vivya pahi ya uhotola waku. Nene ndi mwenivya mkulu kuliku veve.” <verse eid="GEN 41:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41" />Kangi Falao akamjovela Yosefu, “Hinu nikuvika uvya mkulu wa mulima woha wa Misili.” <verse eid="GEN 41:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42" />Ndi, Falao akahula pete yeyina lihina laki mulung'onji lwaki na kumwalika Yosefu, akamwalika na nyula ya msopi na mkufu wa zahabu safi muhingu yaki. <verse eid="GEN 41:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43" />Falao akamkwesa pamutuka yaki ya pili ya kuhutwa na falasi na valonda vakalongolela kulongolo ya Yosefu vijova kwa lwami luvaha, “Myepa mtama pamuhana! Myepa mtama pamuhana!” Chenicho ndi Falao cheamuhagwili Yosefu avya na uhotola uvaha panani ya mulima woha wa Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44" />Mewawa Falao akamjovela Yosefu, “Nene ndi nkosi Falao! Nijova, mundu yeyoha pamulima woha wa Misili akotoka kukita chindu chochoa changali veve kumujovela.” <verse eid="GEN 41:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45" />Falao akampela Yosefu lihina la Chimisili akamkemela Zafenati Panea. Akamgegesela Asenati msikana wa Potifela, mweavi mteta wa muji wa Oni. Hinu Yosefu akagendelela mulima woha wa Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46" />Yosefu avi na miyaka selasini peatumbwili kumhengela Falao, nkosi wa Misili. Yosefu ahumili munyumba ya nkosi ya Farao na kuugendelela mulima woha wa Misili.<verse eid="GEN 41:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47" />Pamiyaka yila saba ya chakulya vyamahele migunda ya Vamisili yamotili mabenu gamahele neju. <verse eid="GEN 41:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48" />Yosefu akavika pamonga vyakulya vyoha vyevyapambiki miyaka yila saba ya mabenu gamahele na akavivika pamiji ya Misili. Mukila muji akavika chakulya chehachumili mumigunda ya papipi. <verse eid="GEN 41:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49" />Yosefu akavika muvibana mabenu gamahele neju ngati msavati wa kunyanja hati nakuhotola kuvalanga.<verse eid="GEN 41:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50" />Kwakona miyaka ya njala kutumbula, Yosefu amali kupata vana vavili kwa mdala waki, Asenati, binti Potifela, mweavi mteta wa muji wa Oni. <verse eid="GEN 41:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51" />Yosefu amkemili mwana waki mtumbula Manase, ndi akajova, “Chapanga akitili nikosiwa mtahu wangu woha na nyumba ya dadi wangu.” <verse eid="GEN 41:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52" />Mwana waki wa pili amkemili Efraimu, akajova, “Chapanga anipeli vana pamulima wa kung'aika kwangu.”<verse eid="GEN 41:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53" />Miyaka yila saba ya chakulya mulima wa Misili yikamalika. <verse eid="GEN 41:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54" />Yikatumbula miyaka saba ya njala ngati cheajovili Yosefu penapo kadeni. Milima yingi yoha yikahumila na njala, nambu mulima woha wa Misili wavili na chakulya. <verse eid="GEN 41:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55" />Lukumbi vandu va Misili pevatumbwili kuvya na njala, vamvembelili Falao avapela chakulya. Na Falao akavajovela Vamisili voha, “Mhambayi kwa Yosefu, na mhenga chochoa cheakuvajovela.” <verse eid="GEN 41:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56" />Njala yikayonjokesa kuvya yikali na kudandasika pamulima woha wa Misili. Ndava yeniyo Yosefu akaviwopola vibana vyoha, akavagulisila vandu va ku Misili chakulya ndava njala yavi yikali neju Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57" />Neju ya genago, vandu voha kuhuma mmulima yoha vabwelili ku Misili kwa Yosefu kugula chakulya, muni njala yavili yikali pamilima woha.<verse eid="GEN 41:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42" />
  <para style="s">Vahaja vaki Yosefu vihamba ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1" />Yakobo peamanyili kuvya kuvi na vyakulya ku Misili kula, akavajovela vana vaki, “Ndava kyani mwitama ndu penapa kuni mwilolesana changali kukita chindu? <verse eid="GEN 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2" />Niyuwini kuvya Misili kuvi na vyakulya. Muhelela muhambayi kwenuko mkagula chakulya tikoto kufwa njala.” <verse eid="GEN 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3" />Ndi valongo kumi va Yosefu vakahelela kuhamba ku Misili kugula vyakulya. <verse eid="GEN 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4" />Nambu Yakobo amlekili lepi Benyamini mweavelekiwi kwa mau mmonga na Yosefu, ahamba pamonga nawu muni ayogwipi kuvya ngaapatili gahakahu.<verse eid="GEN 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5" />Hinu, vana va Yakobo mewa akemiwi Isilaeli vahikili ku Misili ngati vandu vangi vevahambili kugula, muni hati pamulima wa Kanaani kwavili na njala. <verse eid="GEN 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6" />Lukumbi lwenulo Yosefu avi ndi mkulu wa pamulima wa Misili. Mwene ndi mweavagulisili vandu vyakulya kuhuma milima yoha. Hinu, vahaja vaki vakabwela na kumgundamila Yosefu mbaka pahi kwa utopesa. <verse eid="GEN 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7" />Bahapo Yosefu peavawene valongo vaki, akavamanya, nambu akajikita avamanyili lepi na kulongela nawu kwa ukali, akuvakota, “Nyenye mwihuma koki?” Vakamyangula, “Tihumili ku mulima wa Kanaani tibweli kugula chakulya.”<verse eid="GEN 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8" />Pamonga Yosefu avamanyili valongo vaki, vene vammanyili lepi. <verse eid="GEN 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9" />Ndi Yosefu akumbwiki ndoto zaki kuvavala vene, akavajovela, “Nyenye ndi vamang'omesi! Mubweli kulola pandu pamulima witu pangali na ulonda.”<verse eid="GEN 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10" />Vakamyangula, “Lepi mkulu witu. Vatumisi vaku tibwelili kugula chakulya. <verse eid="GEN 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11" />Tete tavoha ndi vana va dadi mmonga. Vatumisi vako ndi vandu vasadikika, lepi vamang'omesi.”<verse eid="GEN 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12" />Akavajovela, “Lepi! Mubweli kulola pandu pamulima witu pangali ulonda.”<verse eid="GEN 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13" />Nambu vakamyangula, “Vatumisi vaku vavi kumi na vavili, ndi vana wa mundu mmonga mweitama pamulima wa Kanaani. Nambu mbena witu wa mwishu asigali na dadi witu na yungi afwili.”<verse eid="GEN 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14" />Nambu Yosefu akavajovela, “Ngati chenijovili. Nyenye ndi vamang'omesi ndu. <verse eid="GEN 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15" />Chenichi ndi cheniumanya uchakaka. Nilapa kwa lihina la Falao, yati mwiwuka lepi pandu apa mbaka mlongo winu mdebe abwela penapa. <verse eid="GEN 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16" />Mumtuma mmonga winu akamleta mlongo winu mwenuyo, vangi mwisopiwa muchifungu malovi ginu galingiwa kumanya ngati mwijova chakaka. Ngati lepi, nilapa kwa lihina la Falao kuvya nyenye ndi vamang'omesi!” <verse eid="GEN 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17" />Kangi akavasopa voha muchifungu kwa magono gadatu.<verse eid="GEN 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18" />Ligono la datu Yosefu akavajovela, “Nene namundu mwamtopesa neju Chapanga, yati nikuvakoma lepi ngati mkakita lijambu limonga. <verse eid="GEN 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19" />Ngati chakaka nyenye ndi vandu vasadikika, mmonga winu na asigalila pachifungu, na vangi vavapelekela chakulya valongo vinu vevavi na njala. <verse eid="GEN 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20" />Kangi mumleta kwangu mlongo winu mdebe. Yeniyi yilangisa uchakaka wa malovi ginu, na nyenye yati mwikomiwa lepi.” Hinu, vakayidakila kukita chenicho.<verse eid="GEN 42:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21" />Kangi vakajovesana, “Chakaka tete tamuhokili mlongo witu. Pamonga tamuwene peavili mumang'aiso, na mwene patiyupil, tetetamuyuwanili lepi. Ndi mana mang'aiso aga goha gakutikolela.”<verse eid="GEN 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22" />Lubeni akavajovela, “Wu, nene navajovili lepi tikoto kumbudila msongolo? Nambu nyenye mwaniyuwanili lepi! Hinu ting'ahika ndava tamkomili.” <verse eid="GEN 42:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23" />Vene vamanyili lepi kuvya Yosefu ayelwayi gevajovayi, muni pealongili nawu yavili kwa njila ya mdandaula. <verse eid="GEN 42:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24" />Yosefu akajibagula nawu akatumbula kuvemba, kangi akavawuyila na kulongela nawu kavili. Akamtola Simeoni akamkunga palongolo yavi.<verse eid="GEN 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vahaja vaki Yosefu viwuya kunyumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25" />Yosefu akalagiza mumagunila vyavi vimemeswa vyakulya, kila mmonga wavi awuyisiwayi mashonga gaki muligunila laki, na vapewa chakulya cha munjila. Vakakitiwa mambu ago goha. <verse eid="GEN 42:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26" />Vakavagegesa punda wavi mizigu yavi ya vyakulya, na vakawuka. <verse eid="GEN 42:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27" />Yikavya pevahikili pandu pa kugona vayehe ku njila kula, mmonga wavi akawopola ligunia laki muni apata kumliha punda waki, akakangasa kukolela mashonga gaki mumlomo wa ligunia laki. <verse eid="GEN 42:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28" />Akavajovela valongo vaki, “Mashonga gangu gawuyiswi. Aga apa mumlomo wa ligunia langu!” Pevayuwini ago, makakala gakavamalika. Vakalolesana kuni vivagaya na kukotana, “Ndi lijambu gani lenili leatihengili Chapanga?”<verse eid="GEN 42:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29" />Pevahikili pamulima wa Kanaani kwa dadi wavi Yakobo, vamjovili goha gegavakolili, vakamjovela, <verse eid="GEN 42:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30" />“Mkulu wa mulima wula ajovili na tete kwa ukali, na kutikotekesa kuvya tete ndi vamang'omesi pamulima waki. <verse eid="GEN 42:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31" />Nambu tete tamjovili kuvya tete ndi vandu vasadikika, na lepi vamang'omesi. <verse eid="GEN 42:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32" />Tamjovili kuvya tete tivi valongo kumi na vavili kwa dadi mmonga, na kuvya mmonga witu afwili na yula mdebe avi kunyumba kumulima wa Kanaani pamonga na dadi witu. <verse eid="GEN 42:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33" />Ndi mkulu wa mulima wenuwo akatujovela, ‘Ndi chenimanya ngati chakaka nyenye ndi vandu vasadikika. Mumleka kwangu mlongo winu mmonga, na nyenye vangi mpeleka mabenu kunyumba kwa valongo vinu vevavi na njala. <verse eid="GEN 42:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34" />Kangi mumleta kwangu uyo mlongo winu mdebe, na penapo yati nimanya kuvya nyenye lepi vamang'omesi, nambu ndi vandu vasadikika. Mkakita chenicho yati nikumulekelela mlongo winu, na nyenye yati mwiyidakiliwa kukita uchuuzi pamulima uwu.’”<verse eid="GEN 42:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35" />Pevakutulayi vyakulya kuhuma mumagunila gavi, vakangisi kulola kila mmonga wavi awuyisiwi chihaku chaki na mashonga mugati ya ligunia laki. Pevawene ago, voha pamonga na dadi wavi, vakayogopa. <verse eid="GEN 42:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36" />Dadi wavi Yakobo, akavajovela, “Hinu mgana nivayagisa vana vangu voha! Yosefu avi lepi, Simeoni avi lepi, hinu mwigana kumtola na Benyamini. Goha ago gakunikolela nene!”<verse eid="GEN 42:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37" />Penapo Lubeni akamjovela dadi waki, “Ngati nimuwuyisi lepi Benyamini, vakomiwa vana vangu vavili. Muleka Benyamini mumawoko gangu, na nene yati nikumyangalila na kumuwuyisa kwaku.”<verse eid="GEN 42:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38" />Nambu dadi waki akamyangula, “Mwanangu ihamba lepi na nyenye, mlongo waki amali kufwa, na mwene asigalili. Nene ndi mgogolo neju ngati msongolo uyu gakumkolela gahakau gogoha mulugendu lwemwihamba hinu, yati mkunikoma kwa mvinisu muugogolo wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 42:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43" />
  <para style="s">Vahaja vaki Yosefu viwuya ku Misili na Benyamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1" />Kangi njala yayonjokisiki neju pamulima wa Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2" />Pechamaliki chila chakulya chevagulili kuhuma ku Misili, Yakobo akavajovela vana vaki, “Mhamba kavili ku Misili, mkatigulila chakulya chingi.”<verse eid="GEN 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3" />Nambu Yuda akamjovela dadi waki, “Mundu yula atiywangili neju, ajovili ‘Yati nikuvapokela lepi ngati mbweli lepi na mlongo winu mdebe.’ <verse eid="GEN 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4" />Ngati wiyidakila mlongo witu kuhamba pamonga na tete, hinu, yati tihamba kukugulila chakulya. <verse eid="GEN 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5" />Nambu ngati wibela akotoka kuhamba pamonga na tete, hinu, yati tihamba lepi kwenuko, ndava yula mundu atijovili hotohoto, ‘Yati mukuniwona lepi ngati mbweli lepi na mlongo winu mdebe.’”<verse eid="GEN 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6" />Yakobo akajova, “Ndava kyani mwamjovili mundu mwenuyo kuvya muvi na mlongo yungi?”<verse eid="GEN 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7" />Vakamyangula, “Yula mundu atikotili neju kuvala tete na valongo vitu ajovili, ‘Wu, dadi winu akona mumi? Wu, muvi na mlongo yungi?’ Chenicho ndi tamyangwili kuwanangana na makotesi gaki. Ngatihotwili wuli kumanya kuvya yati akutijovela, ‘Mumleta mlongo winu?’”<verse eid="GEN 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8" />Ndi Yuda akamjovela dadi waki Yakobo mewa vakumkela Isilaeli, “Nileka nene nihamba pamonga nayu, na tete bahapa yati tihamba hinu naha kugula chakulya, muni tete na veve pamonga na vana vitu tikoto kufwa. <verse eid="GEN 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9" />Nilapa nene namwene yati nikumuyangalila na kumuwuyisa bwina. Ngati nimuwuyisi lepi mbunu uvya kwa nene magono goha. <verse eid="GEN 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10" />Chakaka, ngati ticheliwi lepi kuwuka, ngatimali kuhamba na kuwuya mala zivili.”<verse eid="GEN 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11" />Penapo Isilaeli, dadi wavi, akavajovela, “Ena! Ndava ndi yiganikiwa yivya chenicho hinu, mkita naha, mtola mabenu gabwina ga mulima uwu muvika mumagunila, muhelela mukampelekela njombi mundu yula. Mumgegela mahuta gadebe ga mkwaju, wuchi udebe na ubani na manemane na kungu na lozi. <verse eid="GEN 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12" />Mgega hipandi vya madini ga feza mala zivili ya zila zeziganikiwa, ndava muni ndi yikuvagana muwuyisa madini ga feza gavikiwi mumilomo ya magunila ginu, pangi akosiwi kutola. <verse eid="GEN 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13" />Mumtola mewa mbena winu Benjamini muhamba naku kwa mundu mwenuyo. <verse eid="GEN 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14" />Chapanga Mweavi na Makakala na avatangatila kupata lipyana palongolo ya mundu mwenuyo, avalekela yula mlongo winu yungi na Benyamini vawuya pamongaa na nyenye. Kwa upandi wangu, na vana vangu ngati vakafwayi leka yivya chenicho!”<verse eid="GEN 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15" />Penapo, vakatola njombi zila, na mashonga mala zivili ya zila za kadeni, vakahelela ku Misili pamonga na mbena wavi Benyamini. Pevahikili, vakahamba na kuyima palongolo ya Yosefu. <verse eid="GEN 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16" />Yosefu peavawene Benyamini pamonga nawu, akamjovela myimilila wa nyumba yaki, “Vapeleka vandu ava kunyumba, umhinja mnyama mmonga na kumteleka bwina, muni vandu ava yati vilya na nene chakulya cha muhi.” <verse eid="GEN 43:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17" />Myimilila yula akakita ngati chealagaziwi. Akavapeleka vala vayehe kunyumba ya Yosefu.<verse eid="GEN 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18" />Pevavili mukupelekwa kunyumba ya Yosefu, vakayogopa, vakajovesana, “Tiletiwi kuni ndava ya mashonga gala geawuyisi mumagunila gitu petabweli lugendu lwa kutumbula muni apata chidetesela cha kutizangila na kutinyaga punda witu na kutukita vavanda vaki.” <verse eid="GEN 43:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19" />Ndava yeniyo vakamhambila myimilila wa nyumba ya Yosefu vakalongela nawu kuni vavi pamlyangu. <verse eid="GEN 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20" />Vakamjovela, “Chondi, mkulu! Tete tabweli penapa mala ya kutumbula kugula chakulya. <verse eid="GEN 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21" />Nambu kilu yila patahikili pandu pakugona, tawopwili magunila gitu, nambu kila mmonga aziwene mashonga gaki muligunila laki. Hinu tiwuyisi mashonga ginu. <verse eid="GEN 43:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22" />Mewa tigegili mashonga gangi ga kugulila chakulya. Timanyili lepi ndi yani mweavikili mashonga gala mumagunila gitu.”<verse eid="GEN 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23" />Yula myimilila akavayangula, “Mkoto kuvya na mtahu, amala kuyogopa. Chakaka Chapanga winu, Chapanga wa dadi winu, ndi mweavawuyisili mashonga mumagunila ginu. Nene napokili mashonga ginu.” Kangi akavaletela Simeoni, mlongo wavi.<verse eid="GEN 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24" />Myimilila yula akavapeleka vala vandu kunyumba ya Yosefu, akavapela manji ga kusamba magendele na kuvapela punda wavi manyahi. <verse eid="GEN 43:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25" />Vene vakatendekela njombi zavi za kumpela Yosefu, peihika muhi muni vayuwini kuvya yati vilya pamonga nayu. <verse eid="GEN 43:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26" />Yosefu peabweli kunyumba, vakamgotolela njombi zila zevavinazu, vakamgundamila mbaka pahi. <verse eid="GEN 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27" />Wu mwilama kangi akavakota, “Yula dadi winu mgogolo mwemwanijovili malovi gaki, iyendelela wuli? Wu, akona mumi?”<verse eid="GEN 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28" />Vakamyangula, “Mtumisi waku, dadi witu, akona ilama na avi mumi.” Kangi vakamgundamila kwa utopesa.<verse eid="GEN 43:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29" />Yosefu peayinwili mihu gaki na kumlola Benyamini, mbena waki, mwana wa nyina waki, akajova, “Akavakota mwenuyu ndi mlongo winu mdebe mwemwanijovili malovi gaki?” Kangi akajova, “Mwana vangu, Chapanga akumotisa!” <verse eid="GEN 43:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30" />Balapala Yosefu akahuma ndava mtima waki wamvinili kumlola mbena waki akagana kuvemba ndi akayingila kuchumba chaki na akavemba. <verse eid="GEN 43:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31" />Peamali kusamba pamihu paki, ahumili kuvala na kuni igangamala, akalagiza vavanda, valeta chakulya. <verse eid="GEN 43:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32" />Yosefu vakampela chakulya mwene, na valongo vaki vakapewa chakulya vene na Vamisili vavabwelili na vene valilili nga vene, ndava muni ndi yomeso kwa Vamisili kulya chakulya pamonga na Vaebulania. <verse eid="GEN 43:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33" />Valongo vaki Yosefu vatamili palongolo yaki kuwanangana na ntanga yavi, kuhuma wa mtumbula mbaka wa mwishu, ndi vakalolesana kwa kukangasa. <verse eid="GEN 43:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34" />Chakulya chavi chatoliwa kuhuma pameza ya Yosefu na kupelekwa kwavi, nambu Benyamini apewili mala mhanu neju ya chila chevapewili valogo vaki. Hinu, valili na kunywa na kuheka pamonga nayu.<verse eid="GEN 43:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44" />
  <para style="s">Chikombi cha madini ga feza chipatikana kwa Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1" />Kangi Yosefu akamlagiza yula myimilila wa nyumba yaki. “Memesa magunila ga vandu ava chakulya chevihotola kugega, kangi uvika mashonga ga kila mundu mumlomo wa ligunila laki. <verse eid="GEN 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2" />Kangi vika chikombi changu cha madini ga feza mumlomo wa ligunila la yula mdebe wa voha pamonga na mashonga gaki ga chakulya gaki.” Ndi akakita ngati Yosefu cheajovili. <verse eid="GEN 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3" />Kwapachili, vandu avo vakayidakiliwa kuwuka pamonga na punda zavi. <verse eid="GEN 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4" />Kwakona vangahika kutali kuhuma kubomani, Yosefu akamjovela mtangatila waki, “Hinu naha uvalanda vala vandu, peukuvakolela, uvakota, ‘Ndava kyani mulipisi uhakahu kwa ubwina? <verse eid="GEN 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5" />Ndava kyani muyivili chikombi cha mkulu wangu? Chenicho lepi cheinywela na kangi kuhengela kwa kulondola? Lijambu lenili lemhengili lihakau neju.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6" />Yula myimilila peavakolili akavajovela malovi aga. <verse eid="GEN 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7" />Nambu vene vakamkota, “Bambu, uvi na mana yoki kutujovela malovi ngati ago? Tete vatumisi vaku katu tihotola lepi kukita lijambu ngati lenilo! <verse eid="GEN 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8" />Kumbukayi, mkulu, mashonga getagakolili mumilomo ya magunila gitu tayiwuyisi kuhuma mulima wa Kanaani. Hinu yihotoleka wuli kavili tiyiva mashonga amala zahabu munyumba ya mkulu waku? <verse eid="GEN 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9" />Hinu, ngati apatikini mmonga witu avi na chikombi chenicho, na akomiwa, na tete vangi voha yati tivya vavanda va mkulu vaku.”<verse eid="GEN 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10" />Myimilila yula akajova, “Ena, na yivya ngati chaujovili. Yeyoha mweipatikana na chikombi icho, yati ivya mvanda wangu, nambu vangi voha yati mwilekelewa.” <verse eid="GEN 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11" />Hinu, kila mmonga akahelesa kanyata ligunia laki pahi na kuliwopola. <verse eid="GEN 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12" />Yula myimilila akagapekula magunila goha, itumbula kwa mvaha wavi na kumalisila na la mdebe neju. Chikombi chapatikini muligunia la Benyamini. <verse eid="GEN 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13" />Penapo vakapapula nyula zavi kwa ngolongondi. Kila mmonga wavi akamgegesa punda waki mzigu waki, vakawuya kumujini.<verse eid="GEN 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14" />Yuda na vahaja pevahikili nyumbani kwa Yosefu mwene avi bahapo, voha vakamgundamila pahi kwa utopesa. <verse eid="GEN 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15" />Yosefu akavajovela, “Ndi lijambu gani lenili lemkitili? Mumanyi lepi kuvya mundu ngati nene ihotola kumanya kwa kulondola?”<verse eid="GEN 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16" />Yuda akamyangula, “Tikujovela kyani mkulu? Tijova kyani kulangisa tibudili lepi? Chapanga agagubukwili mabudilu gitu, tete tavoha hinu ndi vavanda vaku tete pamonga na yula amweapatikini na chikombi.”<verse eid="GEN 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17" />Nambu Yosefu akajova, “Mwe! Nene nihotola lepi kukita chenicho! Yula ndu mweipatikana na chikombi changu ndi yati ivya mvanda vangu. Nyenye vangi voha muwuyayi kwa uteke kwa dadi winu.”<verse eid="GEN 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda akumkengelela Benyamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18" />Ndi Yuda akamhambila Yosefu na kumjovela, “Mkulu, nikuyupa, unimyidakila nene mtangatila waku, chondi mkulu wangu niyidakila nilongela padebe veve, nikuyupa neju ukoto kuniyomela nene mvanda waku, muni ukulu weuvi nawu uwanangana na Falao mwene. <verse eid="GEN 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19" />Mkulu wavakotili vatumisi waku wu, dadi witu akona mumi na muvi na mlongo yungi? <verse eid="GEN 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20" />Tete takuyangwili kuvya ‘Tivi na dadi, ndi mgogolo, na tivi na mbena witu yungi, mwenuyu dadi witu amvelikwi peavi mgogolo, mhaja waki afwili, na mwenuyo mdebe ndi nga mwene mweasigalili kwa nyina waki, na dadi witu akumgana neju msongolo uyo.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21" />Mkulu watilagizi tete vatumisi vaku kumleta uyo mdebe witu muni umlola. <verse eid="GEN 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22" />Takujovili kuvya uyo msongolo ihotola lepi kulekana na dadi waki, ndava akamleka dadi waki yati ifwa. <verse eid="GEN 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23" />Nambu veve mkulu ukatijovela kuvya ngati tibwelili lepi na mlongo witu mdebe, yati mukunilola lepi pamihu pangu kavili.”<verse eid="GEN 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24" />“Petawuyili kunyumba kwa dadi, mtumisi waku, tamjovili gala geutilagizi. <verse eid="GEN 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25" />Dadi witu atijovili, ‘Mhamba ku Misili mkagula chakulya chingi.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26" />Nambu tamjovili, ‘Tihotola lepi kuhelela ku Misili mbaka tihamba mlongo witu mdebe. Ngati ihamba lepi na tete tihotola lepi kupokelewa na mundu yula.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27" />Hinu dadi witu, mtumisi waku, atijovili, ‘Mumanyili kuvya mdala wangu Laheli anivelekili vana vavili: <verse eid="GEN 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28" />Mmonga ayagili, na nene nikajova, “Chakaka apapuliwi hipandi hipandi na chinyama cha kudahi.” Na nene nimuwene lepi kutumbula lukumbi lwenulo. <verse eid="GEN 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29" />Ngati mukumtola mwenuyu mewa kuhuma kwangu, akapatwa na gahakau hinu, yati mukunikoma kwa mvinisu muugogolo wangu.’<verse eid="GEN 44:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30" />Mkulu ndava yeniyo, nikamuwuyila dadi wangu mtumisi waku changali msongolo uyu, kuni wumi wa dadi wihuvalila wumi wa msongolo uyu, <verse eid="GEN 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31" />akalola kuvya msongolo avi lepi pamonga na tete, yati ifwa! Chenicho tete vatumisi vaku, yati tikumkoma dadi witu kwa mvinisu wa muugogolo waki. <verse eid="GEN 44:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32" />Mewawa, namtumisi waku namjovili dadi wangu kuvya yati nikumyangalila msongolo uyu, namjovili, ‘Ngati nimuyisi lepi Benyamini kwaku, mbunu uvya kwangu magono goha.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33" />Hinu, veve mkulu, nikuyupa, nene mtumiosi waku, nisigalila, nivya mvanda waku pahala pa msongolo uyu. Mulekayi mwene awuyayi kunyumba pamonga na valongo vaki. <verse eid="GEN 44:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34" />Hinu nihotola wuli kumuwuyila dadi wangu changali uyu msongolo? Nihotola lepi kukangamala kugalola mambu gahakau gegakumkolela dadi wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 44:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45" />
  <para style="s">Yosefu akujimanyisa kwa vahaja vaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1" />Penapo Yosefu ahotwili lepi kusindimala kangi mumtima waki palongolo ya vandu vevayimili palongolo yaki, akajova kwa lwami luvaha, akajova, “Muhamba kuvala!” Ndi pavi lepi mundu yeyoha mwenumo Yosefu peajimanyis kwa valongo vaki. <verse eid="GEN 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2" />Yosefu avembili kwa lwami luvaha hati Vamisili vakamyuwana, mewawa vandu va munyumba ya Falao vakamuyuwana. <verse eid="GEN 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3" />Yosefu akavajovela valongo vaki, “Nene ndi Yosefu. Wu, dadi wangu akona mumi?” Nambu valongo vaki pavayuwini chenicho, vakenyemwiki na kuyogopa neju vahotwili lepi kumyangula. <verse eid="GEN 45:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4" />Yosefu akavajovela valongo vaki, “Chondi, mhegelela papipi na nene.” Pevamhegalili, akavajovela, “Nene ndi mlongo winu Yosefu, yula mwemwamugulisi ku Misili. <verse eid="GEN 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5" />Nambu hinu mkoto kuviniswa mitima amala kuyomelana mwavene kwa kunigulisa kwenuku. Chapanga anitumili nivalongolela nyenye muni nisangula wumi wa vandu. <verse eid="GEN 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6" />Wenuwu ndi mwaka wa pili ndu wa njala pamulima, na yakona miyaka mhanu yeyigelekela vandu yati vilima lepi amala kubena. <verse eid="GEN 45:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7" />Chapanga anitumili penapa nivalongolela, muni nivavikila chakulya na kukita viveleku vinu viyendelela kuvya mumi. <verse eid="GEN 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8" />Ndava yeniyo, lepi nyenye mwemniletili kwenuku, nambu ndi Chapanga. Ndi mweanikitili kuvya ngati dadi wa Falao, myimilila wa nyumba yaki yoha na mtalalila wa mulima woha wa Misili.”<verse eid="GEN 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9" />“Hinu, mkita kanyata, mhamba kwa dadi wangu na kumjovela Yosefu, mwana vaku, ijova. ‘Chapanga anikitili kuvya mkulu wa mulima woha wa Misili. Hinu, ubwela kanyata kwangu. <verse eid="GEN 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10" />Na veve yati witama pamulima wa Gosheni uvya papipi na nene, veve na vana vaku na vajukulu vaku na ng'ombi zaku misambi yaku ya mambelele gaku na mene zaku, pamonga vyoha vyeuvili navyu. <verse eid="GEN 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11" />Pewivya ku Gosheni nene yati nikuyangalila, ndava yakona yivi miyaka yingi mhanu yeyibwela ya njala. Ngati lepi, veve na nyumba yaku na voha veuvili nawu yati mwing'ahika na njala.’”<verse eid="GEN 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12" />Kangi Yosefu akajova, “Nyenye mwavene mulolili kwa mihu ginu na hati mlongo wangu Benyamini aniwene kwa mihu gaki kuvya ndi nene namwene Yosefu mwenilongela na nyenye. <verse eid="GEN 45:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13" />Mumjovela dadi wangu chenivili mkulu pamulima wa Misili, na mambu goha gemgawene. Muleta dadi wangu penapa.”<verse eid="GEN 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14" />Kangi Yosefu akamkumbatila Benyamini, mlongo waki, kuni ivemba, Benyamini mewa avembili, kuni vakumbatilini. <verse eid="GEN 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15" />Kuni akona ivemba, Yosefu akavakumbatila valongo vaki kwa uganu. Penapo ndi valongo vaki pevahotwili kulongela nayu.<verse eid="GEN 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16" />Malovi ago pegahikili panyumba ya nkosi, kuvya valongo va Yosefu vabwelili, zikamsangalusa neju Falao na watumisi vaki. <verse eid="GEN 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17" />Falao akamjovela Yosefu, “Vajovela valongo vaku, vavagegesa punda wavi mizigu vawuya mbaka pamulima wa Kanaani, <verse eid="GEN 45:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18" />vamleta penapa dadi winu na valongo vavi voha. Nene yati nikuvapela pandu pabwina neju pa mulima wa Misili, kwenuko yati mwilya chakulya chabwina kuhuma mundima ya mulima uwu. <verse eid="GEN 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19" />Mewawa muvajovela vatola mutuka ya kuhutwa na hinyama kuhuma Misili, ndava ya vana vinu na vadala vinu, mubwela na dadi winu. <verse eid="GEN 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20" />Mkotoka kuvya na mutahu ndava ya vindu vyemukuvileka, ndava muni vindu vyabwina pa mulima wa Misili yati vivya vinu.”<verse eid="GEN 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21" />Hinu vana va Isilaeli vakitili ngati chavalagizwi. Yosefu akavapela mutuka ya kuhutwa na hinyama, ngati Falao cheavalagizi, mewa avapeli chakulya cha munjila. <verse eid="GEN 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22" />Avapelili kila mmonga nyula zamupya, nambu Benyamini akampela vipandi miya zidatu vya madini ga feza, na nyula muhanu za kubadilisa. <verse eid="GEN 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23" />Mewawa Yosefu ampelekili dadi waki vindu ivi, punda kumi vagegili vindu vyabwina vya Misili, mapunda gadala kumi vagegili mabenuna na mabumunda na vyakulya vingi vya mulugendu. <verse eid="GEN 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24" />Hinu, Yosefu akalagana na valongo vaki. Pevawukayi avabesili akajova, “Mkoto kutovana munjila!”<verse eid="GEN 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25" />Vakahuma ku Misili na kuwuya kunyumba ya dadi wavi Yakobo, ku mulima wa Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 45:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26" />Vakamjovela dadi wavi, “Yosefu akona mumi! Mwene ndi mtalila wa mulima woha wa Misili!” Penapo dadi wavi akahutusa mihu kwa kukangasa, muni ahotwili lepi kusadika malovi gavi.<verse eid="GEN 45:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27" />Nambu, pevamjovili goha gevalagazizwi na Yosefu na peawene mutuka yeapelekiwi na Yosefu kumtola, mtima waki ukasangaluka neju. <verse eid="GEN 45:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28" />Isilaeli akajova, “Hinu nisadiki, mwana vangu Yosefu akona mumi! Yati nihamba nikamlole kwakona nangafwa.”<verse eid="GEN 45:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo ihamba ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1" />Ndi Isilaeli akatola vindu vyaki vyoha akatumbula lugendu kuhamba ku Misili. Peahikili Beeli Sheba, akamuwusila luteta Chapanga wa Isaka, dadi waki. <verse eid="GEN 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2" />Chapanga akalongela na Isilaeli mumaono kilu, akamkemela, “Yakobo! Yakobo!” Yakkabo akayidika, “Ee nikuyuwana.”<verse eid="GEN 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3" />Chapanga akamjovela, “Nene ndi Chapanga, Chapanga wa dadi waku. Ukoto kuyogopa kuhamba ku Misili, pewivya kwenuko, ndava muni yati nikukukita uvya mulima uvaha. <verse eid="GEN 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4" />Nene namwene yati nihamba pamonga na veve kwenuko ku Misili na kukuwuyisa uku. Pewifwa, Yosefu yati ivya pamonga veve.”<verse eid="GEN 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5" />Hinu, Yakobo akawuka Beeli Sheba. Vana vaki vakamtola mwene na vana vavi vadebe pamonga na vadala vavi mumutuka zila yeapeliki Falao kumtola. <verse eid="GEN 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6" />Vatolili mewa mifuya na vindu vyevapatili pamulima wa Kanaani, vakahamba ku Misili. Yakobo ahambili na vachiveleku vaki voha, <verse eid="GEN 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7" />vana vaki na vajukulu va chigosi na vachidala, voha avaletili pamulima wa Misili.<verse eid="GEN 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8" />Vachiveleku va Isilaeli vevahambili ku Misili pamonga nayu vavi Leubeni, mvelekwa waki mtumbula, <verse eid="GEN 46:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9" />na vana va Leubeni vavi Henoki na Palu na Hesiloni na Kami. <verse eid="GEN 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10" />Vana va Simeoni vavi Yemueli na Yamini na Ohadi na Yakini na Sohali na Shauli mweavelikwi na mdala Mkanaani. <verse eid="GEN 46:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11" />Vana va Lawi vavi Gelishoni na Kohati pamonga na Melali. <verse eid="GEN 46:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12" />Vana va Yuda vavi Eli na Onani na Shela na Pelesi na Zela. Nambu Eli na Onani vafwili kumulima wa Kanaani. Vana va Pelesi vavi Hesiloni na Hamuli. <verse eid="GEN 46:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13" />Vana Isakali vavi Tola na Puva na Yashubu na Shimloni. <verse eid="GEN 46:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14" />Vana va Zebuluni vavi Seledi na Eloni na Yaleeli. <verse eid="GEN 46:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15" />Venavo ndi vana Lea amvelakili Yakobo kula Padan-alamu pamonga na Dina msikana waki. Jumula ya vacvhiveleku va Lea vavi selasini na vadatu.<verse eid="GEN 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16" />Vana va Gadi vavi Sifioni na Hagi na Shuni na Esiboni na Eli na Alodi na Aleli. <verse eid="GEN 46:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17" />Vana va Asheli vavi Imna na Ishiva na Ishivi na Belia na mlumbu wavi Sela. Na vana va Belia vavi Hebeli na Malkieli. <verse eid="GEN 46:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18" />Ava kumi na sita ndi vavi ndi vajukulu va Yakobo na Zilipa, mvanda wa chidala Labani ampelili Lea, msikana waki.<verse eid="GEN 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19" />Laheli amvelekili Yakobo vana vavili Yosefu na Benyamini. <verse eid="GEN 46:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20" />Misili kula, Asenati msikana wa Potifela, mweavi mteta wa muji wa Oni, amvelekili Yosefu vana vavili Manase na Eflaimu. <verse eid="GEN 46:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21" />Vana va Benyamini vavi Bela na Bekeli na Ashbeli na Gela na Naamani na Ehi na Loshi na Mupimu na Hupimu na Alidi. <verse eid="GEN 46:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22" />Vandu ava kumi na mcheche ndi vana na vajukulu va Laheli veamvelekili Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 46:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23" />Mwana Dani avi Hushimu. <verse eid="GEN 46:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24" />Vana va Nafutali vavi Yaseeli na Guni na Yeseli na Shilemu. <verse eid="GEN 46:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25" />Venava saba ndi vana na vajukulu va Bilha mvanda wa chidala, veamvelekili Yakobo, yula Labani ampeli msikana waki Laheli.<verse eid="GEN 46:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26" />Jumula ya vachiveleku va Yakobo veahambili nawu ku Misili, changali kuvavalanga vadala va vana vaki, vavi vandu sitini na sita. <verse eid="GEN 46:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27" />Kula kumulima wa Misili Yosefu apatili vana vavili. Ndava yeniyo vandu voha va lukolo lwa Yakobo vevayingili mu Misili vavi sabini.<verse eid="GEN 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo nyumba yaki vihika ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28" />Yakobo akamlongolesa Yuda ahamba kwa Yosefu kumuyupa vakonganeka ku Gosheni, na vene pevahikili pamulima wa Gosheni, <verse eid="GEN 46:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29" />Yosefu akakwela mutuka wewihutwaa na falasi, akahamba kumpokela Isilaeli, dadi waki, kula ku Gosheni. Peamhikili dadi waki, amkumbatili na kuvemba kwa lukumbi lutali. <verse eid="GEN 46:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30" />Isilaeli akamjovela Yosefu, “Hati nikafwayi hinu chindu lepi ndava muni nipawene pamihu paku na kumanya kuvya veve wakona mumi!”<verse eid="GEN 46:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31" />Kangi Yosefu akavajovela valongo vaki na vandu va munyumba ya dadi waki, “Nihamba kumjovela Falao kuvya valongo vangu na vandu va munyumba ya dadi wangu voha vevavi kumulima wa Kanaani vabwelili kwangu. <verse eid="GEN 46:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32" />Yati nikumjovela kuvya nyenye ndi vadimaji muni mwidima mifuya, na kuvya mubweli pamonga na mambelele na mene na ng'ombi na vindu vinu vyoha. <verse eid="GEN 46:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33" />Hinu, Falao akavakemela na kuvakota, ‘Lihengu linu ndi loki?’ <verse eid="GEN 46:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34" />Mjova, ‘Mkulu, tete vatumisi vaku, ndi vafuya kuhuma uwana witu, ngati chevavili vagogo vitu,’ Mjova genago muni muyidikiliwayi kutama pamulima wa Gosheni.” Yosefu ajovili chenicho ndava Vamisili vakuvavenga vadimaji.<verse eid="GEN 46:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1" />Hinu Yosefu akahamba kwa Falao, akamjovela, “Dadi wangu na valongo vangu pamonga na mambelele na ng'ombi na vindu vyavi vyoha, vabwelili kuhuma mulima wa Kanaani. Hinu vavi ku Gosheni.” <verse eid="GEN 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2" />Yosefu avatolili valongo vaki mhanu, akavamanyisa kwa Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3" />Falao akavakota, “Lihengu linu ndi loki?” Vakamyangula, “Mkulu, tete vatumisi vaku ndi vafuya, ngati chevavi vagogo vitu.” <verse eid="GEN 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4" />Kangi vakamjovela Falao, “Tete vatumisi vako tibweli kutama ngati vayehe pamulima uwu ndava muni njala ndi yikali kula Kanaani na mifuya yitu kawaka chakulya. Hinu, mkulu, tikuyupa, tete vatumisi vaku utiyidikila kutama pandu pa Gosheni.” <verse eid="GEN 47:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5" />Falao akamjovela Yosefu, “Dadi waku na valongo vaku vakubwelili veve. <verse eid="GEN 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6" />Mulima woha wa Misili uvi pahi yaku, vapela dadi waku na valongo vako pandu pabwina neju pamulima uwu. Uvaleka vatama pandu pa Gosheni. Na ngati ukuvamanya vandu vevimanya bwina mambu ga mifuya pagati yavi, vahagula vavyayi vayimilila wa mifuya yangu.”<verse eid="GEN 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7" />Kangi Yosefu akamleta dadi waki Yakobo kummanyisa kwa Falao, na mwene Yakobo akammotisa Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8" />Falao akamkota Yakobo, “Uvi na miyaka yilinga?”<verse eid="GEN 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9" />Yakobo akamyangula, “Nivi na miyaka miya yimonga na selasini ndi yenavili mulugendu lukumbi lwoha kuhuma pandu mbaka pandu pangi. Ndi miyaka yeniyo yidebe yimemi mang'aiso yilandana lepi na miyaka yevatamili vadadi vangu mulugendu lwavi.” <verse eid="GEN 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10" />Kangi Yakobo akamotisa Falao, akawuka. <verse eid="GEN 47:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11" />Hinu, Yosefu akavapela dadi waki na valongo vaki pandu pepikewa Lamesesi, pandu pana ludaka lwabwina pamulima wa Misili, pandu penapo vapewili pavyayi pavi, ngati chamlagizi Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12" />Yosefu akavya akuvapela chakulya dadi waki na valongo vaki na vandu voha munyumba ya dadi waki kuwanangana na mvalangu wa vandu hati vana.<verse eid="GEN 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Njala yivaha pa mulima wa Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13" />Mwanakandahi chakulya chavili lepi pamulima woha. Njala yivaha yavili yikali neju hati yikavakita vandu voha pamulima wa Misili na ya Kanaani kuganda. <verse eid="GEN 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14" />Yosefu akatola mashonga goha ga mulima wa Misili na Kanaani kuhuma mabenu gevagulisi, akazipeleka mashonga ago kunyumba ya unkosi wa Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15" />Vandu va ku Misili na Kanaani pevamalili mashonga gavi kwa kugulila chakulya, vakamuhambila Yosefu na kumjovela, “Utipela chakulya. Ndava kyani tifwayi palongolo ga mihu gaku? Mashoha gitu gamaliki.”<verse eid="GEN 47:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16" />Yosefu akavajovela, “Ngati mashonga ginu gamaliki, hinu munipela mifuya yinu, na nene yati nikuvapela chakulya.” <verse eid="GEN 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17" />Ndi vakamletela Yosefu mifuya yavi, falasi na ng'ombi na mambelele na mene na punda, na mwene akavapela chakulya. Mwaka wenuo Yosefu akavya kuvapela chakulya na vene vampela mifuya yavi yoha.<verse eid="GEN 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18" />Mwaka wewagelekili vakambwelela kavili na kumjovela, “Mkulu, uchakaka ndi kuvya masonga gitu goha gamaliki, na hinyama hitu ndi yavi yaku. Hinu, mkulu, tete vatumisi vaku tivi lepi na chochoha chetihotola kukupela manya nga makakala gitu na migunda yitu. <verse eid="GEN 47:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19" />Ndava kyani tete tifwa palongolo ga mihu gaku na kuyileka migunda yitu? Utigula tete pamonga na migunda yitu, tete na migunda yitu tivya va Falao. Tipela chakulya, muni tokotoka kufwa, utipela na mbeyu ndava ya migunda yikotoka kuvya waka.”<verse eid="GEN 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20" />Chenicho Yosefu akamgulila mulima woha wa Misili uvya waki Falao. Kila Mmisili yamganili kugulisa mgunda waki, ndava ya njala cheyavili yikali. Mulima woha ukavya wa Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21" />Yosefu akavakita vandu kuvya vavanda, kuhuma upandi mmonga mbaka upandi wungi wa mulima wa Misili. <verse eid="GEN 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22" />Ndima ndi Yosefu yangaigula ndi yila yeyavili ya vamteta. Venavo vagulisi lepi ndima yavi muni vavii na chakulya chamahele kuhuma mumashonga gevapewili na Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23" />Yosefu akavajovela vandu, “Mlola, nimali kuvagula nyenye mwavoha na migunda yinu kuvya va Falao. Yati mwipewa mbeyu na nyenye yati mwimija migunda yinu. <verse eid="GEN 47:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24" />Lukumbi lwa mabenu, yati mukumpela Falao lilundu limonga mukila malundu muhanu. Malundu mcheche gegisigalila yati givya mbeyu na chakulya ndava yinu na vandu va munyumba zinu na vana vinu.”<verse eid="GEN 47:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25" />Vakamyangula, “Mkulu, uhusangwili wumi witu, utihengili lipyana laku, tete yati tivya vavanda va Falao.” <verse eid="GEN 47:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26" />Chenichi ndi Yosefu avikili lilagizu limonga lelivi mbaka lelu pamulima wa Misili, lilundu limonga mumalundu muhanu yati livya la Falao. Migunda ya vamteta ndu ndi yaguliwi lepi na kuvya ya Falao.<verse eid="GEN 47:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malovi gamwishu ga Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27" />Hinu, vandu va Isilaeli vakatama pandu pa Gosheni pamulima wa Misili. Kwenuko, wakapata vindu vyamahele, wakavelekana na kuyonjengeseka neju. <verse eid="GEN 47:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28" />Yakobo atamili pamulima wa Misili kwa miyaka kumi na saba. Wumi waki woha weatamili wavili miyaka miya yimonga na alubaini na saba. <verse eid="GEN 47:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29" />Lukumbi lwa lifwa lwaki Isilaeli pewahegalili, akamkemela mwana waki Yosefu, akamjovela, “Ngati chakaka ukunigana, vika chiwoko chaku pagati ya mawondo gangu, unilapila kuvya ukunikitila kwa utopesa na kuvya msadikika kwangu. Ukoto kunizika uku ku Misili, <verse eid="GEN 47:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30" />ndi unigoneka pamonga na vagogo vangu. Nitola kuhuma ku Misili, ukanizika kumatinda gavi.” Yosefu akamyangula, “Yati nikita ngati cheujovili.”<verse eid="GEN 47:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31" />Yakobo akamjovela, “Nilapila!” Yosefu akamlapila. Kangi Isilaeli akang'anamuka upandi wa kumutu wa chitanda chaki na kumgundamila Chapanga.<verse eid="GEN 47:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo akuvamotisa Efulaimu na Manase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1" />Pagenago Yosefu akajoviwa kuvya dadi waki ndi mtamu, ndava yeniyo akavatola vana vaki vavili Manase na Efulaimu, akahamba nawu kwa dadi waki. <verse eid="GEN 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2" />Yakobo peajoviwi kuvya mwana waki Yosefu abwelili kumlola, akajikangamisa kuyinuka, akatama pachitanda. <verse eid="GEN 48:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3" />Yakobo akamjovela Yosefu, “Chapanga mweavi na Makakala anihumalili penakavili kula ku Luzu kumulima wa Kanaani, akanimotisa. <verse eid="GEN 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4" />Anijovili, ‘Lola, yati nikupela vana vamahele, na vajukulu vaku yati vibwela kuvya milima yamahele. Na nene yati nikuvapela vajukulu vaku, vayitalalila magono goha gangali mwisu.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5" />Yakobo akayendelela kujova, “Vana vaku vavili veuvapatili apa pa Misili kwakona nangafwa, ndi vana vangu. Efulaimu na Manase yati vivya vangu ngati chevavili Lubeni na Simeoni. <verse eid="GEN 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6" />Nambu vana veukuvapata mwanakandahi yati vivya vaku, na uhali wavi yati vakuupata kuhuma kwa vavili ava Efulaimu na Manase. <verse eid="GEN 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7" />Penawuyili kuhuma Padani, kuni nivi ngolongondi Laheli afwili pamulima wa Kanaani petavili mulugendu takona tigenda, papipi kuhika Eflati. Ndava yeniyo namzikili kwenuko, pamuhana ya njila yeyihamba Efulati, ndi ukemiwa Betelehemu.”<verse eid="GEN 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8" />Isilaeli peavawene vana va Yosefu, akamkota, “Ava ndi vayani?”<verse eid="GEN 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9" />Yosefu akamyangula dadi waki, “Ava ndi vana vangu veanipeli Chapanga penakavili kuni.” Isilaeli akajova, “Chondi, uvaleta papipi nipata kuvamotisa.”<verse eid="GEN 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10" />Mihu ga Isilaeli galola lepi bwina ndava ya ugogolo. Hinu, Yosefu akavahegelesa vana vaki papipi na dadi waki, na mwene akavakumbatila kwa uganu. <verse eid="GEN 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11" />Kangi Isilaeli akamjovela Yosefu, “Nahuvalili lepi kupalola pamihu paku kavili, nambu, kumbi, Chapanga anitangatili hati kuvalola vana vaku!” <verse eid="GEN 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12" />Penapo Yosefu akavawusa vana vaki kuhuma mumafugamilu ga dadi waki, kangi akagundama kwa utopesa.<verse eid="GEN 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13" />Yosefu akavatola vana vavili, Efulaimu muchiwoko chaki cha kulyela, kuyelekela muchiwoko cha kumangeya cha Isilaeli, na Manase muchiwoko chaki cha kumangeya, kuyelekela muchiwoko cha kulyela cha Isilaeli, akavahegelesa papipi na gogo wavi. <verse eid="GEN 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14" />Nambu Isilaeli akagapisanisa mawoko gaki. Chiwoko chaki cha kulyela akachivika pamutu wa Efulaimu, mweavili mdebe, na chiwoko chaki cha kumangeya akachivika pamutu wa Manase, mweavii mvaha. <verse eid="GEN 48:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15" />Ndi Isilaeli akammotisa Yosefu, akajova,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">“Chapanga wa vadadi vangu Ibulahimu na Isaka Mwevamuyidakili muwumi wavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">Chapanga mweanilongwisi muwumi wangu mbaka lelu, ndi avamotisa.<verse eid="GEN 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16" />Na mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga mweanisangwili kuhuma mu mang'aiso goha, na avamotisa vasongolo ava!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">Vakemiwa kwa lihina langu na kwa mahina ga vagogo vangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">Ibulahimu na Isaka, na vavyayi na vana vamahele na vajukulu vamahele.”<verse eid="GEN 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17" />Yosefu peawene kuvya dadi waki avikili chiwoko chake cha kulyela pamutu wa Efulaimu aganiswi lepi. Hinu, akachitola chiwoko cha dadi waki, kuhuma pamutu wa Efulaimu achivika pamutu wa Manase. <verse eid="GEN 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18" />Yosefu akamjovela dadi waki, “Lepi, dadi! Mwenuyu apa ndi mvelekewa wa kutumbula. Chondi, uvika chiwoko chaku cha kulyela pamutu waki.”<verse eid="GEN 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19" />Nambu dadi waki akabela, akajova, “Nimanyili, wa mwana wangu, nimanyili. Vana va Manase mewa yati vivya mulima uvaha na vevimanyikana neju. Pamonga na ago, mlongo waki mdebe yati ivya mkulu kuliku mwene, na vachiveleku vaki yati vivya milima yamahele.”<verse eid="GEN 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20" />Hinu, Isilaeli akavamotisa ligono lenilo, ijova, “Vaisilaeli yati vihengela mahina ginu kuvamotisa, yati vijova, ‘Chapanga akukitila gabwina ngati Efulaimu na Manase!’” Kwa kukita chenicho Isilaeli amvikili Efulaimu palongolo ya Manase.<verse eid="GEN 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21" />Kangi Isilaeli akamjovela Yosefu, “Ngati chewiwona, nene nivi papipi kufwa. Pamonga na ago, Chapanga yati ivya pamonga na nyenye, na kuvawuyisa pamulima wa vadadi vinu. <verse eid="GEN 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22" />Mewawa, nikupelili veve mlima wa Shekemu na nivapelili lepi valongo vaku, mulima wula weuna ludaka lwabwina wenavanyagili Vaamoli kwa kutovana navu kwa upanga wangu na nduta yangu.”<verse eid="GEN 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo akuvamotisa vana vaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1" />Yakobo akavakemela vana vaki, akajova, “Mubwela pamonga nivajovela mambu gegakuvakolela magono gegibwela.”<verse eid="GEN 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2" />“Mbwela pamonga myuwana, nyenye vana va Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:2">muniyuwanilayi nene Isilaeli, dadi winu.”<verse eid="GEN 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3" />“Veve Leubeni ndi mvelekewa wangu wa kutumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">likakala langu na ulangisu wa usongolo wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">Veve ukuvapita valongo vaku kwa ukulu na makakala.”<verse eid="GEN 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4" />Veve ngati manji gamahele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">Nambu wivya wa kutumbula kavili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">muni wagonili na mweavili ngati mdala wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">uchitopisi lepi chitanda cha dadi waku!<verse eid="GEN 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5" />“Simioni na Lawi ndi valongo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:5">Vindu vyavi vya kukomanela ngondo vihengela kukita chitututu.”<verse eid="GEN 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6" />Nambu nene yati niwungana nawu lepi muhuhakau wavi, yati niwungana nawu lepi mumingonganu yavi, muni kwa ligoga lavi vamkomili mundu na kwa mang'ang'ala gavi vadumwili ng'ombi miseketa.<verse eid="GEN 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7" />Nikulipela likoto ligoga lavi muni likali neju, na ligoga lavi langali lipyana. Yati nikuvagava pamulima wa Yakobo, yati nikuvadandasa pamulima wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8" />“Veve Yuda, valongo vaku yati vakukulumba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">Makoko vaku yati ukuvahotola kungondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">na valongo vaku yati vakugundamila kwa utopesa.”<verse eid="GEN 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9" />Veve Yuda, mwana vangu ndi ngati mwanalihimba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">mweapatili kuzingila na kuwuya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">Ngati lihimba lijitalambula na kugona pahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">lihimba lidala lelivi na makakala, yani mweilinga kumyumusa?<verse eid="GEN 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10" />Ulongosi waku yati umalika lepi mu Yuda, na vachiveleku vaku yati vilongosa magono goha mbaka peibwela yula mtalalila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">ndonga ya ulongosi pamagendelu gaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">mbaka peibwela yula ndi waki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">na vandu yati vakumyidakila.<verse eid="GEN 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11" />Yati ikunga punda waki mumzabibu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">na mwanapunda waki mumzabibu wa bwina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">Yati ichapa nyula zaki mudivayi ndava avi nayu yamahele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">na ichapa magwanda gaki mudivayi yidung'u.<verse eid="GEN 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12" />Mihu gaki ndi gadung'u kwa kunywa divayi na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:12">minu gaki ndi gamsopi kwa kunywa mavele.<verse eid="GEN 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13" />“Zebuluni yati itama pandu pambwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">mbwani yaki yati yivya pandu pauyegesa watu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">Mulima waki yati wibakana na Sidoni.”<verse eid="GEN 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14" />“Isakali ndi ngati punda mweavi na makakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:14">mweakujigonesa pagati ya mizigu yaki.<verse eid="GEN 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15" />Peakupawona kuvya pandu penapo pabwina kupumulila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">na kuvya ndi mulima wa kuganisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">yati iyinamisa mugongo waki kugega mzigu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">yati ivya mvanda lihengu lelinonopa.”<verse eid="GEN 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16" />“Dani yati ivya muhamula mbwina kwa vandu vaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:16">ngati mmonga wa makabila ga Isilaeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17" />Yati ivya ngati liyoka munjila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">liyoka lelivi na sumu pamuhana ya njila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">leliluma vikanyatilu vya falasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">na mkwela falasi igwa njanja.”<verse eid="GEN 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18" />“Veve Bambu Chapanga, nilindila unisangula!.”<verse eid="GEN 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19" />“Gadi yati izangiwa na vanyagaji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:19">nambu mwene yati akuvalanda mumbele na kuvatova.”<verse eid="GEN 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20" />“Ndima ya Asheli yati yihumisa mabenu gamahele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:20">na mwene yati akumpela nkosi chakulya cheakuchigana.”<verse eid="GEN 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21" />“Nafutali ndi ngati paa mwealekeliwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:21">mweiveleka vana vabwina.”<verse eid="GEN 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22" />“Yosefu ndi ngati mkongo wewipambika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">mkongo wewipambika pamuhana ya chinyepa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">mambanda gaki gigubika muluwumba.”<verse eid="GEN 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23" />Makoko vaki yati vakumzangila neju,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:23">vakumtagila migoha na kumung'aha neju.<verse eid="GEN 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24" />Nambu upinde waki wakona usindimala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">na mawoko gaki gapewi makakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">kwa uhotola wa Mweavi na Makakala wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">ndava ya Mdimaji, Mlonda wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25" />Ndava muni Chapanga dadi waku yati akutangatila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">Chapanga mweavi na makakala yati akumotisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">upatayi mota za fula kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">mota za manji kuhuma pahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">mota za vadala vaveleka vana vamahele na kuvya mifuya yamahele.<verse eid="GEN 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26" />Dadi waku yati akumotisa kuliku mota zezihuma muvidunda vya kadeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">vindu vyabwina kuhuma muvidunda vya magono goha, Mota zenizo ndi zivya pamutu wa Yosefu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">pachiwungi chaki mwene mweahaguliwi na valongo vaki.<verse eid="GEN 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27" />“Benyamini ndi libwa likali la kudahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:27">lukela lilya cheazingili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:27">na kimii hugava vindu vyevikamuliwi kungondo.”<verse eid="GEN 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28" />Genago ndi makabila kumi na gavili ga Isilaeli, na ago ndi malovi geavajovili dadi wavi peavamotisi, kila mmonga wavi ngati cheaganikiwi.<verse eid="GEN 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo ifwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29" />Kangi Isilaeli akavalagiza vana vaki, “Nene papipi nifwa. Munizikayi pamonga na vadadi vangu mumbugu yeyivili kumgunda wa Efuloni wa likabila la Vahiti, <verse eid="GEN 49:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30" />kula Makipela, upandi welihumila lilanga la pamuji wa Mamle, pamulima wa Kanaani. Ibulahimu agulili mbugu na mgunda wenuo kwa Efuloni, wa likabila la Vahiti, livya laki la kuzikila. <verse eid="GEN 49:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31" />Kwenuko ndi kwevazikiwi Ibulahimu na mdala waki Sala, kwenuko ndi kwevazikiwi Isaka na mdala waki Lebeka, na kwenuko ndi kwenimzikili Lea. <verse eid="GEN 49:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32" />Mgunda wenuo na mbugu yaki laguliwi kwa Vahiti.” <verse eid="GEN 49:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33" />Yakobo peamalili kuvalagiza vana vaki, atalambwili magendelu gaki akagona pachitanda na kufwa.<verse eid="GEN 49:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1" />Penapo Yosefu akamgundamila dadi waki, akamkumbatila, akamvembela na kumbusu. <verse eid="GEN 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2" />Kangi, akavalagiza valamisa vaki vamnyala mtela Isilaeli dadi waki, muni akoto kuwola na vene vakakita chenicho. <verse eid="GEN 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3" />Lihengu lenilo la kunyala higa mtela lavii magono alobaini. Vamisili na vene vakakita malilu ga Yakobo kwa magono sabini.<verse eid="GEN 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4" />Pevamali kutinda, Yosefu akavajovela vandu va nyumba ya Falao, “Ngati mniyidakili palongolo yinu winu, chondi mulongela na Falao mumjovela naha, <verse eid="GEN 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5" />‘Dadi wangu peavili papipi kufwa, anilapakisi akajova, nivi papipi kufwa yikugana kunizika palitinda lenajihongolili pamulima wa Kanaani. Ndava yeniyo nikumuyupa anileka nihamba kumzika dadi wangu, kangi yati niwuya.’”<verse eid="GEN 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6" />Falao akayangula, “Hamba ukamzikayi dadi waku ngati cheakulapakisi.”<verse eid="GEN 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7" />Hinu, Yosefu akawuka kuhamba kumuzika dadi waki kuni alongosini na vatumisi voha va Falao, vagogo va nyumba ya Falao, pamonga na vachilongosi va vagogo va mulima wa Misili. <verse eid="GEN 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8" />Mewawa, Yosefu alongosini na vandu voha va munyumba yaki na valongo vaki na vala voha va munyumba ya dadi waki. Pamulima wa Gosheni vasigalili nga vana vavi ndu pamonga na mambelele na mene na ng'ombi zavi. <verse eid="GEN 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9" />Mewa vahambili na vakwela falasi na mutuka, wavili msambi uvaha neju.<verse eid="GEN 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10" />Pevahikili paluvanja lwa kuwulula mabenu wa Atadi, kumwambu ya mfuleni Yoludani, vamvembili kwa mvinisu uvaha, na Yosefu akamvembelela dadi waki mweafwili magono saba. <verse eid="GEN 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11" />Vakolonjinji va mulima wenuwo wa Kanaani, pevawene malilu gakitiki paluvanja lwa kuwululila mabenu wa Atadi, vakajova, “Malilu gala ga Vamisili, chakaka gavaha!” Ndava yeniyo, pandu pala pakemeliwi Abeli Mizilaimu, pavi kumwambu ya mfuleni Yoludani.<verse eid="GEN 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12" />Hinu vana va Yakobo vamkitili dadi wavi ngati cheavalagizi. <verse eid="GEN 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13" />Vagegili higa ya Yakobo mbaka kumulima wa Kanaani, vakamuzika mumbugu yeyivi kumgunda lelivi ku Makipela, kwelihumila lilanga la Mamle. Mbugu pamonga na mgunda wenuo Ibulahimu agulili kwa Efuloni wa likabila la Vahiti, muni pavya pandu paki pa kuzikila. <verse eid="GEN 50:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14" />Peamali kumuzika dadi waki, Yosefu awuyili ku Misili pamonga na valongo vaki na vandu voha vevalongosini nawu kuhamba kumzika dadi waki.<verse eid="GEN 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yosefu akuvahadila valongo vaki uteke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15" />Peamali kufwa dadi waki, valongo vaki Yosefu vakajovesana, vakajova “Pangi Yosefu yati akutivenga na kutilipisa gahakau goha getimukitili.” <verse eid="GEN 50:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16" />Ndava yeniyo vakampelekela Yosefu ujumbi, vakajova, “Dadi witu, kwakona angafwa, atilekili malagizu aga, <verse eid="GEN 50:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17" />Atijovili tikujovela naha, ‘Chondi ukoto kuvalipisa valongo vaku mabudilu gavi gahakau na mambu goha gevakukitili.’ Hinu chondi utilekekesa mabudilu na kuhoka kwetakukitili tete vatumisi va Chapanga wa dadi waku.” Yosefu peayuwini genago, avembili.<verse eid="GEN 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18" />Kangi valongo vaki vakambwelela, vakagundama mbaka pahi palongolo yaki, vakajova, “Lola, tete ndu vavanda vaku.”<verse eid="GEN 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19" />Nambu Yosefu akavajovela, “Mkoto kuyogopa, Wu, nene ndi Chapanga mweakuvahamula vandu? <verse eid="GEN 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20" />Nyenye mwaganili kunikitila uhakau, nambu Chapanga apangili gabwina muni vandu vamahele vapata kuvya mumi ngati chemwilola lelu. <verse eid="GEN 50:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21" />Hinu mkoto kuyogopa. Nene yati nikuvapela chakulya pamonga na vana vinu.” Ndi akavapolesa mitima na kujova nawu mbolimboli.<verse eid="GEN 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yosefu ifwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22" />Yosefu atamili pamulima wa Misili pamonga na vandu voha va munyumba ya dadi waki. Atamili miyaka miya yimonga na kumi. <verse eid="GEN 50:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23" />Yosefu avawene vana na vajukulu va mwana waki, Efulaimu, na mewa kuvapokela ngati vana vaki vana va Makili mwana wa Manase. <verse eid="GEN 50:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24" />Mwanakandahi Yosefu avajovili valongo vaki, “Nene hinu nivi papipi kufwa. Nambu Chapanga chakaka yati akuvabwelela kuvatangatila. Yati akuvawusa pamulima uwu na kuvapeleka pamulima weavahaidi Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo.” <verse eid="GEN 50:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25" />Kangi Yosefu akavajovela vana va Isilaeli, valapa, akajova, “Chapanga peakuvabwelela kuvatangatila, yikuvagana mgega mahupa gangu kuhuma kuni muwuka nayu.” <verse eid="GEN 50:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26" />Hinu Yosefu akafwa kula ku Misili, kuni avi na miyaka miya yimonga na kumi. Na vene vakaunyala higa yaki mtela ukoto kuwola, vakauvika mulisanduku kula ku Misili.<verse eid="GEN 50:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50" />
</usx>